#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
msgid ""
"Upload a label file (admin): checked as the app opens a file, then put into "
"the labels folder in one step."
msgstr ""
"Sildifaili üleslaadimine (admin): kontrollitakse nii, nagu rakendus faili "
"avab, ja pannakse siis ühe sammuga siltide kausta."

