"| `replace` | query | Asenda selle nimega silt. Vaikimisi `false` |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
msgid "Body: The content of a `.tavletta` file."
msgstr "Keha: `.tavletta`-faili sisu."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Status | Answer | Codes |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| 200 | Replaced (replace=true) |  |\n"
"| 201 | Added |  |\n"
"| 400 | Not a name for a new label: letters, digits, spaces and . _ - ( ) + , (up to 100), in the folder itself | `invalid_field`, `not_json` |\n"
"| 409 | A label of that name exists (send replace=true), jobs of it wait or print (label_in_use), or another program's print holds the file | `label_exists`, `label_in_use`, `label_locked` |\n"
"| 413 | Over `--max-body`, or a label too large to render | `too_large`, `label_too_large` |\n"
"| 422 | Not a label Tavletta can open | `label_not_label`, `label_newer`, `label_damaged`, `pages_not_allowed` |\n"
"| 507 | No space left in the labels folder | `not_saved` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Status | Vastus | Koodid |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| 200 | Asendatud (replace=true) |  |\n"
"| 201 | Lisatud |  |\n"
"| 400 | Uue sildi jaoks sobimatu nimi: tähed, numbrid, tühikud ja . _ - ( ) + , (kuni 100), kaustas endas | `invalid_field`, `not_json` |\n"
"| 409 | Selle nimega silt on olemas (saada replace=true), sildi töid ootab või prinditakse (label_in_use) või teise programmi print hoiab faili | `label_exists`, `label_in_use`, `label_locked` |\n"
"| 413 | Üle `--max-body` või liiga suur silt renderdamiseks | `too_large`, `label_too_large` |\n"
"| 422 | Silt, mida Tavletta ei saa avada | `label_not_label`, `label_newer`, `label_damaged`, `pages_not_allowed` |\n"
"| 507 | Siltide kaustas pole ruumi enam | `not_saved` |\n"

