#. type: Title #
#: docs/contribute.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Contribute"
msgstr "Osale"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/contribute.md
msgid ""
"Code, bug reports, translations and tests with other printers, cassettes and "
"label rolls are welcome."
msgstr ""
"Kood, veateated, tõlked ja testid teiste printerite, kassettide ja siltide "
"rullidega on teretulnud."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/contribute.md
msgid ""
"Issues and pull requests on [GitHub](https://github.com/joshii-h/tavletta) "
"are welcome, no Forgejo account needed. They are copied automatically to "
"[Forgejo](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta), the main "
"repository, with a link on GitHub. Review and merge happen there; your "
"commits are kept, so GitHub shows the pull request as merged. The discussion "
"can stay on GitHub.  With a Forgejo account you can contribute there "
"directly.  Details: [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/"
"tavletta/src/branch/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)."
msgstr ""
"Issued ja pull requestid [GitHubis](https://github.com/joshii-h/tavletta) on "
"teretulnud, Forgejo kontot pole vaja. Need kopeeritakse automaatselt "
"[Forgejosse](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta), "
"põhirepositooriumisse, koos lingiga GitHubis. Ülevaatus ja liitmine toimuvad "
"seal; sinu commitid säilivad, nii et GitHub näitab pull requesti liidetuna. "
"Arutelu võib jääda GitHubi. Forgejo kontoga saad osaleda otse seal. "
"Üksikasjad: [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/"
"src/branch/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/contribute.md
msgid "**App translations**: `tools/strings_<lang>.py`, see CONTRIBUTING."
msgstr "**Rakenduse tõlked**: `tools/strings_<lang>.py`, vaata CONTRIBUTING."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/contribute.md
msgid ""
"**This documentation**: `site/po/<lang>.po`, see [site/README.md](https://"
"git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/branch/main/site/README.md).  Names "
"of buttons and settings come from the app translation automatically."
msgstr ""
"**See dokumentatsioon**: `site/po/<lang>.po`, vaata [site/README.md](https://"
"git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/branch/main/site/README.md). "
"Nuppude ja seadete nimed tulevad automaatselt rakenduse tõlkest."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/contribute.md
msgid ""
"**Other printers**: printing goes through a backend interface; a new printer "
"is a new backend. The protocols of the supported printers are described in "
"[docs/](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/branch/main/docs), "
"one file per printer."
msgstr ""
"**Muud printerid**: printimine käib taustaprogrammi liidese kaudu; uus "
"printer on uus taustaprogramm. Toetatud printerite protokollid on "
"kirjeldatud kaustas [docs/](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/"
"branch/main/docs), üks fail printeri kohta."

#. type: Title #
#: docs/index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tavletta"
msgstr "Tavletta"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"Tavletta designs labels under Linux and prints them over the network or USB: "
"on label printers with endless tape or die-cut labels, and on office "
"printers, one label per page or on label sheets. It talks to each printer in "
"its own language."
msgstr ""
"Tavletta kujundab silte Linuxis ja prindib need võrgu või USB kaudu: "
"sildiprinteritel lõpmatu lindi või lõigatud siltidega ning "
"kontoriprinteritel, üks silt lehe kohta või sildilehtedel. See räägib iga "
"printeriga tema enda keeles."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"Tavletta is Romansh for a small tablet (from tavla, table/board). Pronounced "
"tav-LET-ta."
msgstr ""
"Tavletta on retoromaani keeles väike tahvel (sõnast tavla, laud/tahvel). "
"Hääldatakse tav-LET-ta."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"![Main window](media/main.png#only-light)  ![Main window](media/main-"
"dark.png#only-dark)"
msgstr ""
"![Põhiaken](media/main.png#only-light)  ![Põhiaken](media/main-dark.png#only-"
"dark)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"Text, images, [symbols](use.md), QR codes and barcodes of many types; "
"backgrounds printed edge to edge"
msgstr ""
"Tekst, pildid, [sümbolid](use.md), QR-koodid ja paljud vöötkoodide tüübid; "
"taustad prinditakse servast servani"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"[Text styles](use.md#text-style), [lines and shapes](use.md#shapes), and a "
"[free layout](use.md#free-layout) with each element at its own place; undo "
"and redo"
msgstr ""
"[Tekstistiilid](use.md#text-style), [jooned ja kujundid](use.md#shapes) ning "
"[vaba paigutus](use.md#free-layout), kus iga element asub oma kohal; võta "
"tagasi ja tee uuesti"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/index.md
msgid "Preview at print resolution: what you see is what is printed"
msgstr "Eelvaade printimise eraldusvõimega: mida näed, seda prinditakse"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/index.md
msgid "Endless tape as long as the content, or die-cut labels of any size"
msgstr "Lõpmatu lint sisu pikkuses või mis tahes suurusega lõigatud sildid"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"[Serial labels](serial.md): one label for each row of a CSV, ODS or XLSX "
"file; variables such as date and counter, and a command line"
msgstr ""
"[Seeriasildid](serial.md): üks silt iga CSV-, ODS- või XLSX-faili rea kohta; "
"muutujad nagu kuupäev ja loendur ning käsurida"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"[Label sheets](sheets.md) on office printers, and shipping labels from a "
"carrier's PDF"
msgstr ""
"[Sildilehed](sheets.md) kontoriprinteritel ning saatesildid vedaja PDF-ist"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"Finds the printer in the network and on USB, reads what is loaded and "
"explains printer problems in plain words"
msgstr ""
"Leiab printeri võrgust ja USB-lt, loeb, mis on laaditud, ning selgitab "
"printeri probleeme lihtsas keeles"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/index.md
msgid "A [print server](server.md) for other programs and AI assistants"
msgstr ""
"[Prindiserver](server.md) teistele programmidele ja tehisintellekti "
"assistentidele"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/index.md
msgid "27 languages, follows the light or dark mode of the desktop"
msgstr "27 keelt, järgib töölaua hele- või tumerežiimi"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"The supported printers and what each one can do are listed under [Printers]"
"(printer.md). Further printers can be added as a backend, see [Contribute]"
"(contribute.md)."
msgstr ""
"Toetatud printerid ja see, mida iga neist oskab, on loetletud jaotises "
"[Printerid](printer.md). Edasisi printereid saab lisada taustaprogrammina, "
"vaata [Osale](contribute.md)."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Paigalda"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Flatpak"
msgstr "Flatpak"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/index.md
msgid "Flathub is in preparation. Until then, build it yourself:"
msgstr "Flathub on ettevalmistamisel. Seni ehita see ise:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"git clone https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta.git && cd tavletta\n"
"flatpak install --user flathub org.gnome.Sdk//51 org.gnome.Platform//51\n"
"flatpak-builder --user --install --force-clean build-dir \\\n"
"    build-aux/flatpak/xyz.joshuahirsig.Tavletta.yml\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "install.sh"
msgstr "install.sh"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"Install the system packages, then run the script as your user (no root):"
msgstr ""
"Paigalda süsteemipaketid, seejärel käivita skript oma kasutajana (ilma "
"rootita):"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Distribution | Packages |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| Debian, Ubuntu | `python3-gi gir1.2-gtk-4.0 gir1.2-adw-1 python3-gi-cairo python3-venv gettext` |\n"
"| Fedora | `python3-gobject gtk4 libadwaita python3-cairo gettext` |\n"
"| Arch | `python-gobject gtk4 libadwaita python-cairo gettext` |\n"
"| Gentoo | `dev-python/pygobject gui-libs/gtk:4 gui-libs/libadwaita dev-python/pycairo sys-devel/gettext` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Distributsioon | Paketid |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| Debian, Ubuntu | `python3-gi gir1.2-gtk-4.0 gir1.2-adw-1 python3-gi-cairo python3-venv gettext` |\n"
"| Fedora | `python3-gobject gtk4 libadwaita python3-cairo gettext` |\n"
"| Arch | `python-gobject gtk4 libadwaita python-cairo gettext` |\n"
"| Gentoo | `dev-python/pygobject gui-libs/gtk:4 gui-libs/libadwaita dev-python/pycairo sys-devel/gettext` |\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"git clone https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta.git && cd tavletta\n"
"./install.sh\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"Uninstall: `./install.sh --uninstall` or `flatpak uninstall "
"xyz.joshuahirsig.Tavletta`.  Saved labels and templates are kept."
msgstr ""
"Eemaldamine: `./install.sh --uninstall` või `flatpak uninstall "
"xyz.joshuahirsig.Tavletta`. Salvestatud sildid ja mallid säilivad."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "First label"
msgstr "Esimene silt"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"Switch the printer on and choose it under [[ui:Printer model]]: a printer "
"found on USB or in the network (Bonjour) is at the top of the list. Tavletta "
"reads what is loaded: the tape width or the distance between the labels."
msgstr ""
"Lülita printer sisse ja vali see valikust [[ui:Printer model]]: USB kaudu "
"või võrgus (Bonjour) leitud printer on nimekirja ülaosas. Tavletta loeb, mis "
"on sisestatud: lindi laiuse või siltide vahekauguse."

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"Not found? Enter the address under [[ui:Host name or IP address]], e.g.  "
"`printer.local` or `192.168.1.50`. New printer: connect it to the network "
"first, see [Printers](printer.md)."
msgstr ""
"Ei leitud? Sisesta aadress väljale [[ui:Host name or IP address]], nt "
"`printer.local` või `192.168.1.50`. Uus printer: ühenda see esmalt võrku, "
"vaata [Printerid](printer.md)."

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/index.md
msgid "[[ui:Add]] text, an image or a code, then [[ui:Print]]."
msgstr "[[ui:Add]] tekst, pilt või kood, seejärel [[ui:Print]]."

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/index.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Save]] stores the label as `.tavletta` file, [[ui:Save as template…]] "
"adds it to [[ui:Templates]]."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Save]] salvestab sildi `.tavletta`-failina, [[ui:Save as template…]] "
"lisab selle jaotisse [[ui:Templates]]."

#. type: Title #
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Printers and troubleshooting"
msgstr "Printerid ja tõrkeotsing"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Choose the printer under [[ui:Printer model]]; each one has its own section "
"below. Printers Tavletta finds on USB and in the network come first in that "
"list, under [[ui:Found]], with their model: choosing one takes its model and "
"its address. The models follow under [[ui:All models]]. Tavletta looks for "
"them when the window opens and with [[ui:Search for printers]], every model "
"at the same time, in the background."
msgstr ""
"Vali printer valikust [[ui:Printer model]]; igaühel on all oma jaotis. "
"Printerid, mille Tavletta leiab USB kaudu ja võrgust, on selles nimekirjas "
"esimesena, jaotises [[ui:Found]], koos mudeliga: ühe valimine võtab selle "
"mudeli ja aadressi. Mudelid järgnevad jaotises [[ui:All models]]. Tavletta "
"otsib neid akna avamisel ja nupuga [[ui:Search for printers]], kõiki "
"mudeleid korraga, taustal."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "All printers { #common }"
msgstr "Kõik printerid { #common }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:No printer found]]: printer on and in the same network? The search "
"needs the Avahi service (installed on most desktops, any init system); "
"systemd-resolved alone resolves `.local` names but cannot search. Otherwise "
"enter the address under [[ui:Host name or IP address]]."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:No printer found]]: kas printer on sisse lülitatud ja samas võrgus? "
"Otsing vajab Avahi teenust (paigaldatud enamikule töölaudadest, mis tahes "
"init-süsteem); ainult systemd-resolved lahendab `.local` nimed, kuid ei oska "
"otsida. Muidu sisesta aadress väljale [[ui:Host name or IP address]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Printer not reachable]]: check the address, the printer may have a new "
"IP. Switch the printer off and on again. On USB: check the cable and search "
"again."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Printer not reachable]]: kontrolli aadressi, printeril võib olla uus "
"IP. Lülita printer välja ja uuesti sisse. USB-l: kontrolli kaablit ja otsi "
"uuesti."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"No permission for the USB port: your user needs to be in the group `lp`.  "
"Run `sudo usermod -aG lp $USER`, then log out and in again. NIIMBOT printers "
"use another group, see [NIIMBOT](#niimbot)."
msgstr ""
"Õigust USB-pordile pole: sinu kasutaja peab olema rühmas `lp`. Käivita `sudo "
"usermod -aG lp $USER`, seejärel logi välja ja uuesti sisse. NIIMBOT-"
"printerid kasutavad teist rühma, vaata [NIIMBOT](#niimbot)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"USB printer not found: check the cable, switch the printer on and wake it up "
"(a sleeping printer can drop off USB), then search again."
msgstr ""
"USB-printerit ei leita: kontrolli kaablit, lülita printer sisse ja ärata see "
"(magav printer võib USB-lt kaduda), seejärel otsi uuesti."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"\"The printer is busy\" on USB: only one program can use a USB printer at a "
"time. Close other label software, or wait until the running print is done."
msgstr ""
"\"The printer is busy\" USB-l: USB-printerit saab korraga kasutada ainult "
"üks programm. Sulge muu sildivarustus või oota, kuni käimasolev printimine "
"lõpeb."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Printer needs attention]]: the printer is reachable but reports a "
"problem, the text below says what to do. Clear it on the printer, then "
"[[ui:Refresh]]."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Printer needs attention]]: printer on kättesaadav, kuid teatab "
"probleemist; allolev tekst ütleb, mida teha. Kõrvalda see printeril, "
"seejärel [[ui:Refresh]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Content cut off at the edge or askew: increase the [[ui:Safety margin]]."
msgstr ""
"Sisu on servast ära lõigatud või viltu: suurenda väärtust [[ui:Safety "
"margin]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:content scaled down to fit]]: the content does not fit the label.  Make "
"the label longer or larger, use [[ui:Automatic length]] on tape, or shorten "
"the content."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:content scaled down to fit]]: sisu ei mahu sildile. Tee silt pikemaks "
"või suuremaks, kasuta lindil valikut [[ui:Automatic length]] või lühenda "
"sisu."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Different labels loaded]] (die-cut labels): the printer reports labels "
"of another size, or measured another distance from one label to the next "
"than height plus [[ui:Gap]] of your label.  [[ui:Use loaded labels]] changes "
"the label and prints nothing yet: it takes the size the printer reports "
"(Brother QL), or sets the height along the roll so that height plus gap make "
"the measured distance (cab, Zebra). The gap and the width stay; a Zebra's "
"print width is what the last print set, not the width of the labels. Where "
"that height would be less than 5 mm, the gap is changed instead; where "
"neither makes a label, only [[ui:Print anyway]] is offered."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Different labels loaded]] (väljalõigatud sildid): printer teatab teise "
"suurusega siltidest või mõõtis siltide vahel muu vahekauguse kui sinu sildi "
"kõrgus pluss [[ui:Gap]]. [[ui:Use loaded labels]] muudab silti ja ei prindi "
"veel midagi: see võtab printeri teatatud suuruse (Brother QL) või seab "
"kõrguse rulli sihis nii, et kõrgus pluss vahe annavad mõõdetud vahekauguse "
"(cab, Zebra). Vahe ja laius jäävad; Zebra prindilaius on see, mille viimane "
"print seadis, mitte siltide laius. Kui see kõrgus oleks alla 5 mm, "
"muudetakse selle asemel vahet; kui kumbki ei anna silti, pakutakse ainult "
"[[ui:Print anyway]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"After [[ui:Use loaded labels]], check the label in the preview, then print. "
"[[ui:Undo]] in the message takes the change back; the message says so if "
"elements now reach beyond the edge of the label."
msgstr ""
"Pärast [[ui:Use loaded labels]] kontrolli silti eelvaates ja prindi siis. "
"[[ui:Undo]] teates võtab muudatuse tagasi; teade ütleb seda, kui elemendid "
"ulatuvad nüüd üle sildi serva."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Brother VC-500W { #vc500w }"
msgstr "Brother VC-500W { #vc500w }"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Wi-Fi setup { #wifi }"
msgstr "Wi-Fi seadistus { #wifi }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Tavletta does not set up Wi-Fi. Use a phone or the printer's web interface "
"once:"
msgstr ""
"Tavletta ei seadista Wi-Fit. Kasuta üks kord telefoni või printeri "
"veebiliidest:"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Hold the Wi-Fi button until it turns from blue to white."
msgstr "Hoia Wi-Fi nuppu all, kuni see muutub siniselt valgeks."

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Connect phone or computer to the open network \"Brother VC-500W…\"."
msgstr "Ühenda telefon või arvuti avatud võrku \"Brother VC-500W…\"."

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Open `https://192.168.0.1` (accept the certificate warning) or Brother's "
"Color Label Editor app."
msgstr ""
"Ava `https://192.168.0.1` (nõustu sertifikaadihoiatusega) või Brotheri "
"rakendus Color Label Editor."

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Choose your network and enter the password. Only 2.4 GHz, WPA or open."
msgstr "Vali oma võrk ja sisesta parool. Ainult 2,4 GHz, WPA või avatud."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Later, the web interface is at `https://` and the printer's address: "
"\"Network Wi-Fi Setup\" changes the network (or \"click here\" to enter it "
"by hand), \"AirPrint Options\" sets name, location and firmware updates."
msgstr ""
"Hiljem asub veebiliides aadressil `https://` ja printeri aadress: \"Network "
"Wi-Fi Setup\" muudab võrku (või \"click here\" käsitsi sisestamiseks), "
"\"AirPrint Options\" seab nime, asukoha ja püsivara uuendused."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "USB { #vc500w-usb }"
msgstr "USB { #vc500w-usb }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Plug the printer in; [[ui:Search for printers]] finds it. Printing over USB "
"has not been tried on a printer yet and follows the observations of others: "
"the printer may not answer over USB at all (then the query ends with "
"[[ui:Printer not reachable]]), and it may not cut by itself, then swipe "
"across its panel. Wi-Fi is the tried way."
msgstr ""
"Ühenda printer; [[ui:Search for printers]] leiab selle. Printimist USB kaudu "
"pole veel printeril proovitud ja see järgib teiste tähelepanekuid: printer "
"ei pruugi USB kaudu üldse vastata (siis lõpeb päring teatega [[ui:Printer "
"not reachable]]) ja ta ei pruugi ise lõigata, siis libista üle selle "
"paneeli. Wi-Fi on proovitud viis."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cassettes"
msgstr "Kassetid"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Cassette | Width |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| CZ-1001 | 9 mm (3/8″) |\n"
"| CZ-1002 | 12 mm (1/2″) |\n"
"| CZ-1003 | 19 mm (3/4″) |\n"
"| CZ-1004 | 25 mm (1″) |\n"
"| CZ-1005 | 50 mm (2″) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kassett | Laius |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| CZ-1001 | 9 mm (3/8″) |\n"
"| CZ-1002 | 12 mm (1/2″) |\n"
"| CZ-1003 | 19 mm (3/4″) |\n"
"| CZ-1004 | 25 mm (1″) |\n"
"| CZ-1005 | 50 mm (2″) |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Tavletta shows the inserted cassette, remaining tape, printable width, lot "
"number and the presumed production date. ZINK paper ages: old paper prints "
"paler and yellowish, Tavletta warns about old cassettes. Store cassettes "
"cool and dry."
msgstr ""
"Tavletta näitab sisestatud kassetti, järelejäänud linti, prinditavat laiust, "
"partii numbrit ja oletatavat tootmiskuupäeva. ZINK-paber vananeb: vana paber "
"prindib kahvatumalt ja kollakalt ning Tavletta hoiatab vanade kassettide "
"eest. Hoia kassette jahedas ja kuivas."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Cleaning: insert the cleaning cassette CK-1000, cleaning starts by itself.  "
"Do it when stripes appear, or every 20 to 30 labels."
msgstr ""
"Puhastamine: sisesta puhastuskassett CK-1000, puhastus algab ise. Tee seda, "
"kui ilmuvad triibud, või iga 20-30 sildi järel."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Print options { #vc500w-print }"
msgstr "Printimisvalikud { #vc500w-print }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Cut]]: [[ui:Full cut]] separates the labels. [[ui:Half cut]] cuts "
"through the label, the backing holds them together. [[ui:No cut]]: the "
"printer waits, swipe its panel to cut."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Cut]]: [[ui:Full cut]] eraldab sildid. [[ui:Half cut]] lõikab sildist "
"läbi, aluspaber hoiab need koos. [[ui:No cut]]: printer ootab, lõikamiseks "
"libista üle selle paneeli."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Colours]]: [[ui:Vivid]] for the strongest colours, [[ui:Normal]] "
"(Brother: Standard) for softer ones, black and white (400 lpi) for text and "
"codes."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Colours]]: [[ui:Vivid]] tugevaimate värvide jaoks, [[ui:Normal]] "
"(Brother: Standard) pehmemate jaoks, mustvalge (400 lpi) teksti ja koodide "
"jaoks."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Colour correction: brightness and colour balance (red, green, blue), for "
"this print only, not stored in the printer."
msgstr ""
"Värviparandus: heledus ja värvitasakaal (punane, roheline, sinine), ainult "
"selle printimise jaoks, printerisse ei salvestata."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Problems { #vc500w-problems }"
msgstr "Probleemid { #vc500w-problems }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Wrong cassette]]: the label was designed for another width. Change "
"[[ui:Tape width]] or the cassette."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Wrong cassette]]: silt on kujundatud teisele laiusele. Muuda [[ui:Tape "
"width]] või kassetti."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:No cassette inserted]] or cassette not recognised: reinsert the "
"cassette until it clicks."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:No cassette inserted]] või kassetti ei tuvastata: sisesta kassett "
"uuesti, kuni see klõpsatab."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "No paper: the cassette is empty, replace it."
msgstr "Paberit pole: kassett on tühi, vaheta see välja."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Paper jam: open the cover, remove the jammed label, reinsert the cassette."
msgstr ""
"Paberiummistus: ava kaas, eemalda ummistunud silt, sisesta kassett uuesti."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Cover open: close the cover."
msgstr "Kaas lahti: sulge kaas."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Warming up, cooling down, cleaning: wait, printing continues by itself."
msgstr "Soojeneb, jahtub, puhastab: oota, printimine jätkub ise."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Swipe the panel to cut: the label was printed without cut, swipe across the "
"panel."
msgstr ""
"Swipe the panel to cut: silt prinditi ilma lõikamiseta, libista üle paneeli."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Pale colours, yellow tint: old paper (see the cassette's age), or "
"[[ui:Normal]] instead of [[ui:Vivid]]. With old cassettes try "
"[[ui:Brightness]] −1 to −3 under [[ui:Colour adjustment]]."
msgstr ""
"Kahvatud värvid, kollakas toon: vana paber (vaata kasseti vanust) või "
"[[ui:Normal]] valiku [[ui:Vivid]] asemel. Vanade kassettide korral proovi "
"[[ui:Brightness]] −1 kuni −3 jaotises [[ui:Colour adjustment]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Background barely visible: ZINK hardly prints very light pastel shades, "
"choose a medium shade."
msgstr ""
"Tausta vaevu näha: ZINK prindib väga heledaid pastelltoone vaevu, vali "
"keskmine toon."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Stripes: clean with the CK-1000."
msgstr "Triibud: puhasta CK-1000-ga."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Content askew: insert the cassette straight."
msgstr "Sisu viltu: sisesta kassett sirgelt."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Brother QL { #brother-ql }"
msgstr "Brother QL { #brother-ql }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Tavletta prints on Brother QL label printers from the QL-500 to the "
"QL-1115NWB, red and black too on the QL-800, QL-810W and QL-820NWB. This has "
"not been tried on a printer yet: it follows the protocol as others "
"documented it. Reports of what works and what does not are very welcome."
msgstr ""
"Tavletta prindib Brother QL sildiprinteritel mudelist QL-500 kuni "
"QL-1115NWB, punase ja mustaga ka mudelitel QL-800, QL-810W ja QL-820NWB. "
"Seda pole veel printeril proovitud: see järgib protokolli nii, nagu teised "
"on seda dokumenteerinud. Teated selle kohta, mis töötab ja mis mitte, on "
"väga teretulnud."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Printer model]]: the QL appears twice. Choose \"Brother QL, continuous "
"rolls\" for continuous DK rolls (the label is as long as its content or has "
"a fixed length) and \"Brother QL, die-cut labels\" for die-cut DK labels of "
"a fixed size.  Both use the same printer and settings. If the printer has "
"the other kind of roll loaded, Tavletta offers to [[ui:Switch]]."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Printer model]]: QL ilmub kaks korda. Vali \"Brother QL, continuous "
"rolls\" pidevate DK-rullide jaoks (silt on sisu pikkune või kindla "
"pikkusega) ja \"Brother QL, die-cut labels\" kindla suurusega lõigatud DK-"
"siltide jaoks. Mõlemad kasutavad sama printerit ja seadeid. Kui printerisse "
"on laaditud teist tüüpi rull, pakub Tavletta vahetamist: [[ui:Switch]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Network: models with Wi-Fi or LAN are reached on port 9100.  [[ui:Search for "
"printers]] finds them, or enter the address."
msgstr ""
"Võrk: Wi-Fi või LAN-iga mudelid on kättesaadavad pordis 9100. [[ui:Search "
"for printers]] leiab need, või sisesta aadress."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"USB: plug the printer in; [[ui:Search for printers]] finds it. On the QL-700 "
"and the QL-800 series, switch off \"Editor Lite\" first (hold its button "
"until the green light goes out), otherwise the printer appears as a USB "
"drive."
msgstr ""
"USB: ühenda printer; [[ui:Search for printers]] leiab selle. Mudelitel "
"QL-700 ja QL-800 seeria lülita esmalt välja \"Editor Lite\" (hoia selle "
"nuppu all, kuni roheline tuli kustub), muidu ilmub printer USB-kettana."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Before each print Tavletta reads which roll is loaded. A continuous roll of "
"another width is printed scaled to it after a warning ([[ui:Wrong roll]]); "
"die-cut labels of another size get a warning too ([[ui:Different labels "
"loaded]])."
msgstr ""
"Enne iga printimist loeb Tavletta, milline rull on laaditud. Teise laiusega "
"pidev rull prinditakse sellele skaleeritult pärast hoiatust ([[ui:Wrong "
"roll]]); teise suurusega lõigatud sildid saavad samuti hoiatuse "
"([[ui:Different labels loaded]])."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Die-cut labels: choose the [[ui:Label size]] of the roll. The printer finds "
"the labels by itself; leave the [[ui:Gap]] at 3 mm. About 1.5 mm at the "
"sides and 3 mm at both ends of each label cannot be printed: a [[ui:Safety "
"margin]] of 3 mm keeps content away from there."
msgstr ""
"Lõigatud sildid: vali rulli [[ui:Label size]]. Printer leiab sildid ise; "
"jäta [[ui:Gap]] väärtusele 3 mm. Umbes 1,5 mm külgedelt ja 3 mm iga sildi "
"mõlemast otsast ei saa printida: [[ui:Safety margin]] 3 mm hoiab sisu sealt "
"eemal."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Black and white without dithering: text and codes stay sharp, photos become "
"hard black and white, as the preview shows."
msgstr ""
"Mustvalge ilma rasterdamiseta: tekst ja koodid jäävad teravaks, fotodest "
"saavad kõvad mustvalged pildid, nagu eelvaade näitab."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Print options { #brother-ql-print }"
msgstr "Printimisvalikud { #brother-ql-print }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Cut]]: [[ui:Full cut]] after every label, [[ui:Cut after the last "
"label]] keeps the copies together as one strip, [[ui:No cut]]. The QL-500 "
"has no cutter and no cut option."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Cut]]: [[ui:Full cut]] pärast iga silti, [[ui:Cut after the last "
"label]] hoiab koopiad ühe ribana, [[ui:No cut]]. QL-500-l pole lõikurit ega "
"lõikevalikut."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Colours]]: [[ui:Red and black]] appears on the QL-800 series when a 62 "
"mm continuous roll is loaded; red parts of the label print red on the red "
"and black roll DK-22251. That roll needs a red and black job even for black "
"labels: if the choice does not fit the loaded roll, the printer refuses the "
"job, Tavletta prints it the other way and says so.  From then on the choice "
"follows the roll."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Colours]]: [[ui:Red and black]] ilmub QL-800 seerias, kui on laaditud "
"62 mm pidev rull; sildi punased osad prinditakse punasena punase ja musta "
"rullil DK-22251. See rull vajab punase ja musta tööd ka mustade siltide "
"jaoks: kui valik ei sobi laaditud rulliga, lükkab printer töö tagasi, "
"Tavletta prindib selle teisiti ja teatab sellest. Sellest ajast järgib valik "
"rulli."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Red and black: red parts stay red; images, the background and everything "
"else are converted as for black-and-white printers, see [Black-and-white "
"printers](use.md#black-and-white)."
msgstr ""
"Punane ja must: punased osad jäävad punaseks; pildid, taust ja kõik muu "
"teisendatakse nagu mustvalgetel printeritel, vaata [Mustvalged printerid]"
"(use.md#black-and-white)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Quality]]: [[ui:High resolution (600 dpi)]] doubles the resolution "
"along the roll; printing takes longer. Offered on the QL-570, QL-580N, "
"QL-700, QL-710W, QL-720NW, the QL-800 series and the QL-1100 series."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Quality]]: [[ui:High resolution (600 dpi)]] kahekordistab eraldusvõimet "
"piki rulli; printimine võtab kauem aega. Pakutakse mudelitel QL-570, "
"QL-580N, QL-700, QL-710W, QL-720NW, QL-800 seeria ja QL-1100 seeria."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Problems { #brother-ql-problems }"
msgstr "Probleemid { #brother-ql-problems }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Reachable · the printer reports no status]]: some models do not answer "
"status requests over the network. Printing works, but Tavletta cannot check "
"the roll first."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Reachable · the printer reports no status]]: mõned mudelid ei vasta "
"võrgu kaudu olekupäringutele. Printimine töötab, kuid Tavletta ei saa rulli "
"esmalt kontrollida."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"\"The loaded roll does not match the label\": a die-cut roll is loaded for a "
"label on continuous roll, or the other way round. Load the other roll or "
"choose the other entry under [[ui:Printer model]]."
msgstr ""
"\"The loaded roll does not match the label\": lõigatud rull on laaditud "
"pideval rullil oleva sildi jaoks või vastupidi. Lae teine rull või vali "
"teine kirje valikus [[ui:Printer model]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Out of labels: load a new roll. Cover open: close it. Label jammed: open the "
"cover and remove it, check the cutter."
msgstr ""
"Sildid otsas: lae uus rull. Kaas lahti: sulge see. Silt ummistunud: ava kaas "
"ja eemalda see, kontrolli lõikurit."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Red parts print black: red and black only works on the QL-800 series with "
"the DK-22251 roll."
msgstr ""
"Punased osad prinditakse mustana: punane ja must töötab ainult QL-800 "
"seerias rulliga DK-22251."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "cab label printers { #cab }"
msgstr "cab-sildiprinterid { #cab }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Tavletta prints on cab printers with a 4 inch print head: EOS2, EOS5, SQUIX "
"4 and MACH 4S, at 203, 300 or 600 dpi. Developed with an EOS2/300."
msgstr ""
"Tavletta prindib cab-printeritel 4-tollise prindipeaga: EOS2, EOS5, SQUIX 4 "
"ja MACH 4S, 203, 300 või 600 dpi juures. Arendatud mudeliga EOS2/300."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Network: the printer needs an address in your network (DHCP or set on its "
"display). Tavletta uses the \"RawIP\" port 9100 with the JScript "
"interpreter, both are the printer's defaults (Setup > Interfaces > Network "
"services and Setup > Interpreter)."
msgstr ""
"Võrk: printer vajab sinu võrgus aadressi (DHCP või seatud selle ekraanil). "
"Tavletta kasutab \"RawIP\" porti 9100 JScript-tõlgiga, mõlemad on printeri "
"vaikeväärtused (Setup > Interfaces > Network services ja Setup > "
"Interpreter)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"USB: plug the printer in; [[ui:Search for printers]] finds it. Printing over "
"USB has not been tried on a printer yet."
msgstr ""
"USB: ühenda printer; [[ui:Search for printers]] leiab selle. Printimist USB "
"kaudu pole veel printeril proovitud."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Labels: die-cut labels with a gap, label sensor \"Gap Sensor\". Tavletta "
"sets the sensor for each job. Continuous media and a cutter are not "
"supported yet."
msgstr ""
"Sildid: lõigatud sildid vahega, sildianduriga \"Gap Sensor\". Tavletta seab "
"anduri iga töö jaoks. Pidevat andmekandjat ja lõikurit ei toetata veel."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Print method]]: [[ui:As set on the printer]] keeps the printer's own "
"setting. [[ui:Thermal transfer (ribbon)]] for labels printed with a ribbon, "
"[[ui:Thermal direct]] for labels that print without one. The printer then "
"prints at the speed set on it, if its web interface tells it, else at 50 mm/"
"s. [[ui:Printer details]] show the method set on the printer."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Print method]]: [[ui:As set on the printer]] säilitab printeri enda "
"seadistuse. [[ui:Thermal transfer (ribbon)]] värvilindiga prinditavatele "
"siltidele, [[ui:Thermal direct]] siltidele, mis prindivad ilma selleta. "
"Printer prindib siis sellel seatud kiirusega, kui selle veebiliides seda "
"teatab, muidu kiirusega 50 mm/s. [[ui:Printer details]] näitavad printerisse "
"seatud meetodit."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Print upside down]]: the label comes out turned by 180°, as the "
"manufacturer's label software prints it."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Print upside down]]: silt tuleb välja pööratult 180°, nagu tootja "
"sildiprogramm seda prindib."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Print offset]]: a printer that prints off the label's place (the print "
"a little higher or lower on every label than the preview shows it) is made "
"up for here: measure on a printed label how far the print lies off, and "
"enter it, positive to move the print down on labels across the roll, "
"negative to move it up. The preview keeps showing the label as it should "
"come out; only what is sent to the printer moves. Content within this "
"distance of the edge the print moves to is cut off."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Print offset]]: printer, mis prindib sildil valesse kohta (print on "
"igal sildil veidi kõrgemal või madalamal, kui eelvaade näitab), "
"korrigeeritakse siin: mõõda prinditud sildil, kui kaugel print on, ja "
"sisesta see, positiivne liigutab printi rulli suhtes risti olevatel siltidel "
"alla, negatiivne üles. Eelvaade näitab silti endiselt nii, nagu see peab "
"välja tulema; liigub ainult see, mis printerisse saadetakse. Sisu, mis jääb "
"sellel kaugusel serva lähedale, kuhu print liigub, lõigatakse ära."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Labels per job]]: the labels of a series go to the printer together, up "
"to this many (250 by default, 1 to 1000) in one job, and run through without "
"stopping between them. [[ui:Stop]] takes effect between two jobs: a job that "
"has started is printed in full. 1 sends every label as a job of its own, as "
"other printers get them. Labels whose content changes from copy to copy "
"always go one by one."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Labels per job]]: seeria sildid lähevad printerisse koos, kuni nii "
"palju (vaikimisi 250, 1 kuni 1000) ühes töös, ja jooksevad läbi nende vahel "
"peatumata. [[ui:Stop]] jõustub kahe töö vahel: alanud töö prinditakse "
"täielikult. 1 saadab iga sildi omaette tööna, nagu teised printerid neid "
"saavad. Silte, mille sisu muutub koopiast koopiani, saadetakse alati "
"ükshaaval."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Heat and tear-off position stay as set on the printer."
msgstr "Kuumus ja eraldusasend jäävad printerisse seatuks."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Problems { #cab-problems }"
msgstr "Probleemid { #cab-problems }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Different labels loaded]]: the printer measured another distance "
"between the labels than height plus gap of your label. Check [[ui:Label "
"size]] and [[ui:Gap]], or load the right roll. Press Feed on the printer "
"once after changing the roll so it measures again, then [[ui:Use loaded "
"labels]] adapts the label to it ([All printers](#common))."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Different labels loaded]]: printer mõõtis siltide vahel muu vahekauguse "
"kui sinu sildi kõrgus pluss vahe. Kontrolli [[ui:Label size]] ja [[ui:Gap]] "
"või pane õige rull. Vajuta printeril pärast rulli vahetamist üks kord Feed, "
"et see mõõdaks uuesti, siis kohandab [[ui:Use loaded labels]] sildi selle "
"järgi ([Kõik printerid](#common))."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Everything printed a little too high or too low, the same on every label, "
"while the preview shows it in its place: set [[ui:Print offset]]. A label "
"laid out to make up for this in another program prints off its place in the "
"preview; move its content back into place and set the offset instead."
msgstr ""
"Kõik prinditakse veidi liiga kõrgele või liiga madalale, igal sildil "
"ühtemoodi, kuigi eelvaade näitab seda õiges kohas: sea [[ui:Print offset]]. "
"Teises programmis seda tasakaalustama kujundatud silt prindib eelvaates "
"valesse kohta; pane selle sisu tagasi oma kohale ja sea selle asemel nihe."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"A print that stopped because of a problem is cancelled, so printing again "
"does not give extra labels."
msgstr ""
"Probleemi tõttu peatunud printimine tühistatakse, nii et uuesti printimine "
"ei anna lisasilte."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Out of labels: load a new roll, the printer then synchronises by itself."
msgstr "Sildid otsas: lae uus rull, printer sünkroniseerub siis ise."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Print head open: close the print head."
msgstr "Prindipea lahti: sulge prindipea."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Next label not found: labels not threaded through the label sensor, or "
"labels without gaps (continuous media is not supported yet)."
msgstr ""
"Järgmist silti ei leita: sildid pole sildianduri kaudu läbi pandud või "
"sildid ilma vaheta (pidevat andmekandjat ei toetata veel)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Ribbon problem: no ribbon in thermal transfer mode, or a ribbon in thermal "
"direct mode. Load or remove the ribbon, or choose the other [[ui:Print "
"method]]."
msgstr ""
"Värvilindi probleem: värvilinti pole termosiirderežiimis või värvilint on "
"otsetermorežiimis. Lae või eemalda värvilint või vali teine [[ui:Print "
"method]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Out of memory: the printer had no room for the labels of a job. Lower "
"[[ui:Labels per job]], then print again from the row the message names."
msgstr ""
"Mälu otsas: printeril polnud ruumi töö siltide jaoks. Vähenda [[ui:Labels "
"per job]] ja prindi uuesti teates nimetatud reast."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"\"The job was sent, but its outcome is unknown\": the connection to the "
"printer broke while it printed (or the printer could not tell how far it "
"got). Tavletta counts the labels it knows were printed; the printer may have "
"printed more. Check the labels that came out: printing again from the row "
"the message names may print some twice, but leaves none out.  With the "
"printer's web interface reachable on the network (the default), Tavletta "
"also checks the number against the printer's label counter; where the two "
"differ, the message gives the range."
msgstr ""
"„Töö saadeti, kuid selle tulemus pole teada”: ühendus printeriga katkes "
"printimise ajal (või printer ei osanud öelda, kui kaugele jõudis). Tavletta "
"loeb sildid, mille ta teab prinditud olevat; printer võib olla printinud "
"rohkem. Kontrolli välja tulnud silte: teates nimetatud reast uuesti "
"printimine võib mõned kaks korda printida, kuid ei jäta ühtegi välja. Kui "
"printeri veebiliides on võrgus kättesaadav (vaikimisi), võrdleb Tavletta "
"arvu ka printeri siltide loenduriga; kui need erinevad, annab teade vahemiku."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Labels with a ribbon print blank or smeared, the ribbon does not move: the "
"printer is set to thermal direct. Choose [[ui:Thermal transfer (ribbon)]] "
"under [[ui:Print method]]."
msgstr ""
"Värvilindiga sildid prinditakse tühjana või määrdunult, värvilint ei liigu: "
"printer on seatud otsetermoprintimisele. Vali [[ui:Thermal transfer "
"(ribbon)]] valikus [[ui:Print method]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Paused: resume the printer on its display."
msgstr "Peatatud: jätka printerit selle ekraanil."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Print too pale or too dark: change the heat level in the printer's setup."
msgstr ""
"Prindi liiga kahvatu või liiga tume: muuda kuumuse taset printeri seadetes."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Brother P-touch { #ptouch }"
msgstr "Brother P-touch { #ptouch }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Tavletta prints on Brother P-touch tape printers with TZe tape and HSe heat-"
"shrink tube: the PT-P700, PT-P750W, PT-E550W, PT-P710BT, the PT-P900 series, "
"the PT-D series and older models such as the PT-2430PC. Not tried on a "
"printer yet."
msgstr ""
"Tavletta prindib Brother P-touch lindiprinteritel TZe-lindi ja HSe-"
"kahanevate torudega: PT-P700, PT-P750W, PT-E550W, PT-P710BT, PT-P900 seeria, "
"PT-D seeria ja vanemad mudelid nagu PT-2430PC. Pole veel printeril proovitud."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "USB: plug the printer in; [[ui:Search for printers]] finds it."
msgstr "USB: ühenda printer; [[ui:Search for printers]] leiab selle."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Network (PT-P750W, PT-E550W, PT-P900W, PT-P950NW): the search finds the "
"printer, or enter its address. Tavletta uses port 9100."
msgstr ""
"Võrk (PT-P750W, PT-E550W, PT-P900W, PT-P950NW): otsing leiab printeri, või "
"sisesta selle aadress. Tavletta kasutab porti 9100."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Bluetooth is not supported; models with Bluetooth print over USB."
msgstr "Bluetoothi ei toetata; Bluetoothiga mudelid prindivad USB kaudu."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Editor Lite: with the Editor Lite lamp on, the printer is a USB drive and "
"cannot print. Switch Editor Lite off, then search again."
msgstr ""
"Editor Lite: kui Editor Lite tuli põleb, on printer USB-ketas ega saa "
"printida. Lülita Editor Lite välja, seejärel otsi uuesti."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tape { #ptouch-tape }"
msgstr "Lint { #ptouch-tape }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Tavletta shows the inserted tape, its type (laminated, heat-shrink "
"tube, ...) and the printable width under [[ui:Printer details]]."
msgstr ""
"Tavletta näitab sisestatud linti, selle tüüpi (laminaat, kahanev toru, ...) "
"ja prinditavat laiust jaotises [[ui:Printer details]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"The label fills the printable part of the tape. The edges of the tape stay "
"blank: on 12 mm tape about 9.9 mm are printed."
msgstr ""
"Silt täidab lindi prinditava osa. Lindi servad jäävad tühjaks: 12 mm lindil "
"prinditakse umbes 9,9 mm."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Heat-shrink tube: choose the nearest [[ui:Tape width]] (12 mm for an 11.2 mm "
"tube)."
msgstr "Kahanev toru: vali lähim [[ui:Tape width]] (12 mm 11,2 mm toru jaoks)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Print in black: on coloured tape the tape's ink colour prints. Images are "
"printed in black and white without dithering."
msgstr ""
"Printimine mustaga: värvilisel lindil prinditakse lindi tindivärv. Pildid "
"prinditakse mustvalgena ilma rasterdamiseta."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Print options { #ptouch-print }"
msgstr "Printimisvalikud { #ptouch-print }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Cut]]: [[ui:Full cut]] cuts each label off. [[ui:Half cut]] cuts "
"through the label, the backing holds the labels together. [[ui:No cut]] "
"prints the labels as one strip. The strip is cut after the last label.  "
"Models with a cutter lever have no cut setting."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Cut]]: [[ui:Full cut]] lõikab iga sildi lahti. [[ui:Half cut]] lõikab "
"sildist läbi, aluspaber hoiab sildid koos. [[ui:No cut]] prindib sildid ühe "
"ribana. Riba lõigatakse pärast viimast silti. Lõikehoovaga mudelitel pole "
"lõikeseadet."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Chain printing]]: the last label stays in the printer and comes out "
"with the next print. Saves about 25 mm of tape per print."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Chain printing]]: viimane silt jääb printerisse ja tuleb välja järgmise "
"printimisega. Säästab umbes 25 mm linti printimise kohta."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "[[ui:High resolution]]: finer print along the tape, slower."
msgstr "[[ui:High resolution]]: peenem printimine piki linti, aeglasem."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Tape feed]]: blank tape before and after each label, at least 2 mm (PT-"
"P900 series: 1 mm)."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Tape feed]]: tühi lint enne ja pärast iga silti, vähemalt 2 mm (PT-P900 "
"seeria: 1 mm)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"The first label after switching on starts with a blank piece: the cutter "
"sits behind the print head."
msgstr ""
"Esimene silt pärast sisselülitamist algab tühja tükiga: lõikur asub "
"prindipea taga."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Problems { #ptouch-problems }"
msgstr "Probleemid { #ptouch-problems }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Wrong cassette]]: another tape width is inserted. The label is scaled "
"to the tape."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Wrong cassette]]: sisestatud on teise laiusega lint. Silt skaleeritakse "
"lindile."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Cover open, no tape, tape not recognised: close the cover, insert the tape "
"until it clicks."
msgstr ""
"Kaas lahti, lint puudub, linti ei tuvastata: sulge kaas, sisesta lint, kuni "
"see klõpsatab."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Batteries low: connect the power adapter."
msgstr "Aku tühi: ühenda toiteadapter."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Print head too hot: wait a few minutes."
msgstr "Prindipea liiga kuum: oota mõni minut."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Model not supported: Tavletta knows the models listed above."
msgstr "Mudelit ei toetata: Tavletta tunneb ülalloetletud mudeleid."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "NIIMBOT { #niimbot }"
msgstr "NIIMBOT { #niimbot }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Tavletta prints on NIIMBOT label printers over USB: B1, B21, B3S, B4, D11, "
"D110, D101 and related models. It has not been tried on a printer yet; "
"please report how it works."
msgstr ""
"Tavletta prindib NIIMBOT-sildiprinteritel USB kaudu: B1, B21, B3S, B4, D11, "
"D110, D101 ja nendega seotud mudelitel. Seda pole veel printeril proovitud; "
"anna teada, kuidas see töötab."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"USB: plug the printer in and switch it on; [[ui:Search for printers]] finds "
"it. Otherwise enter its port, for example `/dev/ttyACM0`, under [[ui:Host "
"name or IP address]]."
msgstr ""
"USB: ühenda printer ja lülita see sisse; [[ui:Search for printers]] leiab "
"selle. Muidu sisesta selle port, näiteks `/dev/ttyACM0`, väljale [[ui:Host "
"name or IP address]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"The port belongs to the group `dialout` (Fedora, Debian, Ubuntu) or `uucp` "
"(Arch Linux), not `lp`. Run `sudo usermod -aG dialout $USER` (on Arch Linux: "
"`uucp`), then log out and in again."
msgstr ""
"Port kuulub rühma `dialout` (Fedora, Debian, Ubuntu) või `uucp` (Arch "
"Linux), mitte `lp`. Käivita `sudo usermod -aG dialout $USER` (Arch Linuxis: "
"`uucp`), seejärel logi välja ja uuesti sisse."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Bluetooth is not supported yet. Older B3S with a micro-USB port do not "
"answer over USB; the B3S P with USB-C does."
msgstr ""
"Bluetoothi ei toetata veel. Vanemad B3S micro-USB pordiga ei vasta USB "
"kaudu; B3S P USB-C-ga vastab."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Label size]]: the labels on the roll, the width across the printer.  On "
"the D11, D110 and D101 the roll is narrow (12 mm on a D11): choose "
"[[ui:Along the roll]] under [[ui:Content direction]] for text along the "
"label."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Label size]]: rullil olevad sildid, laius printeri risti. Mudelitel "
"D11, D110 ja D101 on rull kitsas (12 mm mudelil D11): vali [[ui:Along the "
"roll]] jaotises [[ui:Content direction]] sildi suunalise teksti jaoks."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"A label narrower than the print head is printed in its middle. One a little "
"wider is cut to the middle: a B1 prints 48 mm of a 50 mm label.  Keep 1 mm "
"or more as [[ui:Safety margin]]."
msgstr ""
"Prindipeast kitsam silt prinditakse selle keskele. Veidi laiem lõigatakse "
"keskele: B1 prindib 50 mm sildist 48 mm. Hoia [[ui:Safety margin]] vähemalt "
"1 mm."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"In the printer group: [[ui:Print density]] (higher prints darker) and "
"[[ui:Label sensor]] (labels with gaps, black marks, a continuous roll or "
"transparent labels, as loaded). Tavletta offers what the connected model "
"takes and remembers the choice."
msgstr ""
"Printerirühmas: [[ui:Print density]] (kõrgem prindib tumedamalt) ja "
"[[ui:Label sensor]] (sildid vahedega, mustad märgid, pidev rull või "
"läbipaistvad sildid, nagu laaditud). Tavletta pakub seda, mida ühendatud "
"mudel vastu võtab, ja jätab valiku meelde."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Problems { #niimbot-problems }"
msgstr "Probleemid { #niimbot-problems }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"No permission for the serial port: add your user to the group, see above."
msgstr "Õigust jadaportile pole: lisa oma kasutaja rühma, vaata ülal."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Printer not reachable]] right after plugging in: some systems probe new "
"serial ports for a modem first. Wait a few seconds, then [[ui:Refresh]]."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Printer not reachable]] kohe pärast ühendamist: mõned süsteemid "
"kontrollivad uusi jadaporte esmalt modemi suhtes. Oota mõni sekund, seejärel "
"[[ui:Refresh]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Cover open, out of labels or a low battery: close the cover, load a roll or "
"charge the printer, then [[ui:Refresh]]."
msgstr ""
"Kaas lahti, sildid otsas või aku tühi: sulge kaas, lae rull või lae "
"printerit, seejärel [[ui:Refresh]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Printing fails after some copies: the message says how many labels were "
"already printed. The job is canceled, nothing prints later on its own."
msgstr ""
"Printimine ebaõnnestub mõne koopia järel: teade ütleb, mitu silti oli juba "
"prinditud. Töö tühistatakse, midagi ei prindita hiljem ise."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"The printer is found, but printing reports an unknown model: Tavletta does "
"not know its model number yet. Please [[ui:Report a problem…]], the report "
"contains the number."
msgstr ""
"Printer leitakse, kuid printimine teatab tundmatust mudelist: Tavletta ei "
"tunne veel selle mudelinumbrit. Palun [[ui:Report a problem…]], aruanne "
"sisaldab numbrit."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "System printer (CUPS, IPP) { #system }"
msgstr "Süsteemiprinter (CUPS, IPP) { #system }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Prints on the printers your computer knows: printers set up in the system "
"settings (also over USB) and printers in the network that support IPP "
"Everywhere or AirPrint, as most office printers do. The label is printed as "
"one page of exactly its size, unscaled."
msgstr ""
"Prindib printeritel, mida sinu arvuti tunneb: süsteemiseadetes seadistatud "
"printerid (ka USB kaudu) ja võrgus olevad printerid, mis toetavad IPP "
"Everywhere'i või AirPrinti, nagu enamik kontoriprintereid. Silt prinditakse "
"ühele lehele täpselt selle suuruses, skaleerimata."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Search for printers]] lists both. Otherwise enter the printer's address "
"or the name of its CUPS queue under [[ui:Host name or IP address]]."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Search for printers]] loetleb mõlemad. Muidu sisesta printeri aadress "
"või selle CUPS-järjekorra nimi väljale [[ui:Host name or IP address]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "[[ui:Label size]]: the paper size, or [[ui:Custom size]]."
msgstr "[[ui:Label size]]: paberi suurus või [[ui:Custom size]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Print on]] [[ui:Label sheet]]: several labels on a sheet of self-"
"adhesive labels, see [Label sheets](sheets.md)."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Print on]] [[ui:Label sheet]]: mitu silti isekleepuvate siltide lehele, "
"vaata [Sildilehed](sheets.md)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Most office printers cannot print the outer 4 to 5 mm of a page: set the "
"[[ui:Safety margin]] to 5 mm. On label sheets Tavletta warns when a label "
"reaches into what the printer reports."
msgstr ""
"Enamik kontoriprintereid ei saa printida lehe välimist 4-5 mm: sea "
"[[ui:Safety margin]] väärtusele 5 mm. Sildilehtedel hoiatab Tavletta, kui "
"silt ulatub sellesse, mida printer teatab."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Problems { #system-problems }"
msgstr "Probleemid { #system-problems }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Out of paper, paper jam or cover open while printing: Tavletta shows it and "
"waits. Fix it at the printer within 5 minutes and printing goes on."
msgstr ""
"Paber otsas, paberiummistus või kaas lahti printimise ajal: Tavletta näitab "
"seda ja ootab. Paranda see printeril 5 minuti jooksul ja printimine jätkub."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Out of toner or ink, or a problem before printing: fix it as the printer's "
"display shows, then [[ui:Refresh]]."
msgstr ""
"Toonerit või tinti pole, või probleem enne printimist: paranda nii, nagu "
"printeri ekraan näitab, seejärel [[ui:Refresh]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Printing fails after some copies: the message says how many labels were "
"already printed. The rest is canceled, nothing prints later on its own."
msgstr ""
"Printimine ebaõnnestub mõne koopia järel: teade ütleb, mitu silti oli juba "
"prinditud. Ülejäänu tühistatakse, midagi ei prindita hiljem ise."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"The label is printed smaller or moved: the printer or its driver scales the "
"page. Turn off \"fit to page\" in the printer's setup."
msgstr ""
"Silt prinditakse väiksemana või nihkes: printer või selle draiver skaleerib "
"lehte. Lülita printeri seadetes \"fit to page\" välja."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Other jobs are printing first: Tavletta says the label was sent, and the "
"printer prints it when its turn comes."
msgstr ""
"Teised tööd prindivad esmalt: Tavletta ütleb, et silt saadeti, ja printer "
"prindib selle oma järjekorras."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"The job is held in the queue (until it is released, or until a password is "
"entered): Tavletta cancels it. Check the queue in the system settings."
msgstr ""
"Töö on järjekorras peatatud (kuni see vabastatakse või sisestatakse parool): "
"Tavletta tühistab selle. Kontrolli järjekorda süsteemiseadetes."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Label printers with ZPL, EPL2, TSPL, ESC/POS or DYMO { #raw }"
msgstr "Sildiprinterid ZPL-i, EPL2, TSPL-i, ESC/POS-i või DYMO-ga { #raw }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Tavletta prints on label printers that take the label as an image in their "
"own printer language. Zebra ZPL was tried on a Zebra GX420d over USB (status "
"and printing); the other printers have not been tried with Tavletta yet: if "
"you have one, a report of what works and what does not helps a lot "
"([[ui:Report a problem…]])."
msgstr ""
"Tavletta prindib sildiprinteritel, mis võtavad sildi vastu pildina oma "
"printerikeeles. Zebra ZPL-i proovitud Zebra GX420d-ga USB kaudu (olek ja "
"printimine); teisi printereid pole Tavlettaga veel proovitud: kui sul on "
"mõni, aitab aruanne selle kohta, mis töötab ja mis mitte, väga palju "
"([[ui:Report a problem…]])."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Printer model in Tavletta | Printers |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| Zebra ZPL | Zebra GK, GX, ZD, ZT and other printers with ZPL, also ZPL compatible printers of other makers |\n"
"| Zebra EPL2 | Zebra LP/TLP 2824 and 2844, GK420 and GX420 set to EPL2 |\n"
"| TSPL (TSC, Munbyn, iDPRT, Xprinter, Rollo) | TSC printers and most 4 × 6 in shipping label printers |\n"
"| [[ui:Receipt printer (ESC/POS)]] | Epson TM and compatible receipt printers on 58 or 80 mm paper |\n"
"| DYMO LabelWriter | LabelWriter 300, 400 and 450 series, 4XL (not the 550 and 5XL) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Printerimudel Tavlettas | Printerid |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| Zebra ZPL | Zebra GK, GX, ZD, ZT ja muud ZPL-iga printerid, ka teiste tootjate ZPL-iga ühilduvad printerid |\n"
"| Zebra EPL2 | Zebra LP/TLP 2824 ja 2844, GK420 ja GX420 seatud EPL2-le |\n"
"| TSPL (TSC, Munbyn, iDPRT, Xprinter, Rollo) | TSC printerid ja enamik 4 × 6 tolli saatesildiprintereid |\n"
"| [[ui:Receipt printer (ESC/POS)]] | Epson TM ja ühilduvad kviitungiprinterid 58 või 80 mm paberil |\n"
"| DYMO LabelWriter | LabelWriter 300, 400 ja 450 seeria, 4XL (mitte 550 ja 5XL) |\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Connection: over the network on port 9100, or USB. Plug a USB printer in and "
"use [[ui:Search for printers]]. Some low-cost shipping label printers do not "
"show up as a printer on USB; Tavletta cannot find those."
msgstr ""
"Ühendus: võrgu kaudu pordis 9100 või USB. Ühenda USB-printer ja kasuta "
"[[ui:Search for printers]]. Mõned odavad saatesildiprinterid ei ilmu USB-l "
"printerina; Tavletta ei leia neid."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Resolution]]: choose the resolution of the print head (203, 300 or 600 "
"dpi). Zebra printers report it: [[ui:As reported by the printer]]."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Resolution]]: vali prindipea eraldusvõime (203, 300 või 600 dpi). Zebra "
"printerid teatavad selle: [[ui:As reported by the printer]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Label sensor]]: [[ui:As set on the printer]] keeps the printer's own "
"setting. [[ui:Gap between labels]] for die-cut labels, [[ui:Black mark]] for "
"labels with a black mark on the back, [[ui:Continuous media]] for a roll "
"without gaps. Set the [[ui:Label size]] and the [[ui:Gap]] (or the height of "
"the mark) like the roll."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Label sensor]]: [[ui:As set on the printer]] säilitab printeri enda "
"seadistuse. [[ui:Gap between labels]] lõigatud siltide jaoks, [[ui:Black "
"mark]] siltide jaoks, mille taga on must märk, [[ui:Continuous media]] "
"vahedeta rulli jaoks. Sea [[ui:Label size]] ja [[ui:Gap]] (või märgi kõrgus) "
"rulli järgi."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:After printing]]: [[ui:Tear off]], [[ui:Peel off]] or [[ui:Cut off]], "
"if the printer has a peeler or a cutter.  [[ui:As set on the printer]] "
"leaves the printer's own setting."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:After printing]]: [[ui:Tear off]], [[ui:Peel off]] või [[ui:Cut off]], "
"kui printeril on koorija või lõikur. [[ui:As set on the printer]] jätab "
"printeri enda seadistuse."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Darkness]] and [[ui:Speed]] change the printer's setting for this "
"print; [[ui:As set on the printer]] leaves it alone."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Darkness]] ja [[ui:Speed]] muudavad printeri seadet selle printimise "
"jaoks; [[ui:As set on the printer]] jätab selle puutumata."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Print upside down]]: for a printer that puts out the label the wrong "
"way round."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Print upside down]]: printeri jaoks, mis annab sildi vales pidi välja."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Receipt printers print the label on endless paper: choose the paper width "
"under [[ui:Tape width]]. The printable width is narrower than the paper (48 "
"mm on 58 mm paper, 72 mm on 80 mm paper). [[ui:Cut]] in the print dialog "
"cuts the paper after each label."
msgstr ""
"Kviitungiprinterid prindivad sildi lõpmatule paberile: vali paberi laius "
"valikus [[ui:Tape width]]. Prinditav laius on paberist kitsam (48 mm 58 mm "
"paberil, 72 mm 80 mm paberil). Printimisdialoogi [[ui:Cut]] lõikab paberi "
"pärast iga silti."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Problems { #raw-problems }"
msgstr "Probleemid { #raw-problems }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Reachable · the printer reports no status]]: the printer takes jobs but "
"answers no questions, which many of these printers do (EPL2 printers never "
"answer). Problems such as an open cover then show on the printer only."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Reachable · the printer reports no status]]: printer võtab töid vastu, "
"kuid ei vasta küsimustele, nagu paljud neist printeritest (EPL2-printerid ei "
"vasta kunagi). Probleemid, nagu avatud kaas, ilmuvad siis ainult printeril."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"The printer did not report its resolution in time: choose it under "
"[[ui:Resolution]] instead of [[ui:As reported by the printer]]."
msgstr ""
"Printer ei teatanud eraldusvõimet õigeaegselt: vali see valikus "
"[[ui:Resolution]] valiku [[ui:As reported by the printer]] asemel."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"The label comes out upside down: switch on [[ui:Print upside down]], and "
"please report it with the printer model; the orientation was tried on a "
"Zebra GX420d only."
msgstr ""
"Silt tuleb tagurpidi välja: lülita sisse [[ui:Print upside down]] ja anna "
"sellest koos printerimudeliga teada; suunda on proovitud ainult Zebra GX420d-"
"l."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid "Print too pale or too dark: change [[ui:Darkness]]."
msgstr "Prindi liiga kahvatu või liiga tume: muuda [[ui:Darkness]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Different labels loaded]] (Zebra ZPL): the printer reports the distance "
"it measured last, perhaps on an earlier roll. After changing the roll, let "
"it measure the labels again (most printers do that with a long press on "
"Feed) before you use [[ui:Use loaded labels]] ([All printers](#common))."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Different labels loaded]] (Zebra ZPL): printer teatab viimati mõõdetud "
"vahekauguse, võib-olla varasemalt rullilt. Pärast rulli vahetamist lase "
"sellel silte uuesti mõõta (enamik printereid teeb seda Feed pika "
"vajutusega), enne kui kasutad [[ui:Use loaded labels]] ([Kõik printerid]"
"(#common))."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"The printer prints several blank labels or stops between labels: the "
"[[ui:Label sensor]] does not match the roll, or the printer has to measure "
"the labels again (most printers do that with a long press on Feed)."
msgstr ""
"Printer prindib mitu tühja silti või peatub siltide vahel: [[ui:Label "
"sensor]] ei sobi rulliga või printer peab silte uuesti mõõtma (enamik "
"printereid teeb seda Feed-nupu pika vajutusega)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Nothing is printed and the printer shows no problem: check that its printer "
"language is the one chosen in Tavletta (many printers can switch between ZPL "
"and EPL2, or between TSPL and ESC/POS)."
msgstr ""
"Midagi ei prindita ja printer ei näita probleemi: kontrolli, et selle "
"printerikeel on see, mis Tavlettas valitud (paljud printerid saavad lülituda "
"ZPL-i ja EPL2 või TSPL-i ja ESC/POS-i vahel)."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/printer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Help"
msgstr "Abi"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/printer.md
msgid ""
"Something else? [[ui:Report a problem…]] in the main menu (also offered with "
"error messages) opens a prefilled issue in the browser with version, system "
"and printer. You see everything before sending it."
msgstr ""
"Midagi muud? [[ui:Report a problem…]] peamenüüs (pakutakse ka veateadete "
"juures) avab brauseris eeltäidetud issue koos versiooni, süsteemi ja "
"printeriga. Näed kõike enne saatmist."

#. type: Title #
#: docs/serial.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Serial labels"
msgstr "Seeriasildid"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"One label for each row of a table: inventory numbers, shelf labels, name "
"badges, addresses. The label holds placeholders such as `{Name}`; each "
"printed label shows the values of its row."
msgstr ""
"Üks silt tabeli iga rea kohta: inventarinumbrid, riiulisildid, nimesildid, "
"aadressid. Silt sisaldab kohatäiteid nagu `{Name}`; iga prinditud silt "
"näitab oma rea väärtusi."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"![Serial labels](media/serial.png#only-light)  ![Serial labels](media/serial-"
"dark.png#only-dark)"
msgstr ""
"![Seeriasildid](media/serial.png#only-light)  ![Seeriasildid](media/serial-"
"dark.png#only-dark)"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/serial.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Data file"
msgstr "Andmefail"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Data for serial labels…]] in the main menu, [[ui:Choose…]] under "
"[[ui:Serial labels]], or drop the file onto the window."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Data for serial labels…]] peamenüüs, [[ui:Choose…]] jaotises "
"[[ui:Serial labels]], või lohista fail aknasse."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"CSV (comma, semicolon or tab), ODS (LibreOffice) or XLSX (Excel). The first "
"filled row holds the column names."
msgstr ""
"CSV (koma, semikoolon või tabulaator), ODS (LibreOffice) või XLSX (Excel). "
"Esimene täidetud rida sisaldab veergude nimesid."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"A title above the column names counts as the first row: delete it, or put "
"the table on a sheet of its own."
msgstr ""
"Veerunimede kohal olev pealkiri loetakse esimeseks reaks: kustuta see või "
"pane tabel eraldi lehele."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid "ODS: cells as LibreOffice shows them, dates as `2026-11-11`."
msgstr ""
"ODS: lahtrid nii, nagu LibreOffice neid näitab, kuupäevad kujul `2026-11-11`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"XLSX: numbers with their decimals, leading zeros and percent signs, dates as "
"`2026-11-11`. Thousands separators and text in the number format, such as a "
"currency, are left out. Dates in the East Asian built-in formats come out as "
"numbers. Leading zeros fill up to 30 digits; a number format longer than the "
"255 characters Excel takes is ignored."
msgstr ""
"XLSX: arvud koos kümnendkohtade, eesnullide ja protsendimärkidega, kuupäevad "
"kujul `2026-11-11`. Tuhandeeraldajad ja tekst arvuvormingus, näiteks "
"valuuta, jäetakse välja. Ida-Aasia sisseehitatud vormingutes kuupäevad "
"tulevad arvudena. Eesnullid täidavad kuni 30 numbrini; Exceli "
"aktsepteeritavast 255 märgist pikem arvuvorming ignoreeritakse."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid "Empty rows are left out. The hidden cells of merged cells are empty."
msgstr ""
"Tühjad read jäetakse välja. Liidetud lahtrite peidetud lahtrid on tühjad."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"Several sheets: choose one under [[ui:Sheet]]. If the sheet saved with the "
"label is no longer there, nothing is printed until another one is chosen."
msgstr ""
"Mitu lehte: vali üks valikus [[ui:Sheet]]. Kui sildiga salvestatud lehte "
"enam pole, ei prindita midagi, kuni valid teise."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Read again]] after the file was changed in the spreadsheet program."
msgstr "[[ui:Read again]] pärast faili muutmist tabelarvutusprogrammis."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"Up to 100 000 rows, 1000 columns, 2 000 000 cells (rows times columns, "
"without the row of column names) and 50 MB."
msgstr ""
"Kuni 100 000 rida, 1000 veergu, 2 000 000 lahtrit (read korda veerud, ilma "
"veerunimede reata) ja 50 MB."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"The label file stores where the data file is, never its content. If the data "
"file lies in the same folder as the label (or below it), both can be moved "
"or shared together. If it is missing when the label is opened, Tavletta says "
"so: choose it again or remove it."
msgstr ""
"Sildifail salvestab, kus andmefail asub, mitte kunagi selle sisu. Kui "
"andmefail asub samas kaustas sildiga (või selle all), saab mõlemat koos "
"liigutada või jagada. Kui see sildi avamisel puudub, teatab Tavletta "
"sellest: vali see uuesti või eemalda."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"A data file is read without asking only if it is a table (`.csv`, `.tsv`, "
"`.txt`, `.ods`, `.xlsx`) in the label's folder or below, and not in a hidden "
"folder. Any other data file is read only after asking, once for each label "
"file: a label from someone else could name any file.  [[ui:Forget allowed "
"data files]] in the main menu makes Tavletta ask again."
msgstr ""
"Andmefaili loetakse küsimata ainult siis, kui see on tabel (`.csv`, `.tsv`, "
"`.txt`, `.ods`, `.xlsx`) sildi kaustas või selle all ja mitte peidetud "
"kaustas. Mis tahes muud andmefaili loetakse alles pärast küsimist, üks kord "
"iga sildifaili kohta: kellegi teise silt võiks nimetada ükskõik millist "
"faili. [[ui:Forget allowed data files]] peamenüüs paneb Tavletta uuesti "
"küsima."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"In the Flatpak, Tavletta sees only the files it is given: a label opened "
"from the file manager or the file chooser, but not the folder around it.  A "
"data file beside the label is then not found: choose it with [[ui:Data for "
"serial labels…]] (the file chooser gives Tavletta access to it)."
msgstr ""
"Flatpakis näeb Tavletta ainult talle antud faile: failihaldurist või "
"failivalijast avatud silti, kuid mitte selle ümber olevat kausta. Sildi "
"kõrval olevat andmefaili siis ei leita: vali see valikuga [[ui:Data for "
"serial labels…]] (failivalija annab Tavlettale juurdepääsu sellele)."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"Templates keep the placeholders but not the data file. Older versions of "
"Tavletta refuse labels with a data file instead of printing the placeholders."
msgstr ""
"Mallid säilitavad kohatäited, kuid mitte andmefaili. Tavletta vanemad "
"versioonid keelduvad siltidest, millel on andmefail, selle asemel et "
"kohatäited printida."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/serial.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Placeholders"
msgstr "Kohatäited"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Insert column]] next to a text or the content of a code adds `{Column}` "
"at the cursor; typing it works as well."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Insert column]] teksti või koodi sisu kõrval lisab kursori kohale "
"`{Column}`; selle tippimine töötab samuti."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"Placeholders work in texts and in QR codes and barcodes, for example "
"`https://example.org/item/{Number}`."
msgstr ""
"Kohatäited töötavad tekstides ning QR-koodides ja vöötkoodides, näiteks "
"`https://example.org/item/{Number}`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"With a data file `{{` and `}}` print a single brace, in every text and code: "
"`{{Name}}` prints `{Name}`. Other braces need doubling too, for example JSON "
"in a QR code: `{{\"id\":{Number}}}`. Without a data file texts print as "
"typed."
msgstr ""
"Andmefailiga prindivad `{{` ja `}}` ühe looksulu, igas tekstis ja koodis: "
"`{{Name}}` prindib `{Name}`. Teised looksulud tuleb samuti kahekordistada, "
"näiteks JSON QR-koodis: `{{\"id\":{Number}}}`. Ilma andmefailita prinditakse "
"tekstid nii, nagu tipitud."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid "Values are printed as they are, even if they contain braces."
msgstr ""
"Väärtused prinditakse sellisena, nagu need on, isegi kui need sisaldavad "
"looksulge."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"A placeholder without a column of that name is printed as it is; the line "
"under the preview names it."
msgstr ""
"Kohatäide ilma sellenimelise veeruta prinditakse sellisena, nagu see on; "
"eelvaate all olev rida nimetab seda."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"Before printing, the codes of every row are checked: an EAN-13 needs 12 or "
"13 digits, an empty cell gives no code, a code holds only so much (a QR code "
"less with a higher error correction), GS1 data needs the lengths of its "
"application identifiers. Rows that fail are named; print without them or "
"correct the data file."
msgstr ""
"Enne printimist kontrollitakse iga rea koode: EAN-13 vajab 12 või 13 "
"numbrit, tühi lahter ei anna koodi, kood mahutab ainult nii palju (QR-kood "
"vähem kõrgema veaparandusega), GS1-andmed vajavad oma rakendustunnuste "
"pikkusi. Ebaõnnestunud read nimetatakse; prindi ilma nendeta või paranda "
"andmefail."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"Variables such as `{=counter}` or `{=date}` work together with the "
"placeholders; the counter goes on from row to row."
msgstr ""
"Muutujad nagu `{=counter}` või `{=date}` töötavad koos kohatäidetega; "
"loendur jätkab reast reale."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/serial.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preview"
msgstr "Eelvaade"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"The buttons under the preview step through the rows: [[ui:First row]], "
"[[ui:Previous row]], [[ui:Next row]] and [[ui:Last row]], or Alt+Page Up, "
"Alt+Page Down, Alt+Home and Alt+End."
msgstr ""
"Eelvaate all olevad nupud liiguvad ridade vahel: [[ui:First row]], "
"[[ui:Previous row]], [[ui:Next row]] ja [[ui:Last row]], või Alt+Page Up, "
"Alt+Page Down, Alt+Home ja Alt+End."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid "Rows are counted without the row of column names."
msgstr "Ridu loetakse ilma veerunimede reata."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid "[[ui:Export PNG…]] saves the row that is shown."
msgstr "[[ui:Export PNG…]] salvestab näidatava rea."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/serial.md docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Print"
msgstr "Printimine"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Print]] prints one label for each row. [[ui:From row]] and [[ui:To "
"row]] limit the rows (all of them by default), [[ui:Copies of each label]] "
"sets how many of each are printed."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Print]] prindib ühe sildi iga rea kohta. [[ui:From row]] ja [[ui:To "
"row]] piiravad ridu (vaikimisi kõik), [[ui:Copies of each label]] määrab, "
"mitu igaüht prinditakse."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"Every label is a print job of its own, so this works on every printer.  A "
"cab printer gets up to [[ui:Labels per job]] labels as one job, which it "
"prints without stopping between them ([cab](printer.md#cab))."
msgstr ""
"Iga silt on omaette prinditöö, nii et see töötab igal printeril. cab-printer "
"saab kuni [[ui:Labels per job]] silti ühe tööna, mille see prindib nende "
"vahel peatumata ([cab](printer.md#cab))."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Stop]] in the bar above the window ends the series after the label "
"being printed (on a cab printer: after the job being printed); the first "
"label is always printed."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Stop]] akna kohal olevas ribas lõpetab seeria prinditava sildi järel "
"(cab-printeril: prinditava töö järel); esimene silt prinditakse alati."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"If the printer reports a problem, printing stops at that row; the message "
"says how many copies of it were already printed. Solve the problem, then "
"print again starting from that row."
msgstr ""
"Kui printer teatab probleemist, peatub printimine sellel real; teade ütleb, "
"mitu selle koopiat oli juba prinditud. Lahenda probleem, seejärel prindi "
"uuesti sellelt realt alates."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"On a label sheet each position gets one label: the rows in order, the copies "
"of a row on the positions after each other, starting at the positions chosen "
"for the first sheet. All sheets are one print job, so [[ui:Stop]] is not "
"offered. After a problem the message also says at which position of which "
"sheet the row to go on from belongs."
msgstr ""
"Sildilehel saab iga positsioon ühe sildi: read järjekorras, rea koopiad "
"järjestikustel positsioonidel, alustades esimese lehe jaoks valitud "
"positsioonidest. Kõik lehed on üks printimistöö, nii et [[ui:Stop]] ei "
"pakuta. Pärast probleemi ütleb teade ka, millisele lehele ja millisele "
"positsioonile kuulub rida, millest jätkata."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/serial.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Command line"
msgstr "Käsurida"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/serial.md
msgid ""
"`tavletta print shelf.tavletta --data items.csv --rows 3-10` prints rows 3 "
"to 10 without opening a window; see [Command line](use.md#command-line).  "
"With `--dry-run` each line of the listing starts with the row number."
msgstr ""
"`tavletta print shelf.tavletta --data items.csv --rows 3-10` prindib read 3 "
"kuni 10 ilma akent avamata; vaata [Käsurida](use.md#command-line). Valikuga "
"`--dry-run` algab loendi iga rida reanumbriga."

#. type: Title #
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server installation"
msgstr "Serveri paigaldus"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"This guide sets up the print server (`tavletta serve`) on a Linux server for "
"a company: other programs, for example an inventory tool, print labels "
"through it over the network. What the server does and how programs use it: "
"[Print server](server.md) and [API reference](api.md)."
msgstr ""
"See juhend paigaldab prindiserveri (`tavletta serve`) ettevõtte Linuxi "
"serverisse: teised programmid, näiteks inventariseerimistööriist, prindivad "
"selle kaudu silte võrgu kaudu. Mida server teeb ja kuidas programmid seda "
"kasutavad: [Prindiserver](server.md) ja [API viide](api.md)."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview { #overview }"
msgstr "Ülevaade { #overview }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"One small service: a REST API (and MCP for AI assistants) on port 8790.  It "
"renders the labels itself and sends them to the printers over the network; "
"no desktop, no database."
msgstr ""
"Üks väike teenus: REST API (ja MCP tehisintellekti assistentidele) pordil "
"8790. See renderdab sildid ise ja saadab need võrgu kaudu printeritesse; "
"ilma töölauata, ilma andmebaasita."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"A web page at the same address for people: sign in with a token, see the "
"printers, print a template or a series (from a CSV, XLSX or ODS file, a "
"pasted list or number ranges such as 3000–5685), upload and delete templates "
"with an admin token. `--no-web-ui` turns it off."
msgstr ""
"Veebileht samal aadressil inimestele: logi sisse tokeniga, vaata printereid, "
"prindi mall või seeria (CSV-, XLSX- või ODS-failist, kleebitud loendist või "
"arvuvahemikest nagu 3000–5685), laadi üles ja kustuta malle admin-tokeniga. "
"`--no-web-ui` lülitab selle välja."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"The printers it may use are named in `printers.toml`; no other address can "
"be printed on."
msgstr ""
"Printerid, mida see tohib kasutada, nimetatakse failis `printers.toml`; "
"muule aadressile printida ei saa."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Every program or device gets its own access token with a role "
"(`tokens.toml`); the file keeps only a fingerprint (hash) of each token."
msgstr ""
"Iga programm või seade saab oma pääsutokeni koos rolliga (`tokens.toml`); "
"fail hoiab ainult iga tokeni sõrmejälge (räsi)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"The labels are `.tavletta` files in a labels folder, designed in the "
"Tavletta app and copied there."
msgstr ""
"Sildid on `.tavletta`-failid siltide kaustas, kujundatud Tavletta rakenduses "
"ja sinna kopeeritud."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"It listens on `127.0.0.1` only. Other computers reach it through a reverse "
"proxy with HTTPS (Traefik, nginx, Caddy)."
msgstr ""
"See kuulab ainult aadressil `127.0.0.1`. Teised arvutid pääsevad sellele "
"ligi HTTPS-iga pöördvaheserveri kaudu (Traefik, nginx, Caddy)."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements { #requirements }"
msgstr "Nõuded { #requirements }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"A Linux server on x86-64 or ARM64 (a virtual machine or a Raspberry Pi 4/5 "
"is enough)."
msgstr ""
"Linuxi server x86-64 või ARM64 arhitektuuril (virtuaalmasin või Raspberry Pi "
"4/5 piisab)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Either Docker Engine with the Compose plugin (option A, recommended), or "
"Python 3.11 or newer with PyGObject, Pango and Cairo from the distribution "
"(option B)."
msgstr ""
"Kas Docker Engine koos Compose'i pluginaga (variant A, soovitatav) või "
"Python 3.11 või uuem koos distributsiooni PyGObjecti, Pango ja Cairoga "
"(variant B)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "Or Debian 13 or Fedora 44 on x86-64, for their packages (option C)."
msgstr ""
"Või Debian 13 või Fedora 44 x86-64-l nende pakettide jaoks (variant C)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Resources: 1 CPU core, 1 GB RAM reserved (the server usually uses 50–150 MB; "
"a large label is limited to 40 megapixels), 500 MB of disk for the image or "
"the installation, plus the labels."
msgstr ""
"Ressursid: 1 protsessorituum, 1 GB RAM-i reserveeritud (server kasutab "
"tavaliselt 50-150 MB; suur silt on piiratud 40 megapikslile), 500 MB "
"kettaruumi pildi või paigalduse jaoks ning sildid."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "Network from the server to the printers:"
msgstr "Võrk serverist printeriteni:"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  | Printer | Port |\n"
"  |---|---|\n"
"  | cab, Brother QL, ZPL, EPL2, TSPL, ESC/POS, DYMO and others printing \"raw\" | TCP 9100 |\n"
"  | Office printers and CUPS queues (IPP) | TCP 631 |\n"
"  | Brother VC-500W | TCP 9100 |\n"
msgstr ""
"  | Printer | Port |\n"
"  |---|---|\n"
"  | cab, Brother QL, ZPL, EPL2, TSPL, ESC/POS, DYMO ja teised \"raw\"-printerid | TCP 9100 |\n"
"  | Kontoriprinterid ja CUPS-järjekorrad (IPP) | TCP 631 |\n"
"  | Brother VC-500W | TCP 9100 |\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Only for finding printers automatically (mDNS) or USB printers: the host's "
"network (option A with `compose.host.yaml`) or a native installation."
msgstr ""
"Ainult printerite automaatseks leidmiseks (mDNS) või USB-printerite jaoks: "
"hosti võrk (variant A failiga `compose.host.yaml`) või natiivne paigaldus."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Fonts: every font the labels use must be installed on the server (see [Fonts]"
"(#fonts))."
msgstr ""
"Fondid: iga siltidel kasutatav font peab olema serverisse paigaldatud (vaata "
"[Fondid](#fonts))."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option A: Docker Compose { #docker }"
msgstr "Variant A: Docker Compose { #docker }"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Get the files and the image { #docker-build }"
msgstr "1. Hangi failid ja pilt { #docker-build }"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo git clone https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta.git /opt/tavletta\n"
"cd /opt/tavletta\n"
"sudo git checkout v1.2.2      # the release to run: git tag lists them\n"
"cd packaging/docker\n"
"sudo docker compose pull      # ghcr.io/joshii-h/tavletta:1.2, for x86-64 and ARM64\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"The image (about 230 MB), built and tested by the project's CI and signed "
"(see [Server and container](server.md#container)), contains Tavletta, "
"Python, Pango and Cairo, the fonts DejaVu, Source Sans 3, Liberation "
"(metrics of Arial, Times New Roman and Courier New) and Carlito (metrics of "
"Calibri). It runs as an unprivileged user, read-only, without capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Pilt (umbes 230 MB), mille projekti CI ehitab, testib ja allkirjastab (vaata "
"[Server ja konteiner](server.md#container)), sisaldab Tavlettat, Pythonit, "
"Pangot ja Cairot, fonte DejaVu, Source Sans 3, Liberation (Ariali, Times New "
"Romani ja Courier New mõõdud) ja Carlito (Calibri mõõdud). See töötab "
"õigusteta kasutajana, kirjutuskaitstuna, ilma capability'deta."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Folders { #docker-folders }"
msgstr "2. Kaustad { #docker-folders }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Everything that belongs to your installation lives in three folders next to "
"`compose.yaml` (git ignores them):"
msgstr ""
"Kõik, mis sinu paigaldusele kuulub, asub kolmes kaustas `compose.yaml`i "
"kõrval (git ignoreerib neid):"

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/opt/tavletta/packaging/docker/\n"
"├── compose.yaml\n"
"├── config/          printers.toml, tokens.toml\n"
"├── labels/          the label files (.tavletta) and their data files\n"
"└── fonts/           fonts of your own (.ttf, .otf), may stay empty\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo mkdir -p config labels fonts\n"
"sudo chown -R 1000:1000 config labels fonts\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"The container runs as user 1000 (set `TAVLETTA_UID` and `TAVLETTA_GID` for "
"another one): it reads `config/` and saves counters into the label files of "
"`labels/`."
msgstr ""
"Konteiner töötab kasutajana 1000 (teise jaoks sea `TAVLETTA_UID` ja "
"`TAVLETTA_GID`): see loeb kausta `config/` ja salvestab loendurid kausta "
"`labels/` sildifailidesse."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Printers: printers.toml { #printers }"
msgstr "3. Printerid: printers.toml { #printers }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"`config/printers.toml` names every printer programs may use. An example with "
"a cab printer for asset labels (thermal transfer, printed turned by 180 "
"degrees), a Brother QL at the reception and an office printer over IPP:"
msgstr ""
"`config/printers.toml` nimetab iga printeri, mida programmid tohivad "
"kasutada. Näide cab-printeriga varasiltide jaoks (termosiire, prinditud "
"pööratult 180 kraadi), Brother QL vastuvõtus ja kontoriprinter IPP kaudu:"

#. type: Fenced code block (toml)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[printers.it-cab]\n"
"backend = \"cab\"                          # cab EOS, SQUIX, MACH\n"
"host = \"cab-it.example.com\"              # name or IP address of the printer\n"
"description = \"Asset labels\"\n"
"location = \"IT store room\"\n"
"media = \"57 x 32 mm polyester, resin ribbon\"\n"
"default = true                           # used when a request names no printer\n"
"max_copies = 50\n"
"\n"
"[printers.it-cab.settings]\n"
"method = \"transfer\"                      # thermal transfer with ribbon (direct: without)\n"
"upside_down = true                       # printed turned by 180 degrees\n"
"\n"
"[printers.reception-ql]\n"
"backend = \"brother_ql\"                   # Brother QL-700, QL-8xx, QL-1100 …\n"
"host = \"192.0.2.21\"\n"
"description = \"Visitor and sample labels\"\n"
"location = \"Reception\"\n"
"media = \"DK-22205, 62 mm continuous\"\n"
"max_copies = 20\n"
"cut = \"full\"\n"
"\n"
"[printers.reception-ql.settings]\n"
"quality = \"high\"\n"
"\n"
"[printers.office]\n"
"backend = \"system\"                       # any IPP printer or CUPS queue\n"
"host = \"ipp://office-printer.example.com/ipp/print\"\n"
"description = \"Label sheets, A4\"\n"
"max_copies = 10\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"`backend` is the printer model: `cab`, `brother_ql`, `brother_ql_diecut`, "
"`ptouch`, `vc500w`, `zpl`, `epl`, `tspl`, `escpos`, `dymo`, `niimbot`, "
"`system` (`tavletta list-printers` shows them)."
msgstr ""
"`backend` on printerimudel: `cab`, `brother_ql`, `brother_ql_diecut`, "
"`ptouch`, `vc500w`, `zpl`, `epl`, `tspl`, `escpos`, `dymo`, `niimbot`, "
"`system` (`tavletta list-printers` näitab neid)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"`host` is the printer's name or IP address; for `system` an IPP address. "
"Give printers a fixed address (DHCP reservation or DNS name)."
msgstr ""
"`host` on printeri nimi või IP-aadress; `system` puhul IPP-aadress. Anna "
"printeritele püsiv aadress (DHCP-reserveering või DNS-nimi)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"The settings of a model are those of the app's printer settings; the full "
"list is in [docs/server.md](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/"
"branch/main/docs/server.md)."
msgstr ""
"Mudeli seaded on rakenduse printeriseaded; täielik loend on failis [docs/"
"server.md](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/branch/main/docs/"
"server.md)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"A mistake stops the server with the file, the key and the problem, for "
"example `printers.toml: printers.it-cab.settings.method: expected one of: "
"printer, transfer, direct`. Changes need a restart."
msgstr ""
"Viga peatab serveri koos faili, võtme ja probleemiga, näiteks "
"`printers.toml: printers.it-cab.settings.method: expected one of: printer, "
"transfer, direct`. Muudatused vajavad taaskäivitust."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Access tokens: tokens.toml { #tokens }"
msgstr "4. Pääsutokenid: tokens.toml { #tokens }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Create one token per program or device. The token is shown once; the file "
"keeps only its hash."
msgstr ""
"Loo üks token programmi või seadme kohta. Token näidatakse üks kord; fail "
"hoiab ainult selle räsi."

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo docker run --rm --user 1000:1000 -v ./config:/config --entrypoint tavletta \\\n"
"    ghcr.io/joshii-h/tavletta:1.2 token new inventory-tool --role print --printer it-cab \\\n"
"    --description \"Inventory tool\" \\\n"
"    --tokens /config/tokens.toml --printers /config/printers.toml\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"tav_3f9c0a1b2c4d_Xq2…\n"
"tavletta: The token is shown only this once; /config/tokens.toml keeps only its hash.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Give the token to the program's administrator over a safe channel (a "
"password manager), never by e-mail."
msgstr ""
"Anna token programmi administraatorile turvalise kanali kaudu "
"(paroolihaldur), mitte kunagi e-postiga."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Roles: `preview` (look only), `print` (also print, see its own jobs), "
"`admin` (see and cancel every job). Give programs `print`, monitoring "
"`preview`."
msgstr ""
"Rollid: `preview` (ainult vaatamine), `print` (ka printimine, oma tööde "
"vaatamine), `admin` (iga töö vaatamine ja tühistamine). Anna programmidele "
"`print`, seirele `preview`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"`--printer` (repeatable) limits the token to these printers; `--expires "
"2027-12-31` to a date."
msgstr ""
"`--printer` (korratav) piirab tokeni nende printeritega; `--expires "
"2027-12-31` kuupäevaga."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Always pass `--printers`: once a token is limited to printers, the file can "
"only be checked with the printer list."
msgstr ""
"Anna alati `--printers`: kui token on piiratud printeritega, saab faili "
"kontrollida ainult printerite loendiga."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"New tokens work at once, without a restart. To revoke one, delete its entry "
"from `config/tokens.toml`."
msgstr ""
"Uued tokenid töötavad kohe, taaskäivituseta. Tokeni tühistamiseks kustuta "
"selle kirje failist `config/tokens.toml`."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "5. Labels { #labels }"
msgstr "5. Sildid { #labels }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Design the labels in the Tavletta app and copy the `.tavletta` files into "
"`labels/` (subfolders are allowed). Programs name them without the ending: "
"`labels/inventory/asset-tag.tavletta` is `\"label\": \"inventory/asset-"
"tag\"`."
msgstr ""
"Kujunda sildid Tavletta rakenduses ja kopeeri `.tavletta`-failid kausta "
"`labels/` (alamkaustad on lubatud). Programmid nimetavad neid ilma "
"laiendita: `labels/inventory/asset-tag.tavletta` on `\"label\": \"inventory/"
"asset-tag\"`."

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo cp asset-tag.tavletta labels/\n"
"sudo chown 1000:1000 labels/asset-tag.tavletta\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "6. Start { #docker-start }"
msgstr "6. Käivitamine { #docker-start }"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo docker compose up -d\n"
"sudo docker compose ps\n"
"curl http://127.0.0.1:8790/api/v1/health\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "{\"status\": \"ok\", \"version\": \"1.2.2\"}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "The container restarts by itself after a crash or a reboot."
msgstr "Konteiner taaskäivitub ise pärast kokkujooksmist või taaskäivitust."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Set the time zone of `{=date}` and `{=time}` on labels with "
"`TAVLETTA_TZ=Europe/Zurich` in a file `.env` next to `compose.yaml` (UTC by "
"default)."
msgstr ""
"Sea siltide `{=date}` ja `{=time}` ajavöönd valikuga `TAVLETTA_TZ=Europe/"
"Zurich` failis `.env` `compose.yaml`i kõrval (vaikimisi UTC)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "Check the token and the printers:"
msgstr "Kontrolli tokenit ja printereid:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  TOKEN=tav_3f9c0a1b2c4d_Xq2…\n"
"  curl -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" http://127.0.0.1:8790/api/v1/printers\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Each printer is listed with its state; `UNREACHABLE` with a message if\n"
"  the server cannot reach it.\n"
"- Open `http://127.0.0.1:8790/` in a browser on the server (others use\n"
"  the proxy's address, see [Reverse proxy](#proxy)) and sign in with a\n"
"  token: the web page shows what its role may do. The page keeps the\n"
"  token in the browser tab only, until the tab is closed or \"Sign out\".\n"
msgstr ""
"  Iga printer on loetletud oma olekuga; `UNREACHABLE` koos teatega, kui\n"
"  server ei saa seda kätte.\n"
"- Ava `http://127.0.0.1:8790/` serveris brauseris (teised kasutavad\n"
"  proksi aadressi, vt [Pöördvaheserver](#proxy)) ja logi sisse\n"
"  tokeniga: veebileht näitab, mida tema roll lubab. Leht hoiab\n"
"  tokenit ainult brauseri vahekaardil, kuni vahekaart suletakse või \"Logi välja\".\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Host network: mDNS and USB { #docker-host }"
msgstr "Hosti võrk: mDNS ja USB { #docker-host }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"To find printers on the network by mDNS, to print on CUPS queues of the host "
"or on USB printers, start with the override `compose.host.yaml`:"
msgstr ""
"Printerite leidmiseks võrgust mDNS-iga, hosti CUPS-järjekordadele või USB-"
"printeritele printimiseks käivita ülekirjutusega `compose.host.yaml`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo docker compose -f compose.yaml -f compose.host.yaml up -d\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The container then shares the host's network and listens on\n"
"`127.0.0.1:8790` of the host. CUPS queues of the host are\n"
"`ipp://localhost:631/printers/<queue>` in `printers.toml`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Konteiner jagab siis hosti võrku ja kuulab hosti aadressil\n"
"`127.0.0.1:8790`. Hosti CUPS-järjekorrad on\n"
"`ipp://localhost:631/printers/<queue>` failis `printers.toml`.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Logs { #docker-logs }"
msgstr "Logid { #docker-logs }"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo docker compose logs -f\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Each request is logged with the client's address, the token's name, the path "
"and the status; each job with its label, printer and outcome. Tokens and "
"label contents are never logged."
msgstr ""
"Iga päring logitakse kliendi aadressi, tokeni nime, tee ja olekuga; iga töö "
"oma sildi, printeri ja tulemusega. Tokeneid ja siltide sisu ei logita kunagi."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Updating { #docker-update }"
msgstr "Uuendamine { #docker-update }"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cd /opt/tavletta\n"
"sudo git fetch --tags\n"
"sudo git checkout v1.2.2         # the new release\n"
"cd packaging/docker\n"
"sudo docker compose pull\n"
"sudo docker compose up -d\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Read the release notes first. Waiting jobs are canceled when the server "
"stops; a label being printed is finished. `config/`, `labels/` and `fonts/` "
"are kept."
msgstr ""
"Loe esmalt väljalaskemärkmeid. Ootavad tööd tühistatakse serveri peatumisel; "
"praegu prinditav silt lõpetatakse. Kaustad `config/`, `labels/` ja `fonts/` "
"säilivad."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Backup { #docker-backup }"
msgstr "Varundus { #docker-backup }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Back up the three folders: `config/` (the printer list, the token hashes), "
"`labels/` (the labels and their counters: the next number of each label with "
"`{=counter}` is saved in its file) and `fonts/`. The image can be pulled "
"again at any time."
msgstr ""
"Varunda kolm kausta: `config/` (printerite loend, tokenite räsid), `labels/` "
"(sildid ja nende loendurid: iga `{=counter}`-sildi järgmine number "
"salvestatakse selle faili) ja `fonts/`. Pildi saab igal ajal uuesti alla "
"tõmmata."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Uninstalling { #docker-uninstall }"
msgstr "Eemaldamine { #docker-uninstall }"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cd /opt/tavletta/packaging/docker\n"
"sudo docker compose down\n"
"sudo docker image rm ghcr.io/joshii-h/tavletta:1.2\n"
"sudo rm -r /opt/tavletta     # also deletes config, labels and fonts\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option B: native with systemd { #native }"
msgstr "Variant B: natiivne systemd-ga { #native }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"For a server without Docker. Tested on Debian 13, Ubuntu 24.04 and Fedora "
"44. The installation needs internet access (Python packages from PyPI, one "
"from GitHub)."
msgstr ""
"Serveri jaoks ilma Dockerita. Testitud Debian 13, Ubuntu 24.04 ja Fedora 44 "
"peal. Paigaldus vajab internetiühendust (Pythoni paketid PyPI-st, üks "
"GitHubist)."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. System packages { #native-packages }"
msgstr "1. Süsteemipaketid { #native-packages }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "Debian, Ubuntu:"
msgstr "Debian, Ubuntu:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo apt install python3 python3-venv python3-gi python3-gi-cairo gir1.2-pango-1.0 \\\n"
"    gettext git fontconfig fonts-dejavu-core\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "Fedora:"
msgstr "Fedora:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo dnf install python3 python3-gobject gobject-introspection pango gettext git-core\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "No GTK is needed. `gettext` and `git` are needed only while installing."
msgstr "GTK-d pole vaja. `gettext` ja `git` on vaja ainult paigaldamise ajal."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Install Tavletta { #native-install }"
msgstr "2. Paigalda Tavletta { #native-install }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Into its own Python environment in `/opt/tavletta`, which uses the system's "
"PyGObject:"
msgstr ""
"Oma Pythoni keskkonda kaustas `/opt/tavletta`, mis kasutab süsteemi "
"PyGObjecti:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo python3 -m venv --system-site-packages /opt/tavletta\n"
"sudo /opt/tavletta/bin/pip install \"git+https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta.git@v1.2.2\"\n"
"/opt/tavletta/bin/tavletta --version\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Service user and folders { #native-user }"
msgstr "3. Teenusekasutaja ja kaustad { #native-user }"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo useradd --system --home-dir /var/lib/tavletta --create-home \\\n"
"    --shell /usr/sbin/nologin tavletta\n"
"sudo install -d -o tavletta -g tavletta -m 0750 /etc/tavletta /var/lib/tavletta/labels\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Path | Content | Owner, mode |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `/etc/tavletta/printers.toml` | the printers ([as above](#printers)) | `tavletta`, 600 |\n"
"| `/etc/tavletta/tokens.toml` | the token hashes | `tavletta`, 600 |\n"
"| `/var/lib/tavletta/labels/` | the label files | `tavletta`, 750 |\n"
"| `/usr/local/share/fonts/` | fonts of your own | `root`, readable by all |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Tee | Sisu | Omanik, režiim |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `/etc/tavletta/printers.toml` | printerid ([nagu ülal](#printers)) | `tavletta`, 600 |\n"
"| `/etc/tavletta/tokens.toml` | tokenite räsid | `tavletta`, 600 |\n"
"| `/var/lib/tavletta/labels/` | sildifailid | `tavletta`, 750 |\n"
"| `/usr/local/share/fonts/` | oma fondid | `root`, kõigile loetav |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "Create the tokens as the service user, so the file belongs to it:"
msgstr "Loo tokenid teenusekasutajana, et fail kuuluks talle:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo -u tavletta /opt/tavletta/bin/tavletta token new inventory-tool --role print \\\n"
"    --printer it-cab --tokens /etc/tavletta/tokens.toml --printers /etc/tavletta/printers.toml\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"The server refuses a `tokens.toml` that every user may change, and warns "
"about one that others may read."
msgstr ""
"Server keeldub failist `tokens.toml`, mida iga kasutaja saab muuta, ja "
"hoiatab faili eest, mida teised saavad lugeda."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. The service { #native-service }"
msgstr "4. Teenus { #native-service }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"`packaging/systemd/tavletta-server.service` runs the server as `tavletta`, "
"sandboxed (read-only system, no home folders, no capabilities, 1 GB memory):"
msgstr ""
"`packaging/systemd/tavletta-server.service` käivitab serveri kasutajana "
"`tavletta`, liivakastis (kirjutuskaitstud süsteem, ei mingeid kodukaustu, ei "
"mingeid capability'sid, 1 GB mälu):"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo curl -fsSLo /etc/systemd/system/tavletta-server.service \\\n"
"    https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/raw/tag/v1.2.2/packaging/systemd/tavletta-server.service\n"
"sudo systemctl daemon-reload\n"
"sudo systemctl enable --now tavletta-server\n"
"systemctl status tavletta-server\n"
"curl http://127.0.0.1:8790/api/v1/health\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"`sudo systemctl reload tavletta-server` reads `tokens.toml` again (SIGHUP); "
"it is also read again whenever it changes."
msgstr ""
"`sudo systemctl reload tavletta-server` loeb faili `tokens.toml` uuesti "
"(SIGHUP); see loetakse uuesti ka alati, kui see muutub."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"`sudo systemctl restart tavletta-server` after changing `printers.toml` or "
"installing fonts."
msgstr ""
"`sudo systemctl restart tavletta-server` pärast faili `printers.toml` "
"muutmist või fontide paigaldamist."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "Logs: `journalctl -u tavletta-server -f`."
msgstr "Logid: `journalctl -u tavletta-server -f`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "The time zone is the server's (`timedatectl`)."
msgstr "Ajavöönd on serveri oma (`timedatectl`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"For a single user on a desktop there is the user service `packaging/systemd/"
"tavletta.service` instead."
msgstr ""
"Ühe kasutaja jaoks töölaual on selle asemel kasutajateenus `packaging/"
"systemd/tavletta.service`."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Updating { #native-update }"
msgstr "Uuendamine { #native-update }"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo /opt/tavletta/bin/pip install --upgrade \"git+https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta.git@v1.2.2\"\n"
"sudo curl -fsSLo /etc/systemd/system/tavletta-server.service \\\n"
"    https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/raw/tag/v1.2.2/packaging/systemd/tavletta-server.service\n"
"sudo systemctl daemon-reload\n"
"sudo systemctl restart tavletta-server\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "Back up `/etc/tavletta`, `/var/lib/tavletta/labels` and your fonts."
msgstr "Varunda `/etc/tavletta`, `/var/lib/tavletta/labels` ja oma fondid."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option C: Debian or Fedora package { #package }"
msgstr "Variant C: Debiani või Fedora pakett { #package }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Each release has packages for Debian 13 (trixie) and Fedora 44 on x86-64: "
"Tavletta, the Python packages it needs that the distribution does not have, "
"and `tavletta-server`, the service of option B, installed but not enabled, "
"with the user `tavletta` and its folders. Installing them needs only the "
"distribution's package sources, no PyPI or GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Igal väljalasel on paketid Debian 13 (trixie) ja Fedora 44 jaoks x86-64-l: "
"Tavletta, selle vajalikud Pythoni paketid, mida distributsioonil pole, ja "
"`tavletta-server`, variandi B teenus, paigaldatud, kuid mitte lubatud, "
"kasutajaga `tavletta` ja selle kaustadega. Nende paigaldamiseks piisab "
"distributsiooni pakettiallikatest, PyPI-d ega GitHubi pole vaja."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Install { #package-install }"
msgstr "1. Paigaldus { #package-install }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"From the [latest release](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/"
"releases/latest), download into an empty folder the `.deb` files and "
"`SHA256SUMS-deb` (Debian), or the `.noarch.rpm` and `.x86_64.rpm` files and "
"`SHA256SUMS-rpm` (Fedora). Check and install them:"
msgstr ""
"[Viimasest väljalasest](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/"
"releases/latest) laadi tühja kausta alla `.deb`-failid ja `SHA256SUMS-deb` "
"(Debian) või `.noarch.rpm`- ja `.x86_64.rpm`-failid ja `SHA256SUMS-rpm` "
"(Fedora). Kontrolli ja paigalda need:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sha256sum --ignore-missing -c SHA256SUMS-deb && sudo apt install ./*.deb   # Debian\n"
"sha256sum --ignore-missing -c SHA256SUMS-rpm && sudo dnf install ./*.noarch.rpm ./*.x86_64.rpm   # Fedora\n"
"/usr/bin/tavletta --version\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Configure and start { #package-start }"
msgstr "2. Seadista ja käivita { #package-start }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"The package `tavletta-server` has made `/etc/tavletta` and `/var/lib/"
"tavletta/labels`, owned by `tavletta`, with the paths of [option B](#native-"
"user). Put `printers.toml` there ([as above](#printers)), make the tokens as "
"the service user, then start the service:"
msgstr ""
"Pakett `tavletta-server` on loonud kaustad `/etc/tavletta` ja `/var/lib/"
"tavletta/labels`, mille omanik on `tavletta`, [variandi B](#native-user) "
"teedega. Pane sinna `printers.toml` ([nagu ülal](#printers)), loo tokenid "
"teenusekasutajana, seejärel käivita teenus:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo install -o tavletta -g tavletta -m 600 printers.toml /etc/tavletta/\n"
"sudo -u tavletta /usr/bin/tavletta token new inventory-tool --role print \\\n"
"    --printer it-cab --tokens /etc/tavletta/tokens.toml --printers /etc/tavletta/printers.toml\n"
"sudo systemctl enable --now tavletta-server\n"
"curl http://127.0.0.1:8790/api/v1/health\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Reload, restart and logs work as in [option B](#native-service). The service "
"prints to network printers; it has no access to devices."
msgstr ""
"Taaslaadimine, taaskäivitus ja logid töötavad nagu [variandis B](#native-"
"service). Teenus prindib võrguprinteritele; sellel pole juurdepääsu "
"seadmetele."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Updating { #package-update }"
msgstr "Uuendamine { #package-update }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Install the packages of the new release the same way; a running service is "
"restarted with the new version. Back up `/etc/tavletta` and `/var/lib/"
"tavletta/labels`."
msgstr ""
"Paigalda uue väljalase paketid samamoodi; töötav teenus taaskäivitatakse uue "
"versiooniga. Varunda `/etc/tavletta` ja `/var/lib/tavletta/labels`."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reverse proxy and HTTPS { #proxy }"
msgstr "Pöördvaheserver ja HTTPS { #proxy }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"The server speaks plain HTTP on `127.0.0.1`. Other computers reach it "
"through a reverse proxy that adds HTTPS. Give the server the proxy's address "
"with `--trusted-proxy`, so the log and the limits per client see the real "
"client, not the proxy."
msgstr ""
"Server räägib lihtsat HTTP-d aadressil `127.0.0.1`. Teised arvutid pääsevad "
"sellele ligi pöördvaheserveri kaudu, mis lisab HTTPS-i. Anna serverile "
"vaheserveri aadress valikuga `--trusted-proxy`, et logi ja kliendipõhised "
"piirangud näeksid tegelikku klienti, mitte vaheserverit."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Traefik (Docker) { #traefik }"
msgstr "Traefik (Docker) { #traefik }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Traefik and Tavletta in one Docker network, Traefik with a fixed address. In "
"`compose.yaml`, remove `ports:` (the server is then reached only through "
"Traefik) and add:"
msgstr ""
"Traefik ja Tavletta ühes Dockeri võrgus, Traefikul püsiaadress. Eemalda "
"failist `compose.yaml` `ports:` (serverile pääseb siis ligi ainult Traefiku "
"kaudu) ja lisa:"

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"services:\n"
"  tavletta:\n"
"    # ... as in compose.yaml, without ports:\n"
"    networks: [proxy]\n"
"    command:\n"
"      - \"--mcp\"\n"
"      - \"--printers\"\n"
"      - \"/config/printers.toml\"\n"
"      - \"--tokens\"\n"
"      - \"/config/tokens.toml\"\n"
"      - \"--trusted-proxy\"\n"
"      - \"172.30.0.10/32\"          # Traefik's address in the network\n"
"    labels:\n"
"      - \"traefik.enable=true\"\n"
"      - \"traefik.http.routers.tavletta.rule=Host(`labels.example.com`)\"\n"
"      - \"traefik.http.routers.tavletta.entrypoints=websecure\"\n"
"      - \"traefik.http.routers.tavletta.tls.certresolver=letsencrypt\"\n"
"      - \"traefik.http.services.tavletta.loadbalancer.server.port=8790\"\n"
"\n"
"networks:\n"
"  proxy:\n"
"    external: true                # Traefik's network, Traefik at 172.30.0.10\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "nginx { #nginx }"
msgstr "nginx { #nginx }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"The server on `127.0.0.1` answers only requests for a local host name "
"(against DNS rebinding): nginx must not pass on the public name. Its default "
"(`127.0.0.1:8790`) is right; do not add `proxy_set_header Host $host`."
msgstr ""
"Server aadressil `127.0.0.1` vastab ainult kohaliku hostinime päringutele "
"(DNS-i rebindingu vastu): nginx ei tohi avalikku nime edasi anda. Selle "
"vaikeväärtus (`127.0.0.1:8790`) on õige; ära lisa `proxy_set_header Host "
"$host`."

#. type: Fenced code block (nginx)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"server {\n"
"    listen 443 ssl;\n"
"    server_name labels.example.com;\n"
"    ssl_certificate     /etc/ssl/certs/labels.example.com.pem;\n"
"    ssl_certificate_key /etc/ssl/private/labels.example.com.key;\n"
"\n"
"    client_max_body_size 4m;           # as the server's --max-body\n"
"    location / {\n"
"        proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:8790;\n"
"        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;\n"
"        proxy_read_timeout 330s;       # print requests may wait up to 300 s\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Start the server with `--trusted-proxy 127.0.0.1/32` (append it to "
"`ExecStart` in the service, or to `command:` in `compose.yaml`)."
msgstr ""
"Käivita server valikuga `--trusted-proxy 127.0.0.1/32` (lisa see teenuse "
"`ExecStart`-ile või `compose.yaml`i `command:`-ile)."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Caddy { #caddy }"
msgstr "Caddy { #caddy }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Caddy passes on the public host name by default; set it to the server's own:"
msgstr ""
"Caddy annab vaikimisi avaliku hostinime edasi; sea see serveri enda omaks:"

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"labels.example.com {\n"
"    reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8790 {\n"
"        header_up Host {upstream_hostport}\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Caddy gets a certificate by itself. Start the server with `--trusted-proxy "
"127.0.0.1/32`."
msgstr ""
"Caddy hangib sertifikaadi ise. Käivita server valikuga `--trusted-proxy "
"127.0.0.1/32`."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Firewall { #firewall }"
msgstr "Tulemüür { #firewall }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Open only the proxy's port 443, and only for the networks that need it (the "
"inventory tool's server, the clients' VLAN)."
msgstr ""
"Ava ainult vaheserveri port 443 ja ainult võrkudele, kes seda vajavad "
"(inventariseerimistööriista server, klientide VLAN)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Port 8790 stays closed: the server listens on `127.0.0.1` (Docker publishes "
"it on `127.0.0.1` only)."
msgstr ""
"Port 8790 jääb suletuks: server kuulab aadressil `127.0.0.1` (Docker avaldab "
"selle ainult aadressil `127.0.0.1`)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "Outgoing from the server to the printers: TCP 9100 and 631."
msgstr "Väljuv serverist printeritele: TCP 9100 ja 631."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "Never make the server reachable from the internet."
msgstr "Ära kunagi tee serverit internetist kättesaadavaks."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Signing in with OpenID Connect { #oidc }"
msgstr "Sisselogimine OpenID Connectiga { #oidc }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"People can sign in to the web page with your organisation's identity "
"provider (Keycloak, Authentik, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta …) instead of an "
"access token; their roles at the provider become Tavletta's roles.  Programs "
"keep using tokens. It needs HTTPS through the reverse proxy (only `http://"
"localhost` works without, for testing)."
msgstr ""
"Inimesed saavad veebilehele sisse logida oma organisatsiooni "
"identiteedipakkujaga (Keycloak, Authentik, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta …) "
"pääsutokeni asemel; nende rollid pakkujal muutuvad Tavletta rollideks. "
"Programmid kasutavad edasi tokeneid. See vajab HTTPS-i pöördvaheserveri "
"kaudu (ilma selleta töötab testimiseks ainult `http://localhost`)."

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Register a client at the provider: confidential (with a secret), the "
"authorization code flow only, PKCE S256, redirect URI `https://"
"labels.example.com/oidc/callback`, post-logout redirect URI `https://"
"labels.example.com/`. Make the roles or groups reach the ID token: in "
"Keycloak a mapper *User Client Role* (or *User Realm Role*)  on the client "
"with *Add to ID token* on; Authentik sends `groups`."
msgstr ""
"Registreeri pakkujal klient: confidential (saladusega), ainult authorization "
"code flow, PKCE S256, ümbersuunamise URI `https://labels.example.com/oidc/"
"callback`, väljalogimisjärgne ümbersuunamise URI `https://labels.example.com/"
"`. Too rollid või grupid ID-tokenisse: Keycloakis klient-mapper *User Client "
"Role* (või *User Realm Role*) sisselülitatud *Add to ID token*-iga; "
"Authentik saadab `groups`."

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Put the secret into `config/oidc-secret` (the secret alone, mode 600)  and "
"write `config/oidc.toml` (`cp oidc.example.toml config/oidc.toml` gives a "
"commented start):"
msgstr ""
"Pane saladus faili `config/oidc-secret` (ainult saladus, õigused 600) ja "
"kirjuta `config/oidc.toml` (`cp oidc.example.toml config/oidc.toml` annab "
"kommenteeritud alguse):"

#. type: Fenced code block (toml)
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   [oidc]\n"
"   issuer = \"https://id.example.com/realms/example\"\n"
"   client_id = \"tavletta\"\n"
"   client_secret_file = \"/config/oidc-secret\"\n"
"   public_url = \"https://labels.example.com\"\n"
"   provider_name = \"Example ID\"\n"
"   roles_claim = \"resource_access.tavletta.roles\"   # Authentik: \"groups\"\n"
"\n"
"   [oidc.roles]\n"
"   preview = [\"tavletta-preview\"]\n"
"   print = [\"tavletta-print\"]\n"
"   admin = [\"tavletta-admin\"]\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Add `\"--oidc\"` and `\"/config/oidc.toml\"` to `command:` in `compose.yaml` "
"(native: to `ExecStart`, with `/etc/tavletta/...`), keep `--trusted-proxy`, "
"and restart. With `--trusted-proxy` the server needs `public_url` and does "
"not start without it."
msgstr ""
"Lisa `\"--oidc\"` ja `\"/config/oidc.toml\"` failis `compose.yaml` "
"väärtusele `command:` (natiivselt: väärtusele `ExecStart`, koos `/etc/"
"tavletta/...`), jäta `--trusted-proxy` alles ja taaskäivita. Valikuga `--"
"trusted-proxy` vajab server `public_url` ja ilma selleta ei käivitu."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Signing in needs PyJWT, which the container image and the deb and rpm "
"packages have; the Flatpak has not, and nothing can be installed into it: "
"run the server from one of the others for `--oidc`."
msgstr ""
"Sisselogimine vajab PyJWT-d, mis on konteineri pildil ning deb- ja rpm-"
"pakettidel; Flatpakil seda pole ja sinna ei saa midagi paigaldada: valiku `--"
"oidc` jaoks käivita server ühest teisest."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"The page then shows \"Sign in with Example ID\". Someone without one of the "
"roles gets \"no access\". A session lasts 8 hours, or 60 minutes without use "
"(`session_hours`, `idle_minutes`); a role removed or an account disabled at "
"the provider counts from the next sign in, so keep sessions short where "
"admins sign in. `token_login = false` hides the token field on the page. "
"Printers can be limited per role (`[oidc.printers]`) or by a claim "
"(`printers_claim`). Every key and the security details: [docs/server.md]"
"(https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/branch/main/docs/"
"server.md#signing-in-with-openid-connect-oidctoml)."
msgstr ""
"Leht näitab siis „Logi sisse: Example ID”. Isik, kellel pole ühtegi rolli, "
"saab „pole juurdepääsu”. Seanss kestab 8 tundi või 60 minutit kasutamata "
"(`session_hours`, `idle_minutes`); pakkujal eemaldatud roll või keelatud "
"konto jõustub alates järgmisest sisselogimisest, nii et hoia seansid "
"lühikesed seal, kus administraatorid sisse logivad. `token_login = false` "
"peidab lehel tokeni välja. Printereid saab piirata rolli järgi "
"(`[oidc.printers]`) või claimiga (`printers_claim`). Iga võti ja "
"turvadetailid: [docs/server.md](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/"
"src/branch/main/docs/server.md#signing-in-with-openid-connect-oidctoml)."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fonts { #fonts }"
msgstr "Fondid { #fonts }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"A label is drawn with the fonts of the computer that prints it. A text in a "
"font the server does not have is drawn in another one; the preview and the "
"print job then warn with `font_missing` (for example `Element 2: the font "
"Source Sans 3 is not installed – another font is used`)."
msgstr ""
"Silt joonistatakse selle arvuti fontidega, mis prindib. Tekst fondis, mida "
"serveris pole, joonistatakse teises; eelvaade ja printimistöö hoiatavad siis "
"koodiga `font_missing` (näiteks `Element 2: the font Source Sans 3 is not "
"installed – another font is used`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"A metric-compatible stand-in counts as installed: it has the same widths, so "
"the text takes the room it was designed for. Liberation Sans stands in for "
"Arial and Helvetica (Liberation Sans Narrow for Arial Narrow), Liberation "
"Serif for Times New Roman, Liberation Mono for Courier New, Carlito for "
"Calibri, Caladea for Cambria, Gelasio for Georgia, and the TeX Gyre fonts "
"for Helvetica, Times and Courier; also for their styles named as a family "
"(`Arial Bold`, `Calibri Light`). Only a stand-in that is installed counts: "
"without one, Arial is warned about."
msgstr ""
"Mõõtudega ühilduv asendaja loetakse paigaldatuks: sellel on samad laiused, "
"nii et tekst võtab ruumi, milleks see kujundati. Liberation Sans asendab "
"Ariali ja Helveticat (Liberation Sans Narrow Arial Narrow'd), Liberation "
"Serif Times New Romani, Liberation Mono Courier New'd, Carlito Calibrit, "
"Caladea Cambriat, Gelasio Georgiat ja TeX Gyre fondid Helveticat, Timesi ja "
"Couriert; ka nende perekonnana nimetatud stiilid (`Arial Bold`, `Calibri "
"Light`). Arvestatakse ainult paigaldatud asendajat: ilma selleta hoiatatakse "
"Ariali eest."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Docker: the image has DejaVu, Source Sans 3, Liberation and Carlito.  Copy "
"other fonts (`.ttf`, `.otf`, e.g. the corporate font) into `fonts/` and "
"restart: `sudo docker compose restart`. More Debian font packages: build the "
"image yourself, `sudo docker compose -f compose.yaml -f compose.build.yaml "
"build --build-arg FONTS=\"fonts-dejavu-core fonts-adobe-sourcesans3 fonts-"
"liberation fonts-crosextra-carlito fonts-noto-core\"`, then `up -d` with the "
"same two files."
msgstr ""
"Docker: pildil on DejaVu, Source Sans 3, Liberation ja Carlito. Kopeeri muud "
"fondid (`.ttf`, `.otf`, nt ettevõtte font) kausta `fonts/` ja taaskäivita: "
"`sudo docker compose restart`. Rohkem Debiani fondipakette: ehita pilt ise, "
"`sudo docker compose -f compose.yaml -f compose.build.yaml build --build-arg "
"FONTS=\"fonts-dejavu-core fonts-adobe-sourcesans3 fonts-liberation fonts-"
"crosextra-carlito fonts-noto-core\"`, seejärel `up -d` samade kahe failiga."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Native: install the distribution's font packages (Debian, Ubuntu: `fonts-"
"adobe-sourcesans3`; Fedora: `adobe-source-sans-pro-fonts`) or copy the font "
"files to `/usr/local/share/fonts/`, then `sudo fc-cache -f` and restart the "
"service."
msgstr ""
"Natiivne: paigalda distributsiooni fondipaketid (Debian, Ubuntu: `fonts-"
"adobe-sourcesans3`; Fedora: `adobe-source-sans-pro-fonts`) või kopeeri "
"fondifailid kausta `/usr/local/share/fonts/`, seejärel `sudo fc-cache -f` ja "
"taaskäivita teenus."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Check what the server has: `fc-list : family` (in the container: `sudo "
"docker compose exec tavletta fc-list : family`)."
msgstr ""
"Kontrolli, mis serveris on: `fc-list : family` (konteineris: `sudo docker "
"compose exec tavletta fc-list : family`)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Fonts may need a license for use on a server; Source Sans 3, Liberation, "
"Carlito, DejaVu and Noto are free."
msgstr ""
"Fondid võivad vajada litsentsi serveris kasutamiseks; Source Sans 3, "
"Liberation, Carlito, DejaVu ja Noto on vabad."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Security checklist { #security }"
msgstr "Turvakontrollnimekiri { #security }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"One token per program or device, with the smallest role (`print` for "
"programs, `preview` for monitoring) and limited to its printers (`--"
"printer`); an expiry date for temporary ones."
msgstr ""
"Üks token programmi või seadme kohta, väikseima rolliga (`print` "
"programmidele, `preview` seirele) ja piiratud selle printeritega (`--"
"printer`); ajutistele aegumiskuupäev."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "Tokens kept in a password manager; `tokens.toml` mode 600."
msgstr "Tokenid paroolihalduris; `tokens.toml` režiimis 600."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "`printers.toml` in use: programs can print only on these printers."
msgstr ""
"`printers.toml` kasutusel: programmid saavad printida ainult nendele "
"printeritele."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "`max_copies` per printer set to what is sensible."
msgstr "`max_copies` printeri kohta seatud mõistlikule väärtusele."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"The server reachable only through the HTTPS proxy, only from the networks "
"that need it; never from the internet."
msgstr ""
"Server kättesaadav ainult HTTPS-vaheserveri kaudu, ainult võrkudest, mis "
"seda vajavad; mitte kunagi internetist."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "`--trusted-proxy` set to the proxy's own address, nothing wider."
msgstr "`--trusted-proxy` seatud vaheserveri enda aadressile, mitte laiemaks."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"With `--oidc`: `public_url` set, the client confidential with PKCE, only the "
"roles people need, short sessions where admins sign in, `oidc-secret` mode "
"600."
msgstr ""
"Valikuga `--oidc`: `public_url` seatud, klient confidential koos PKCE-ga, "
"ainult rollid, mida inimesed vajavad, lühikesed seansid seal, kus "
"administraatorid sisse logivad, `oidc-secret` õigustega 600."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"No one prints from a browser: `--no-web-ui` (the web page needs no token to "
"load, but shows nothing without one)."
msgstr ""
"Keegi ei prindi brauserist: `--no-web-ui` (veebileht ei vaja laadimiseks "
"tokenit, kuid ilma selleta ei näita midagi)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"Updates: watch the releases and update within weeks; the image of each "
"release brings Debian's security updates of its day (`docker compose pull`)."
msgstr ""
"Uuendused: jälgi väljalaskeid ja uuenda nädalate jooksul; iga väljalaske "
"pilt toob kaasa Debiani selle päeva turvauuendused (`docker compose pull`)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid "Backup of `config/` (or `/etc/tavletta`) and the labels."
msgstr "Kausta `config/` (või `/etc/tavletta`) ja siltide varukoopia."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
msgid ""
"The details of every protection (limits, rate limit, file access, web "
"pages): [docs/server.md](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/"
"branch/main/docs/server.md#security)."
msgstr ""
"Iga kaitse üksikasjad (piirangud, kiiruspiirang, failidele juurdepääs, "
"veebilehed): [docs/server.md](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/"
"src/branch/main/docs/server.md#security)."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting { #troubleshooting }"
msgstr "Tõrkeotsing { #troubleshooting }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server-install.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Symptom | Cause and remedy |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| A printer is `UNREACHABLE` (`printer_timeout`, `printer_not_found`) | The server cannot reach it: test from the server with `nc -vz <printer> 9100` (631 for IPP); check the address, the firewall, that the printer is on. In Docker the container must reach the printer's network. |\n"
"| `401 unauthorized` | Token missing, mistyped, expired or removed from `tokens.toml`. The header is `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. |\n"
"| `429 too_many_requests` | Ten wrong tokens from this address within a minute: fix the token, wait a minute. Behind a reverse proxy not given with `--trusted-proxy` everyone shares the proxy's address. |\n"
"| `429 queue_full` | 100 jobs (20 per token) are waiting: the printer is slow or stopped; check it, retry later. |\n"
"| `503 busy` | All request or render slots are taken for a moment: retry after a second or two. |\n"
"| `404 printer_not_found` | Not in `printers.toml`, or the token may not use it (`--printer`). |\n"
"| `413 label_too_large` | The label has too many elements, too long texts or renders larger than 40 megapixels: simplify it or use fewer data rows per request. |\n"
"| `421 wrong_host` | A reverse proxy passes the public host name to a server on `127.0.0.1`: see [nginx](#nginx) and [Caddy](#caddy). |\n"
"| `font_missing` in the warnings, text looks wrong | The font is not installed on the server: see [Fonts](#fonts). |\n"
"| `other_labels_loaded` in the warnings | The printer has other labels loaded than the label's: load the matching roll, or check the label's size and gap. A ZPL printer may report a distance it measured on an earlier roll: calibrate it. |\n"
"| `409 counter_not_saved` | The label file is not writable for the server's user: `chown` it to the user (Docker: 1000, native: `tavletta`). |\n"
"| Date or time on labels off by an hour or two | The container runs on UTC: set `TAVLETTA_TZ=Europe/Zurich` in `.env`, then `docker compose up -d`. |\n"
"| \"Signing in did not work\" on the web page | The log says why: the provider cannot be reached, the redirect URI or secret is wrong at the provider, or the page is reached over plain HTTP (set `public_url`, `--trusted-proxy`). \"No access\": the roles do not reach the ID token (a mapper is missing) or none is mapped in `[oidc.roles]`. |\n"
"| The server does not start | `docker compose logs` or `journalctl -u tavletta-server`: a mistake in `printers.toml` or `tokens.toml` is named with its key. |\n"
"| Permission denied on the folders (Fedora, RHEL with SELinux and Podman) | Add `:Z` to the volumes in `compose.yaml`. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Sümptom | Põhjus ja lahendus |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| Printer on `UNREACHABLE` (`printer_timeout`, `printer_not_found`) | Server ei pääse sellele ligi: testi serverist käsuga `nc -vz <printer> 9100` (631 IPP jaoks); kontrolli aadressi, tulemüüri ja seda, et printer on sisse lülitatud. Dockeris peab konteiner printeri võrku ulatuma. |\n"
"| `401 unauthorized` | Token puudub, on valesti tipitud, aegunud või eemaldatud failist `tokens.toml`. Päis on `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. |\n"
"| `429 too_many_requests` | Kümme valet tokenit sellelt aadressilt minuti jooksul: paranda token, oota minut. Pöördvaheserveri taga, mida pole antud valikuga `--trusted-proxy`, jagavad kõik proksi aadressi. |\n"
"| `429 queue_full` | 100 tööd (20 tokeni kohta) ootab: printer on aeglane või peatunud; kontrolli seda, proovi hiljem uuesti. |\n"
"| `503 busy` | Kõik päringu- või renderduskohad on hetkeks hõivatud: proovi uuesti sekundi või kahe pärast. |\n"
"| `404 printer_not_found` | Pole failis `printers.toml` või token ei tohi seda kasutada (`--printer`). |\n"
"| `413 label_too_large` | Sildil on liiga palju elemente, liiga pikki tekste või see renderdub suuremaks kui 40 megapikslit: lihtsusta seda või kasuta päringu kohta vähem andmeridu. |\n"
"| `421 wrong_host` | Pöördvaheserver annab avaliku hostinime edasi aadressil `127.0.0.1` olevale serverile: vaata [nginx](#nginx) ja [Caddy](#caddy). |\n"
"| `font_missing` hoiatustes, tekst näeb vale välja | Fonti pole serverisse paigaldatud: vaata [Fondid](#fonts). |\n"
"| `other_labels_loaded` hoiatustes | Printerisse on laaditud teised sildid kui sildil: lae sobiv rull või kontrolli sildi suurust ja vahet. ZPL-printer võib teatada kauguse, mille ta mõõtis varasemal rullil: kalibreeri see. |\n"
"| `409 counter_not_saved` | Sildifaili ei saa serveri kasutajana kirjutada: `chown` see kasutajale (Docker: 1000, natiivne: `tavletta`). |\n"
"| Siltide kuupäev või kellaaeg on tunni või kahe võrra eksinud | Konteiner töötab UTC-s: sea `TAVLETTA_TZ=Europe/Zurich` failis `.env`, seejärel `docker compose up -d`. |\n"
"| „Sisselogimine ei õnnestunud” veebilehel | Logi ütleb miks: pakkujat ei saa kätte, ümbersuunamise URI või saladus on pakkujal vale või lehele pääsetakse lihtsa HTTP kaudu (sea `public_url`, `--trusted-proxy`). „Pole juurdepääsu”: rollid ei jõua ID-tokenisse (mapper puudub) või ühtegi pole `[oidc.roles]` all seotud. |\n"
"| Server ei käivitu | `docker compose logs` või `journalctl -u tavletta-server`: viga failis `printers.toml` või `tokens.toml` nimetatakse koos võtmega. |\n"
"| Juurdepääs kaustadele keelatud (Fedora, RHEL SELinuxi ja Podmaniga) | Lisa `:Z` faili `compose.yaml` volume'idele. |\n"

#. type: Title #
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Print server"
msgstr "Prindiserver"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Other programs, AI assistants and people in a browser can print labels "
"through Tavletta without opening the window: `tavletta serve` offers a web "
"page for people and a web interface for programs (REST API), `tavletta mcp` "
"connects AI assistants such as Claude."
msgstr ""
"Teised programmid, tehisintellekti assistendid ja inimesed brauseris saavad "
"Tavletta kaudu silte printida ilma akent avamata: `tavletta serve` pakub "
"veebilehte inimestele ja veebiliidest programmidele (REST API), `tavletta "
"mcp` ühendab tehisintellekti assistente nagu Claude."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Setting up the server for a company, with Docker or systemd, HTTPS and "
"fonts: [Server installation](server-install.md)."
msgstr ""
"Serveri seadistamine ettevõttele Dockeri või systemd-ga, HTTPS ja fondid: "
"[Serveri paigaldus](server-install.md)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "Every request and error code: [API reference](api.md)."
msgstr "Iga päring ja veakood: [API viide](api.md)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"A walkthrough for programs, with code in Python and C#: [Connecting an "
"inventory tool](api-guide.md)."
msgstr ""
"Ülevaade programmidele koodiga Pythonis ja C#-is: "
"[Inventariseerimistööriista ühendamine](api-guide.md)."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Start { #start }"
msgstr "Käivitamine { #start }"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "tavletta serve --labels-dir ~/Labels\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "The server listens on `http://127.0.0.1:8790`, only on this computer."
msgstr ""
"Server kuulab aadressil `http://127.0.0.1:8790`, ainult sellel arvutil."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Only label files in the labels folder (and its subfolders) can be used, with "
"their data files. Without `--labels-dir`: `~/.local/share/tavletta/labels`."
msgstr ""
"Kasutada saab ainult siltide kausta (ja selle alamkaustade) sildifaile koos "
"nende andmefailidega. Ilma `--labels-dir`: `~/.local/share/tavletta/labels`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Printer address, safety margin and print settings are those set in the app."
msgstr ""
"Printeri aadress, ohutusvaru ja prindiseaded on need, mis on rakenduses "
"seatud."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "Open `http://127.0.0.1:8790/` in a browser: the [web page](#web-page)."
msgstr "Ava `http://127.0.0.1:8790/` brauseris: [veebileht](#web-page)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "`--mcp` adds the connection for AI assistants at `/mcp`."
msgstr "`--mcp` lisab tehisintellekti assistentide ühenduse aadressile `/mcp`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Stop with Ctrl+C: waiting jobs are canceled, a label being printed is "
"finished and the counter saved."
msgstr ""
"Peata klahviga Ctrl+C: ootavad tööd tühistatakse, praegu prinditav silt "
"lõpetatakse ja loendur salvestatakse."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Printers { #printers }"
msgstr "Printerid { #printers }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Name the printers in a file `printers.toml` and start the server with `--"
"printers printers.toml`. Programs then choose a printer by its name; no "
"other printer can be used."
msgstr ""
"Nimeta printerid failis `printers.toml` ja käivita server valikuga `--"
"printers printers.toml`. Programmid valivad siis printeri nime järgi; muid "
"printereid kasutada ei saa."

#. type: Fenced code block (toml)
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  [printers.shipping]\n"
"  backend = \"cab\"\n"
"  host = \"cab-shipping.example.com\"\n"
"  description = \"Shipping labels\"\n"
"  location = \"Warehouse, gate 2\"\n"
"  default = true\n"
"  max_copies = 200\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "`backend` is the printer model, `host` the printer's address."
msgstr "`backend` on printerimudel, `host` printeri aadress."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"The printer's settings, as in the app's printer settings, go into a table of "
"their own; only the ones the model has:"
msgstr ""
"Printeri seaded, nagu rakenduse printeriseadetes, lähevad oma tabelisse; "
"ainult need, mis mudelil on:"

#. type: Fenced code block (toml)
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  [printers.inventory]\n"
"  backend = \"cab\"\n"
"  host = \"cab-it.example.com\"\n"
"\n"
"  [printers.inventory.settings]\n"
"  method = \"transfer\"\n"
"  upside_down = true\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"`method` is the [[ui:Print method]] (`printer`, `transfer`, `direct`), "
"`upside_down` [[ui:Print upside down]], `offset_mm` the [[ui:Print offset]] "
"(−5 to 5), `labels_per_job` [[ui:Labels per job]] (1 to 1000, 250 by "
"default); others are `quality`, `chain`, `high_res`, `feed_mm`, `darkness`, "
"`media` and `outlines`, see [docs/server.md](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/"
"joshii/tavletta/src/branch/main/docs/server.md#printers)."
msgstr ""
"`method` on [[ui:Print method]] (`printer`, `transfer`, `direct`), "
"`upside_down` [[ui:Print upside down]], `offset_mm` [[ui:Print offset]] (−5 "
"kuni 5), `labels_per_job` [[ui:Labels per job]] (1 kuni 1000, vaikimisi "
"250); teised on `quality`, `chain`, `high_res`, `feed_mm`, `darkness`, "
"`media` ja `outlines`, vt [docs/server.md](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/"
"joshii/tavletta/src/branch/main/docs/server.md#printers)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"The printer's state tells the print method set on the printer "
"(`media.print_method`) and the one its jobs print with "
"(`media.job_print_method`): with `method = \"transfer\"` a cab set up for "
"thermal direct prints the server's jobs with a ribbon. The same for how the "
"labels are found: `media.media_type` and `media.job_media_type`."
msgstr ""
"Printeri olek ütleb printerisse seatud printimismeetodi "
"(`media.print_method`) ja selle, millega selle tööd prinditakse "
"(`media.job_print_method`): valikuga `method = \"transfer\"` prindib "
"otsetermoks seatud cab serveri tööd värvilindiga. Sama kehtib siltide "
"leidmise kohta: `media.media_type` ja `media.job_media_type`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "Mistakes in the file are named when the server starts."
msgstr "Faili vead nimetatakse serveri käivitamisel."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "The list of printers shows each printer with its state."
msgstr "Printerite loend näitab iga printerit olekuga."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"The server searches the network for printers only when started with `--"
"discover`."
msgstr ""
"Server otsib võrgust printereid ainult siis, kui see käivitatakse valikuga "
"`--discover`."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Access token { #token }"
msgstr "Pääsutoken { #token }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "Create a token and keep it secret:"
msgstr "Loo token ja hoia seda saladuses:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  mkdir -p ~/.config/tavletta\n"
"  openssl rand -hex 32 > ~/.config/tavletta/token\n"
"  chmod 600 ~/.config/tavletta/token\n"
"  tavletta serve --token-file ~/.config/tavletta/token\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "Every request then needs the header `Authorization: Bearer <token>`."
msgstr "Iga päring vajab siis päist `Authorization: Bearer <token>`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"To listen on another address (`--host 0.0.0.0`), a token is required.  For "
"other computers, put a reverse proxy with HTTPS in front."
msgstr ""
"Teisel aadressil kuulamiseks (`--host 0.0.0.0`) on token nõutav. Teiste "
"arvutite jaoks pane ette HTTPS-iga pöördvaheserver."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"`--allow-printer` limits the printer addresses, for example `--allow-printer "
"'*.local'`."
msgstr ""
"`--allow-printer` piirab printerite aadresse, näiteks `--allow-printer "
"'*.local'`."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Access per device { #tokens }"
msgstr "Juurdepääs seadme kohta { #tokens }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "Several devices or people get a token each, with a role:"
msgstr "Mitu seadet või inimest saavad igaüks oma tokeni koos rolliga:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  tavletta token new shipping-pc --role print --tokens ~/.config/tavletta/tokens.toml\n"
"  tavletta serve --printers printers.toml --tokens ~/.config/tavletta/tokens.toml\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"The token is shown only once; the file keeps only a fingerprint (hash)  of "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Token näidatakse ainult üks kord; fail hoiab ainult selle sõrmejälge (räsi)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"`preview` only lists and shows previews, `print` also prints and follows its "
"own jobs, `admin` sees and cancels all jobs and uploads and deletes "
"templates."
msgstr ""
"`preview` ainult loetleb ja näitab eelvaateid, `print` ka prindib ja jälgib "
"oma töid, `admin` näeb ja tühistab kõiki töid ning laadib üles ja kustutab "
"malle."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"`--printer shipping` limits a token to that printer, `--expires 2027-12-31` "
"to a date."
msgstr ""
"`--printer shipping` piirab tokeni selle printeriga, `--expires 2027-12-31` "
"kuupäevaga."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"To take a token back, delete its entry in `tokens.toml`. The server notices "
"it at once."
msgstr ""
"Tokeni tagasivõtmiseks kustuta selle kirje failist `tokens.toml`. Server "
"märkab seda kohe."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Web page { #web-page }"
msgstr "Veebileht { #web-page }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"The server's own page, at its address (`http://127.0.0.1:8790/`, or the "
"address of the [reverse proxy](server-install.md#proxy)):"
msgstr ""
"Serveri enda leht selle aadressil (`http://127.0.0.1:8790/` või "
"[pöördvaheserveri](server-install.md#proxy) aadress):"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"**Sign in** with an access token (without a token on the server there is "
"nothing to sign in to). The browser keeps it in this tab only; \"Sign out\" "
"forgets it. Where the server is set up for it, \"Sign in with …\" uses your "
"organisation's account instead ([OpenID Connect](server-install.md#oidc))."
msgstr ""
"**Logi sisse** pääsutokeniga (ilma tokenita serveris pole kuhugi sisse "
"logida). Brauser hoiab seda ainult sellel vahekaardil; „Logi välja” unustab "
"selle. Kui server on selleks seadistatud, kasutab „Logi sisse: …” selle "
"asemel sinu organisatsiooni kontot ([OpenID Connect](server-"
"install.md#oidc))."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"**Printers**: their state, the labels or tape loaded and problems, in words."
msgstr ""
"**Printerid**: nende olek, sisestatud sildid või lint ja probleemid sõnadega."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"**Templates**: the label files of the labels folder with a preview.  Data "
"fields show the first row of the template's data file, or sample values if "
"it has none or it is missing. \"Print\" fills in the fields of one label and "
"shows the preview as it is typed; the elements a field fills are outlined in "
"it. With an `admin` token, templates are uploaded (`.tavletta` files) and "
"deleted here."
msgstr ""
"**Mallid**: siltide kausta sildifailid eelvaatega. Andmeväljad näitavad "
"malli andmefaili esimest rida või näidisväärtusi, kui andmefaili pole või "
"see puudub. „Prindi” täidab ühe sildi väljad ja näitab eelvaadet sisestamise "
"ajal; elemendid, mida väli täidab, on selles ääristatud. Admin-tokeniga "
"(`admin`) laaditakse siin malle üles (`.tavletta`-failid) ja kustutatakse."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "**Series**, step by step:"
msgstr "**Seeria**, samm-sammult:"

#. type: Bullet: '  1. '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Data: a CSV, XLSX or ODS file, a list pasted from a spreadsheet, or no data "
"at all. Leading zeros stay (`00300`)."
msgstr ""
"Andmed: CSV-, XLSX- või ODS-fail, tabelarvutusest kleebitud loend või üldse "
"mitte andmeid. Algnullid jäävad (`00300`)."

#. type: Bullet: '  2. '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Assign: which column fills which field of the template (the same names are "
"assigned already, case and spaces aside). The preview of the first label "
"beside it outlines the field in use; each field shows its value, each column "
"its first values."
msgstr ""
"Seo: milline veerg täidab malli millist välja (samad nimed on juba seotud, "
"tähesuuruse ja tühikuteta). Kõrvalolev esimese sildi eelvaade ääristab "
"kasutatavat välja; iga väli näitab oma väärtust, iga veerg oma esimesi "
"väärtusi."

#. type: Bullet: '  3. '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Choose: all rows, some rows (`1-20, 25, 30-`), or by ranges of a field. "
"Without data, ranges make the values: Inventory number from `3000` to `5685` "
"is 2686 labels, `00300` to `00450` keeps the zeros, a step makes every "
"second or tenth number; `3000-5685` can be typed or pasted at once."
msgstr ""
"Vali: kõik read, mõned read (`1-20, 25, 30-`) või välja vahemike järgi. Ilma "
"andmeteta annavad vahemikud väärtused: Inventarinumber `3000` kuni `5685` on "
"2686 silti, `00300` kuni `00450` säilitab nullid, samm annab iga teise või "
"kümnenda numbri; `3000-5685` saab korraga sisestada või kleepida."

#. type: Bullet: '  4. '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Check: the number of labels, the first and the last one, the limits of the "
"server and the printer."
msgstr ""
"Kontrolli: siltide arv, esimene ja viimane, serveri ja printeri piirangud."

#. type: Bullet: '  5. '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Print: from 100 labels on, the page asks first. The progress shows how many "
"are printed; Cancel stops after the current label (a cab printer: after the "
"current job of up to [[ui:Labels per job]] labels). After a cancel or a "
"printer problem, \"Continue from …\" prints the rest."
msgstr ""
"Prindi: alates 100 sildist küsib leht enne. Edenemine näitab, mitu on "
"prinditud; Loobu peatub praeguse sildi järel (cab-printer: praeguse kuni "
"[[ui:Labels per job]] sildiga töö järel). Pärast tühistamist või printeri "
"probleemi prindib „Jätka kohast …” ülejäänu."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"The page speaks the language of the browser, or the one chosen at the top: "
"every language of the app, Arabic right to left. Times are on a 24-hour "
"clock."
msgstr ""
"Leht räägib brauseri keelt või üleval valitut: kõik rakenduse keeled, "
"araabia keel paremalt vasakule. Kellaajad on 24-tunnise kellaga."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "`--no-web-ui` turns the page off, for servers that only programs use."
msgstr ""
"`--no-web-ui` lülitab lehe välja serveritele, mida kasutavad ainult "
"programmid."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Programs (REST API) { #api }"
msgstr "Programmid (REST API) { #api }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"The description of all requests: the [API reference](api.md), and for "
"programs `http://127.0.0.1:8790/api/v1/openapi.json` (OpenAPI 3.1, with any "
"valid token)."
msgstr ""
"Kõigi päringute kirjeldus: [API viide](api.md) ja programmidele `http://"
"127.0.0.1:8790/api/v1/openapi.json` (OpenAPI 3.1, mis tahes kehtiva "
"tokeniga)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"`GET /api/v1/labels` lists the labels, `GET /api/v1/labels/<name>` shows "
"what can be filled in: element names, variables and columns."
msgstr ""
"`GET /api/v1/labels` loetleb sildid, `GET /api/v1/labels/<name>` näitab, "
"mida saab täita: elementide nimed, muutujad ja veerud."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "`POST /api/v1/preview` returns the label as a PNG image."
msgstr "`POST /api/v1/preview` tagastab sildi PNG-pildina."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"`POST /api/v1/print` queues a print job; `GET /api/v1/jobs/<id>` shows its "
"state, `DELETE` cancels it between two labels (a cab printer: between two "
"jobs of a series)."
msgstr ""
"`POST /api/v1/print` paneb prinditöö järjekorda; `GET /api/v1/jobs/<id>` "
"näitab selle olekut, `DELETE` tühistab selle kahe sildi vahel (cab-printer: "
"seeria kahe töö vahel)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "Each printer prints one job after the other."
msgstr "Iga printer prindib ühe töö teise järel."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "Messages come in the language of the `Accept-Language` header."
msgstr "Teated tulevad päise `Accept-Language` keeles."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Without an access token, requests that ask printers need the header `X-"
"Tavletta-Request: 1`, so that no web page can send them."
msgstr ""
"Ilma pääsutokenita vajavad printereid puudutavad päringud päist `X-Tavletta-"
"Request: 1`, et ükski veebileht ei saaks neid saata."

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -H \"Authorization: Bearer $(cat ~/.config/tavletta/token)\" \\\n"
"     -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n"
"     -d '{\"label\": \"serial\", \"data_rows\": [{\"Code\": \"B-07-1\", \"Name\": \"Tea\", \"Shelf\": \"B-07\", \"Box\": \"1\"}], \"copies\": 2}' \\\n"
"     http://127.0.0.1:8790/api/v1/print\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"`set` fills in elements by their name and variables such as `{=lot}`, as on "
"the command line."
msgstr ""
"`set` täidab elemente nende nime järgi ja muutujaid nagu `{=lot}`, nagu "
"käsureal."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Serial labels: `\"data_rows\"`, one object per label with every column the "
"label uses (`[{\"Name\": \"Tea\", …}, {\"Name\": \"Rice\", …}]`), or "
"`\"data_file\"` with a table in the labels folder."
msgstr ""
"Seeriasildid: `\"data_rows\"`, üks objekt sildi kohta koos iga sildi "
"kasutatava veeruga (`[{\"Name\": \"Tea\", …}, {\"Name\": \"Rice\", …}]`), "
"või `\"data_file\"` koos siltide kaustas oleva tabeliga."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"One label from another program, for example an inventory: the fields as one "
"data row, the printer by its name."
msgstr ""
"Üks silt teisest programmist, näiteks inventariseerimissüsteemist: väljad "
"ühe andmereana, printer nime järgi."

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  curl -H \"Authorization: Bearer $(cat ~/.config/tavletta/token)\" \\\n"
"       -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n"
"       -d '{\"label\": \"asset-tag\", \"printer\": \"it-cab\", \"copies\": 1,\n"
"            \"data_rows\": [{\"AssetNumber\": \"100001\"}]}' \\\n"
"       http://127.0.0.1:8790/api/v1/print\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"The whole walkthrough, with series, retries and code in Python and C#: "
"[Connecting an inventory tool](api-guide.md)."
msgstr ""
"Kogu ülevaade seeriate, korduste ja koodiga Pythonis ja C#-is: "
"[Inventariseerimistööriista ühendamine](api-guide.md)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"`{=counter}`: the server saves the next number in the label file. A program "
"that keeps its own numbers sends the number in the data row or as "
"`\"counter_start\"` with `\"no_save_counter\": true`."
msgstr ""
"`{=counter}`: server salvestab järgmise numbri sildifaili. Programm, mis "
"hoiab oma numbreid, saadab numbri andmereas või väärtusena "
"`\"counter_start\"` koos `\"no_save_counter\": true`."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "AI assistants (MCP) { #mcp }"
msgstr "Tehisintellekti assistendid (MCP) { #mcp }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"The assistant can list the labels and printers, show a preview, print and "
"follow or cancel print jobs. It asks before it uses a tool, depending on its "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Assistent saab loetleda sildid ja printerid, näidata eelvaadet, printida "
"ning jälgida või tühistada printimistöid. See küsib enne tööriista "
"kasutamist, olenevalt oma seadetest."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server.md
msgid "Claude Code:"
msgstr "Claude Code:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "claude mcp add tavletta -- tavletta mcp --labels-dir ~/Labels\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server.md
msgid "Claude Desktop, in `claude_desktop_config.json`:"
msgstr "Claude Desktop, failis `claude_desktop_config.json`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (json)
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"mcpServers\": {\n"
"    \"tavletta\": {\n"
"      \"command\": \"tavletta\",\n"
"      \"args\": [\"mcp\", \"--labels-dir\", \"/home/me/Labels\"]\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Over the network: `tavletta serve --mcp` and the address `http://"
"127.0.0.1:8790/mcp` with the access token as `Authorization: Bearer` header."
msgstr ""
"Võrgu kaudu: `tavletta serve --mcp` ja aadress `http://127.0.0.1:8790/mcp` "
"pääsutokeniga päisena `Authorization: Bearer`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid "Printing uses real labels: ask for a preview first."
msgstr "Printimine kasutab päris silte: küsi esmalt eelvaadet."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server and container { #service }"
msgstr "Server ja konteiner { #service }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"On a server for a company: [Server installation](server-install.md), with "
"Docker Compose (`packaging/docker/compose.yaml`) or as a system service "
"(`packaging/systemd/tavletta-server.service`)."
msgstr ""
"Ettevõtte serveris: [Serveri paigaldus](server-install.md), Docker "
"Compose'iga (`packaging/docker/compose.yaml`) või süsteemiteenusena "
"(`packaging/systemd/tavletta-server.service`)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"As a service of your user on a desktop: `packaging/systemd/tavletta.service` "
"(instructions in the file)."
msgstr ""
"Sinu kasutaja teenusena töölaual: `packaging/systemd/tavletta.service` "
"(juhised failis)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Technical details and security: [docs/server.md](https://"
"git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/branch/main/docs/server.md)."
msgstr ""
"Tehnilised üksikasjad ja turvalisus: [docs/server.md](https://"
"git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/branch/main/docs/server.md)."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Container image { #container }"
msgstr "Konteineripilt { #container }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"The print server is published as a container image for amd64 and arm64 (also "
"a Raspberry Pi with a 64-bit system):"
msgstr ""
"Prindiserver avaldatakse konteineripildina arhitektuuridele amd64 ja arm64 "
"(ka Raspberry Pi 64-bitise süsteemiga):"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "docker pull ghcr.io/joshii-h/tavletta:1.2.2\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"`1.2.2` is a release, `1.2` the latest bug fix release of 1.2, `latest` the "
"latest release. `edge` is the state of development, not a release."
msgstr ""
"`1.2.2` on väljalase, `1.2` versiooni 1.2 viimane veaparandusväljalase, "
"`latest` viimane väljalase. `edge` on arenduse seis, mitte väljalase."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"`packaging/docker/compose.yaml` uses the published image: `docker compose "
"pull`, then `docker compose up -d`."
msgstr ""
"`packaging/docker/compose.yaml` kasutab avaldatud pilti: `docker compose "
"pull`, seejärel `docker compose up -d`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"To build the image yourself instead, add `compose.build.yaml`: `docker "
"compose -f compose.yaml -f compose.build.yaml up -d --build`."
msgstr ""
"Pildi ise ehitamiseks lisa selle asemel `compose.build.yaml`: `docker "
"compose -f compose.yaml -f compose.build.yaml up -d --build`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"The image runs without root rights and reports its state to Docker "
"(`HEALTHCHECK`)."
msgstr ""
"Pilt töötab ilma root-õigusteta ja teatab oma olekust Dockerile "
"(`HEALTHCHECK`)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
msgid ""
"Check that an image was built from Tavletta's repository, with the [GitHub "
"CLI](https://cli.github.com) or [cosign](https://docs.sigstore.dev):"
msgstr ""
"Kontrolli, et pilt on ehitatud Tavletta repositooriumist, [GitHub CLI-ga]"
"(https://cli.github.com) või [cosigniga](https://docs.sigstore.dev):"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"gh attestation verify oci://ghcr.io/joshii-h/tavletta:1.2.2 --repo joshii-h/tavletta\n"
"cosign verify ghcr.io/joshii-h/tavletta:1.2.2 \\\n"
"    --certificate-oidc-issuer https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com \\\n"
"    --certificate-identity-regexp '^https://github\\.com/joshii-h/tavletta/\\.github/workflows/docker\\.yml@refs/tags/v'\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
#: docs/sheets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Label sheets { #sheets }"
msgstr "Sildilehed { #sheets }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid ""
"With the [[ui:System printer (CUPS, IPP)]], an office printer prints on "
"sheets of self-adhesive labels: A4 or US Letter pages with a grid of labels, "
"as Avery, Zweckform, Herma and many others sell them. Tavletta knows more "
"than 1700 of these sheets, from the template collection of gLabels."
msgstr ""
"Valikuga [[ui:System printer (CUPS, IPP)]] prindib kontoriprinter "
"isekleepuvate siltide lehtedele: A4 või US Letter lehed siltide "
"ruudustikuga, nagu Avery, Zweckform, Herma ja paljud teised neid müüvad. "
"Tavletta tunneb üle 1700 sellise lehe gLabelsi mallikogust."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sheets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose the sheet { #choose }"
msgstr "Lehe valik { #choose }"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid "[[ui:Printer model]]: [[ui:System printer (CUPS, IPP)]]."
msgstr "[[ui:Printer model]]: [[ui:System printer (CUPS, IPP)]]."

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid "[[ui:Print on]]: [[ui:Label sheet]]. The list of sheets opens."
msgstr "[[ui:Print on]]: [[ui:Label sheet]]. Lehtede loend avaneb."

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid ""
"Search by brand and part number as printed on the package (\"Avery L7160\", "
"\"Zweckform 3475\"), or by the size of one label in millimetres (\"70x37\", "
"either way round). The paper size narrows the list down."
msgstr ""
"Otsi margi ja osanumbri järgi, nagu pakendile prinditud (\"Avery L7160\", "
"\"Zweckform 3475\"), või ühe sildi suuruse järgi millimeetrites (\"70x37\", "
"kummagi järjekorraga). Paberi suurus kitsendab loendit."

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid "The picture shows the sheet; [[ui:Use sheet]] takes it."
msgstr "Pilt näitab lehte; [[ui:Use sheet]] võtab selle kasutusele."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid ""
"The label now has the size of the sheet's labels. Round labels and CDs are "
"designed as a rectangle, and printed only inside their shape; the preview "
"shows them that way."
msgstr ""
"Sildil on nüüd lehe siltide suurus. Ümmargused sildid ja CD-d kujundatakse "
"ristkülikuna ja prinditakse ainult oma kujundi sisse; eelvaade näitab neid "
"nii."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Turn the content]]: for labels read from the side, such as folder "
"spines: the label is designed lying on its side and turned onto the sheet."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Turn the content]]: küljelt loetavate siltide jaoks, nagu kaustaseljad: "
"silt kujundatakse külili ja pööratakse lehele."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Print on]]: [[ui:Single label]] prints the label as a page of its own "
"again; choosing [[ui:Label sheet]] again brings back the last sheet."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Print on]]: [[ui:Single label]] prindib sildi jälle eraldi lehena; "
"valides [[ui:Label sheet]] uuesti, tuleb viimane leht tagasi."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sheets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Partly used sheets { #positions }"
msgstr "Osaliselt kasutatud lehed { #positions }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Positions]] shows the sheet. Click a label to leave it out (it is "
"already used) or to print on it again, or set [[ui:Start at position]]: the "
"labels are counted row by row from the top left. This only applies to the "
"first sheet; further sheets are filled completely. The sheet and the "
"positions are saved with the label."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Positions]] näitab lehte. Klõpsa sildil, et see välja jätta (see on "
"juba kasutatud) või sellele uuesti printida, või sea [[ui:Start at "
"position]]: sildid loetakse rida-realt vasakust ülanurgast. See kehtib "
"ainult esimesele lehele; järgmised lehed täidetakse täielikult. Leht ja "
"positsioonid salvestatakse sildiga kaasa."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sheets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Print { #print }"
msgstr "Printimine { #print }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Labels]]: how many labels to print. At first as many as positions are "
"chosen; more fill further sheets. The dialog shows how many sheets that "
"takes. One print job takes at most 999 labels; with serial labels that is "
"the rows times the copies of each."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Labels]]: mitu silti printida. Alguses nii palju, kui positsioone on "
"valitud; rohkem täidab järgmisi lehti. Dialoog näitab, mitu lehte see võtab. "
"Üks printimistöö võtab kuni 999 silti; seeriasiltidega on see read korda iga "
"rea koopiad."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Print outlines]]: prints the outline of every label. Print a test page "
"on plain paper first and hold it against a label sheet in front of a light: "
"if the content sits inside the outlines, the sheet fits."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Print outlines]]: prindib iga sildi kontuuri. Prindi esmalt katseleht "
"lihtsale paberile ja hoia see sildilehe vastu valguse käes: kui sisu asub "
"kontuuride sees, sobib leht."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid ""
"Office printers cannot print near the paper's edges. Tavletta asks the "
"printer for that margin and warns if the content of a label (inside the "
"[[ui:Safety margin]]) reaches into it. Leave those positions out, or "
"increase the [[ui:Safety margin]]."
msgstr ""
"Kontoriprinterid ei saa printida paberi servade lähedale. Tavletta küsib "
"printerilt seda varu ja hoiatab, kui sildi sisu ([[ui:Safety margin]] sees) "
"ulatub sellesse. Jäta need positsioonid välja või suurenda [[ui:Safety "
"margin]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid ""
"The paper size comes from the sheet; turn off \"fit to page\" in the "
"printer's setup, otherwise the printer may scale the sheet."
msgstr ""
"Paberi suurus tuleb lehest; lülita printeri seadetes \"fit to page\" välja, "
"muidu võib printer lehte skaleerida."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid ""
"Older versions of Tavletta refuse to open labels for a label sheet and say "
"that the label needs a newer version, instead of printing them as a single "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Tavletta vanemad versioonid keelduvad sildilehe siltide avamisest ja "
"ütlevad, et silt vajab uuemat versiooni, selle asemel et neid ühe lehena "
"printida."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sheets.md
msgid "The sheet templates come from gLabels (© Jaye Evins, MIT license)."
msgstr "Lehemallid pärinevad gLabelsist (© Jaye Evins, MIT-litsents)."

#. type: Title #
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Design and print"
msgstr "Kujunda ja prindi"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Content"
msgstr "Sisu"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Elements are placed one after another along the label. Order them with "
"[[ui:Move up]] and [[ui:Move down]]."
msgstr ""
"Elemendid paigutatakse üksteise järel piki silti. Järjesta need toimingutega "
"[[ui:Move up]] ja [[ui:Move down]]."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"![Editing a text element](media/expand.png#only-light)  ![Editing a text "
"element](media/expand-dark.png#only-dark)"
msgstr ""
"![Tekstielemendi redigeerimine](media/expand.png#only-light)  !"
"[Tekstielemendi redigeerimine](media/expand-dark.png#only-dark)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"**Text**: any installed font, colour, several lines. [[ui:Size]] 0 fills the "
"label height, otherwise fixed in pt."
msgstr ""
"**Tekst**: mis tahes paigaldatud font, värv, mitu rida. [[ui:Size]] 0 täidab "
"sildi kõrguse, muidu kindel pt-des."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid "**Image**: photos and graphics; drag and drop works too."
msgstr "**Pilt**: fotod ja graafika; lohistamine töötab samuti."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid "**Symbol**: a pictogram from the symbol library, see below."
msgstr "**Sümbol**: piktogramm sümbolikogust, vaata allpool."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"**Code**: [[ui:Type]] offers 2D codes (QR code, Data Matrix, PDF417, Aztec), "
"linear barcodes (Code 128, Code 39, Code 93, EAN-13, EAN-8, UPC-A, UPC-E, "
"ITF-14) and GS1 codes (GS1-128, GS1 DataMatrix). Below the type it says what "
"the type is for and what it accepts."
msgstr ""
"**Kood**: [[ui:Type]] pakub 2D-koode (QR-kood, Data Matrix, PDF417, Aztec), "
"lineaarseid vöötkoode (Code 128, Code 39, Code 93, EAN-13, EAN-8, UPC-A, UPC-"
"E, ITF-14) ja GS1-koode (GS1-128, GS1 DataMatrix). Tüübi all on öeldud, "
"milleks tüüp on ja mida see aktsepteerib."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"EAN, UPC and ITF-14: enter the digits without the check digit, it is added; "
"with it, it is checked."
msgstr ""
"EAN, UPC ja ITF-14: sisesta numbrid ilma kontrollnumbrita, see lisatakse; "
"sellega kontrollitakse seda."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"GS1-128 and GS1 DataMatrix: application identifiers in brackets, each "
"followed by its value, e.g. `(01)09501101530003(17)261231(10)AB12`.  "
"Tavletta checks identifiers, lengths, dates and check digits and says which "
"identifier is wrong. GS1-128 shows the identifiers in brackets below the "
"bars."
msgstr ""
"GS1-128 ja GS1 DataMatrix: rakendustunnused sulgudes, igaühe järel selle "
"väärtus, nt `(01)09501101530003(17)261231(10)AB12`. Tavletta kontrollib "
"tunnuseid, pikkusi, kuupäevi ja kontrollnumbreid ning ütleb, milline tunnus "
"on vale. GS1-128 näitab tunnuseid sulgudes triipude all."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"A GS1 value with round brackets in it: write the identifiers in square "
"brackets, e.g. `[01]09501101530003[21]A(B)C`."
msgstr ""
"GS1-väärtus ümarsulgudega: kirjuta tunnused nurksulgudesse, nt "
"`[01]09501101530003[21]A(B)C`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"ITF-14 and GS1-128 on shipping cartons: GS1 asks for modules of at least "
"0.495 mm. On narrow labels they come out narrower: fine for your own "
"scanners, too small for carton labels read in logistics."
msgstr ""
"ITF-14 ja GS1-128 saatekarpidel: GS1 nõuab vähemalt 0,495 mm mooduleid. "
"Kitsastel siltidel tulevad need kitsamad: sobib omade skannerite jaoks, kuid "
"liiga väike logistikas loetavatele karbisiltidele."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Code 39: a `$`, `/`, `+` or `%` before a capital letter is read as another "
"character by scanners set to Full ASCII; Tavletta warns."
msgstr ""
"Code 39: `$`, `/`, `+` või `%` enne suurtähte loetakse Full ASCII-sse seatud "
"skannerites teiseks märgiks; Tavletta hoiatab."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Content a code type cannot take is not changed silently: the element is "
"crossed out and a warning says why."
msgstr ""
"Sisu, mida koodi tüüp vastu võtta ei saa, ei muudeta vaikselt: element "
"kriipsutatakse läbi ja hoiatus ütleb põhjuse."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Labels with a code type other than QR code, Code 128 and EAN-13 do not open "
"in earlier versions of Tavletta: they say the label needs a newer version."
msgstr ""
"Sildid koodi tüübiga, mis pole QR-kood, Code 128 ega EAN-13, ei avane "
"Tavletta varasemates versioonides: need ütlevad, et silt vajab uuemat "
"versiooni."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Codes print sharp on every printer: each bar and square is a whole number of "
"printer dots, as close to the designed width as the element's space allows, "
"with the blank margin a scanner needs. The code may come out slightly "
"smaller than designed, centred in its space."
msgstr ""
"Koodid prinditakse teravalt igal printeril: iga triip ja ruut on täisarv "
"printeri punkte, nii lähedal kavandatud laiusele, kui elemendi ruum lubab, "
"koos skanneri vajaliku tühja äärega. Kood võib tulla veidi kavandatust "
"väiksem, oma ruumis keskele paigutatud."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"A code whose bars are only one printer dot wide, or without room for its "
"blank margin, may not scan: Tavletta warns before printing, make the code "
"larger. A code that does not fit at all is not printed."
msgstr ""
"Kood, mille triibud on ainult ühe printeripunkti laiused või millel pole "
"ruumi oma tühja ääre jaoks, ei pruugi skaneeruda: Tavletta hoiatab enne "
"printimist, tee kood suuremaks. Koodi, mis üldse ei mahu, ei prindita."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"QR codes with characters beyond plain ASCII (umlauts, °, £ …) are now marked "
"as UTF-8, so scanners read them correctly. Labels made with earlier versions "
"print such a QR code with a different pattern, some with more and smaller "
"modules."
msgstr ""
"QR-koodid tavalisest ASCII-st väljaspool olevate märkidega (täpitähed, °, £ "
"…) märgitakse nüüd UTF-8-ks, et skannerid loeksid need õigesti. Varasemate "
"versioonidega tehtud sildid prindivad sellise QR-koodi teise mustriga, mõned "
"rohkemate ja väiksemate moodulitega."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Labels made with earlier versions: QR codes come out a quarter to a third "
"narrower, about half the area (44 to 56 % less), as their blank margin is "
"now inside the element. On narrow tape, where each module is a whole number "
"of printer dots, up to 60 % narrower. Barcodes come out slightly wider."
msgstr ""
"Varasemate versioonidega tehtud sildid: QR-koodid tulevad veerandi kuni "
"kolmandiku võrra kitsamad, umbes poole väiksema pindalaga (44 kuni 56 % "
"vähem), sest nende tühi äär on nüüd elemendi sees. Kitsal lindil, kus iga "
"moodul on täisarv printeri punkte, kuni 60 % kitsamad. Vöötkoodid tulevad "
"veidi laiemad."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Text style { #text-style }"
msgstr "Tekstistiil { #text-style }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"![Text in a box and a frame, lines and a rounded border](media/"
"design.png#only-light)  ![Text in a box and a frame, lines and a rounded "
"border](media/design-dark.png#only-dark)"
msgstr ""
"![Tekst kastis ja raamis, jooned ja ümardatud ääris](media/design.png#only-"
"light)  ![Tekst kastis ja raamis, jooned ja ümardatud ääris](media/design-"
"dark.png#only-dark)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"The rows of a text element; [[ui:Spacing and fitting]], [[ui:Box and frame]] "
"and [[ui:Outline and shadow]] open a page of their own in the sidebar, its "
"header names the element:"
msgstr ""
"Tekstielemendi read; [[ui:Spacing and fitting]], [[ui:Box and frame]] ja "
"[[ui:Outline and shadow]] avavad külgribal oma lehe, mille päis nimetab "
"elemendi:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Font]]: family, [[ui:Bold]], [[ui:Italic]], [[ui:Underline]], "
"[[ui:Strikethrough]]."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Font]]: perekond, [[ui:Bold]], [[ui:Italic]], [[ui:Underline]], "
"[[ui:Strikethrough]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Spacing and fitting]]: [[ui:Letter spacing]] and [[ui:Line spacing]]; "
"[[ui:Shrink to fit]] makes the text smaller until it fits the label height "
"and, with a fixed length, the length, never below [[ui:Smallest size]]; "
"[[ui:Wrap width]] breaks long lines into several; [[ui:Rotation]] 90° or "
"270° turns the whole text, the letters lie on their side (not upright "
"columns of Chinese or Japanese)."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Spacing and fitting]]: [[ui:Letter spacing]] ja [[ui:Line spacing]]; "
"[[ui:Shrink to fit]] teeb teksti väiksemaks, kuni see mahub sildi kõrgusele "
"ja kindla pikkuse korral pikkusele, mitte kunagi alla [[ui:Smallest size]]; "
"[[ui:Wrap width]] murrab pikad read mitmeks; [[ui:Rotation]] 90° või 270° "
"pöörab kogu teksti, tähed on külili (mitte püstised hiina või jaapani "
"veerud)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Letter spacing leaves out scripts whose letters join, such as Arabic or "
"Devanagari."
msgstr ""
"Tähevahe jätab välja kirjasüsteemid, mille tähed ühenduvad, näiteks araabia "
"või devanagari."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Box and frame]]: [[ui:White on black]] cuts the text out of a box in "
"the text colour; [[ui:Background box]] puts a box of another colour behind "
"it; [[ui:Padding]], [[ui:Corner radius]] and [[ui:Frame]] shape the box."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Box and frame]]: [[ui:White on black]] lõikab teksti välja teksti värvi "
"kastist; [[ui:Background box]] paneb selle taha teise värvi kasti; "
"[[ui:Padding]], [[ui:Corner radius]] ja [[ui:Frame]] kujundavad kasti."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Outline and shadow]]: a line around each letter, a shadow down and to "
"the right."
msgstr "[[ui:Outline and shadow]]: joon iga tähe ümber, vari alla ja paremale."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Images { #images }"
msgstr "Pildid { #images }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid "[[ui:Crop…]]: drag on the image or type the area in percent."
msgstr "[[ui:Crop…]]: lohista pildil või sisesta ala protsentides."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Adjust]]: [[ui:Brightness]], [[ui:Contrast]], [[ui:Gamma]], "
"[[ui:Invert]], [[ui:Rotation]], [[ui:Mirror]], [[ui:Flip]]."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Adjust]]: [[ui:Brightness]], [[ui:Contrast]], [[ui:Gamma]], "
"[[ui:Invert]], [[ui:Rotation]], [[ui:Mirror]], [[ui:Flip]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Corners and border]]: rounded corners and a border around the image."
msgstr "[[ui:Corners and border]]: ümardatud nurgad ja ääris pildi ümber."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Black and white]]: how black-and-white printers print the image, see "
"below."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Black and white]]: kuidas mustvalged printerid pilti prindivad, vaata "
"allpool."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Lines and shapes { #shapes }"
msgstr "Jooned ja kujundid { #shapes }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid "[[ui:Line or shape]] in the add menu:"
msgstr "[[ui:Line or shape]] lisamismenüüs:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid "[[ui:Line]]: horizontal, vertical or diagonal, with [[ui:Arrows]]."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Line]]: horisontaalne, vertikaalne või diagonaalne, koos [[ui:Arrows]]-"
"nooltega."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Rectangle]] (rounded with [[ui:Corner radius]]) and [[ui:Ellipse]], "
"with a [[ui:Fill]]: solid, hatched, dotted or a grid."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Rectangle]] (ümardatud valikuga [[ui:Corner radius]]) ja "
"[[ui:Ellipse]], koos [[ui:Fill]]-täitega: pidev, viirutatud, punktiline või "
"ruudustik."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Separator]]: a line across the whole label height between two elements."
msgstr "[[ui:Separator]]: joon kogu sildi kõrguselt kahe elemendi vahel."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Line width]] and [[ui:Line style]] (solid, dashed, dotted). Every line "
"is at least one printer dot wide."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Line width]] ja [[ui:Line style]] (pidev, katkendlik, punktiline). Iga "
"joon on vähemalt ühe printeripunkti laiune."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Labels with lines or shapes, or with the options on this page, do not open "
"in earlier versions of Tavletta: they say the label needs a newer version. "
"Labels without them open as before."
msgstr ""
"Sildid joonte või kujunditega või selle lehe valikutega ei avane Tavletta "
"varasemates versioonides: need ütlevad, et silt vajab uuemat versiooni. Ilma "
"nendeta sildid avanevad nagu varem."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Position { #position }"
msgstr "Asukoht { #position }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid "Each element has [[ui:Position]]:"
msgstr "Igal elemendil on [[ui:Position]]:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Vertical alignment]]: at the top, in the middle or at the bottom of the "
"label height."
msgstr "[[ui:Vertical alignment]]: sildi kõrguse ülaosas, keskel või allosas."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Own spacing]]: [[ui:Space after it]] instead of the label's "
"[[ui:Spacing]]."
msgstr "[[ui:Own spacing]]: [[ui:Space after it]] sildi [[ui:Spacing]] asemel."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Free layout { #free-layout }"
msgstr "Vaba paigutus { #free-layout }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Layout]] at the top of [[ui:Content]] places the elements [[ui:One "
"after another]] along the tape, or [[ui:Free]]: each one where you put it."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Layout]] jaotise [[ui:Content]] ülaosas paigutab elemendid [[ui:One "
"after another]] piki linti või [[ui:Free]]: igaüks sinna, kuhu selle paned."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"In the free layout every element has [[ui:Position and size]]: X and Y from "
"the label's top left corner, to a hundredth of a millimetre."
msgstr ""
"Vabas paigutuses on igal elemendil [[ui:Position and size]]: X ja Y sildi "
"vasakust ülanurgast, sajandik millimeetri täpsusega."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"A text is placed by the top left corner of its letters' ink, a code by its "
"first module. The numbers of other label designers can be taken over as they "
"are."
msgstr ""
"Tekst paigutatakse tema tähtede tindi vasaku ülanurga järgi, kood tema "
"esimese mooduli järgi. Teiste sildikujundajate numbreid saab üle võtta "
"sellisena, nagu need on."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"A text's [[ui:Size]] is the height of its font (the em) in mm, as label "
"designers give it."
msgstr ""
"Teksti [[ui:Size]] on tema fondi kõrgus (em) millimeetrites, nagu "
"sildikujundajad seda annavad."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"A code's [[ui:Module size]] is rounded to whole printer dots: 0.67 mm at 12 "
"dots per mm prints as 8 dots. Leave room for the quiet zone around the code. "
"Codes can be turned ([[ui:Rotation]]), a barcode has its [[ui:Bar height]]."
msgstr ""
"Koodi [[ui:Module size]] ümardatakse täisarvu printeripunktideni: 0,67 mm 12 "
"punktiga millimeetri kohta prindib 8 punktina. Jäta koodi ümber ruumi vaikse "
"tsooni jaoks. Koode saab pöörata ([[ui:Rotation]]), vöötkoodil on [[ui:Bar "
"height]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"An image has its [[ui:Height]], a symbol its [[ui:Size]], a line or shape "
"its width and height. A shipping label fills the label from its position to "
"the right and bottom edge."
msgstr ""
"Pildil on [[ui:Height]], sümbolil [[ui:Size]], joonel või kujundil laius ja "
"kõrgus. Saatesilt täidab sildi oma asukohast parema ja alumise servani."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Switching to the free layout for the first time keeps every element where it "
"was."
msgstr "Esmakordsel üleminekul vabale paigutusele jääb iga element oma kohale."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"An element that reaches beyond the label is cut off there; the preview warns "
"about it."
msgstr ""
"Sildist kaugemale ulatuv element lõigatakse seal ära; eelvaade hoiatab selle "
"eest."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid "Labels in the free layout do not open in earlier versions of Tavletta."
msgstr "Vabas paigutuses sildid ei avane Tavletta varasemates versioonides."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Arranging in the preview { #arrange }"
msgstr "Paigutamine eelvaates { #arrange }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"In the free layout the elements can be arranged in the preview with the "
"mouse, a finger or a pen:"
msgstr ""
"Vabas paigutuses saab elemente eelvaates paigutada hiire, sõrme või "
"pliiatsiga:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Click an element to select it; its row in [[ui:Content]] opens. Click with "
"Shift or Ctrl to add an element to the selection or take it out.  Drag "
"across an empty part to select every element the rubber band touches (with "
"Alt held: only those inside it). A click on an empty part selects nothing. "
"Opening an element's row selects it too."
msgstr ""
"Klõpsa elemendil, et see valida; selle rida jaotises [[ui:Content]] avaneb. "
"Klõpsa Shiftiga või Ctrliga, et element valikusse lisada või sealt "
"eemaldada. Lohista üle tühja koha, et valida iga element, mida valikuraam "
"puudutab (Alt all hoides: ainult need, mis on selle sees). Klõps tühjal "
"kohal ei vali midagi. Elemendi rea avamine valib selle samuti."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Drag the selection to move it. It snaps to the label's edges and middle and "
"to the edges and middles of the other elements; a red line shows where. Hold "
"Alt, or Ctrl, to place it freely (some desktops move the window when Alt is "
"held while dragging: then use Ctrl). Hold Shift to move it along one axis "
"only. Escape while dragging puts it back."
msgstr ""
"Lohista valikut, et seda liigutada. See kinnitub sildi servadele ja keskele "
"ning teiste elementide servadele ja keskpunktidele; punane joon näitab kuhu. "
"Hoia Alti või Ctrli, et paigutada see vabalt (mõned töölauad liigutavad "
"akent, kui lohistamisel hoitakse Alti: siis kasuta Ctrli). Hoia Shifti, et "
"liigutada ainult ühe telje sihis. Escape lohistamise ajal viib selle tagasi."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"One selected element has handles at its corners and edges: drag one to "
"resize it. A line or shape changes its width and height on their own (Shift "
"keeps its proportions); a text, an image, a symbol and a QR code keep their "
"proportions; a barcode gets longer bars or wider modules. A shipping label "
"is only moved."
msgstr ""
"Ühel valitud elemendil on käepidemed nurkades ja servadel: lohista üht, et "
"muuta suurust. Joon või kujund muudab laiust ja kõrgust eraldi (Shift "
"säilitab proportsioonid); tekst, pilt, sümbol ja QR-kood säilitavad "
"proportsioonid; vöötkood saab pikemad ribad või laiemad moodulid. Saatesilti "
"ainult liigutatakse."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Arrange]] in the header bar aligns the selected elements: one element "
"at the label's edge or middle, several at one another's. It spaces three or "
"more evenly ([[ui:Distribute]]), turns snapping on and off ([[ui:Snap to "
"guides]]) and adds a grid to snap to."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Arrange]] päiseribas joondab valitud elemente: üks element sildi serva "
"või keskpunkti suhtes, mitu üksteise suhtes. See jaotab kolm või enam "
"ühtlaselt ([[ui:Distribute]]), lülitab kinnitumise sisse ja välja ([[ui:Snap "
"to guides]]) ning lisab ruudustiku, millele kinnituda."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"With the preview focused (click it, or Tab to it), the arrow keys move the "
"selection by 0.1 mm, with Shift by 1 mm; Delete removes it; Ctrl+A selects "
"all elements, Shift+Ctrl+A and Escape none. Sizes are set in the element's "
"row and on its [[ui:Position and size]] page."
msgstr ""
"Kui eelvaade on fookuses (klõpsa sellel või mine Tabiga), liigutavad "
"nooleklahvid valikut 0,1 mm, Shiftiga 1 mm; Delete eemaldab selle; Ctrl+A "
"valib kõik elemendid, Shift+Ctrl+A ja Escape mitte ühtegi. Mõõtmed seatakse "
"elemendi real ja selle leheküljel [[ui:Position and size]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Every drag, every resize and a run of arrow keys is one step of [[ui:Undo]], "
"in turn with the changes made in the sidebar."
msgstr ""
"Iga lohistamine, iga suuruse muutmine ja nooleklahvide vajutuste jada on üks "
"[[ui:Undo]] samm, vaheldumisi külgribal tehtud muudatustega."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"In the layout [[ui:One after another]] elements can be selected, but not "
"moved: dragging one offers [[ui:Use free layout]]."
msgstr ""
"Paigutuses [[ui:One after another]] saab elemente valida, kuid mitte "
"liigutada: ühe lohistamine pakub [[ui:Use free layout]]."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Weight and error correction { #weight }"
msgstr "Kaal ja veaparandus { #weight }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Weight]] chooses one of the font's own weights, such as Light or "
"Semibold, instead of regular or bold. The bold button sets it back."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Weight]] valib ühe fondi enda kaalu, näiteks Light või Semibold, "
"tavalise või rasvase asemel. Rasvase nupp seab selle tagasi."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"QR codes have [[ui:Error correction]]: how much of the code may be damaged "
"and still be read. [[ui:Standard (medium)]] keeps the code of earlier "
"versions; the other levels choose the code's pattern as label printers do."
msgstr ""
"QR-koodidel on [[ui:Error correction]]: kui suur osa koodist võib olla "
"kahjustatud ja ikka loetav. [[ui:Standard (medium)]] säilitab varasemate "
"versioonide koodi; teised tasemed valivad koodi mustri nagu sildiprinterid."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Labels with a weight or an error correction do not open in earlier versions "
"of Tavletta."
msgstr ""
"Sildid kaalu või veaparandusega ei avane Tavletta varasemates versioonides."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Black-and-white printers { #black-and-white }"
msgstr "Mustvalged printerid { #black-and-white }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Text, codes, symbols, lines and borders print with sharp edges: text is "
"drawn without smoothed edges, every part is converted on its own."
msgstr ""
"Tekst, koodid, sümbolid, jooned ja ääristused prinditakse teravate "
"servadega: tekst joonistatakse ilma silutud servadeta, iga osa teisendatakse "
"eraldi."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Images: [[ui:Method]] under [[ui:Black and white]]. [[ui:Automatic]] keeps "
"drawings and logos in one or two tones sharp, prints drawings in several "
"flat tones as even patterns and dithers photos; [[ui:Threshold]] sets which "
"grey still prints black."
msgstr ""
"Pildid: [[ui:Method]] jaotises [[ui:Black and white]]. [[ui:Automatic]] "
"hoiab ühe- või kahetooniliste joonistuste ja logode servad teravad, prindib "
"mitme ühtlase tooniga joonistused ühtlaste mustritena ja rasterdab fotod; "
"[[ui:Threshold]] määrab, milline hall prinditakse veel mustana."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Colour emoji in a text get a line around their shapes, so light parts stay "
"visible."
msgstr ""
"Värvilised emojid tekstis saavad oma kujundite ümber joone, et heledad osad "
"jääksid nähtavaks."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Colours print black, or white if they are lighter than what lies behind them "
"(the background colour or image, or a text's box); an element over a light "
"and a dark part takes the colour that shows on most of it."
msgstr ""
"Värvid prinditakse mustana või valgena, kui need on heledamad kui nende taga "
"olev (taustavärv või -pilt või teksti kast); element heleda ja tumeda osa "
"kohal saab värvi, mis paistab enamikul sellest."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"A warning says when an element would hardly stand out from what lies behind "
"it; codes need more contrast than text, so that they scan."
msgstr ""
"Hoiatus ütleb, kui element vaevu eristub sellest, mis selle taga on; koodid "
"vajavad rohkem kontrasti kui tekst, et need skaneeruksid."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid "The background colour or image is dithered on its own."
msgstr "Taustavärv või -pilt rasterdatakse eraldi."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"A shadow prints solid in the other colour, one dot apart from the letters. "
"Outlines and shadows are at least one printer dot."
msgstr ""
"Vari prinditakse pideva teise värviga, ühe punkti kaugusel tähtedest. "
"Kontuurid ja varjud on vähemalt ühe printeripunkti suurused."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Earlier versions dithered every image; now [[ui:Automatic]] keeps drawings "
"and logos sharp."
msgstr ""
"Varasemad versioonid rasterdasid iga pildi; nüüd hoiab [[ui:Automatic]] "
"joonistused ja logod teravad."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Undo and keyboard shortcuts { #shortcuts }"
msgstr "Tagasivõtmine ja kiirklahvid { #shortcuts }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Undo]] (Ctrl+Z) and [[ui:Redo]] (Ctrl+Shift+Z); typing into a field "
"counts as one step, also when the field has the focus. Undoing back to the "
"saved label makes it unchanged again."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Undo]] (Ctrl+Z) ja [[ui:Redo]] (Ctrl+Shift+Z); välja tippimine loetakse "
"üheks sammuks, ka siis, kui väljal on fookus. Salvestatud sildini "
"tagasivõtmine teeb selle jälle muutmata."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"The open element (its row expanded): Ctrl+D duplicates it, Delete removes "
"it, Alt+Up and Alt+Down move it."
msgstr ""
"Avatud element (selle rida laiendatud): Ctrl+D dubleerib selle, Delete "
"eemaldab selle, Alt+Üles ja Alt+Alla liigutavad seda."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Ctrl+Shift+T, G, Y, B and L add text, an image, a symbol, a code or a line."
msgstr ""
"Ctrl+Shift+T, G, Y, B ja L lisavad teksti, pildi, sümboli, koodi või joone."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"With the preview focused: the arrow keys move the selected elements (Shift: "
"by 1 mm), Delete removes them, Ctrl+A and Shift+Ctrl+A select all or none "
"([see above](#arrange))."
msgstr ""
"Kui eelvaade on fookuses: nooleklahvid liigutavad valitud elemente (Shift: 1 "
"mm), Delete eemaldab need, Ctrl+A ja Shift+Ctrl+A valivad kõik või mitte "
"ühtegi ([vt eespool](#arrange))."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid "[[ui:Keyboard shortcuts]] (Ctrl+?) in the main menu lists them all."
msgstr "[[ui:Keyboard shortcuts]] (Ctrl+?) peamenüüs loetleb need kõik."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Symbols"
msgstr "Sümbolid"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Symbol…]] opens the symbol library: over 7000 pictograms such as "
"arrows, warnings, recycling, tools, food or weather, from Material Design "
"Icons. Search by name, for example \"arrow\" or \"recycle\". The names and "
"categories come from the icon set and are English, so the search is in "
"English too. The list next to the search shows one category; [[ui:Recently "
"used]] shows the symbols chosen last. The \"Brand / Logo\" category and "
"further icons showing brands or trademarks are left out."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Symbol…]] avab sümbolikogu: üle 7000 piktogrammi, nagu nooled, "
"hoiatused, ringlussevõtt, tööriistad, toit või ilm, Material Design "
"Iconsist. Otsi nime järgi, näiteks \"arrow\" või \"recycle\". Nimed ja "
"kategooriad pärinevad ikoonikomplektist ja on inglise keeles, nii et otsing "
"on samuti inglise keeles. Otsingu kõrval olev loend näitab ühte kategooriat; "
"[[ui:Recently used]] näitab viimati valitud sümboleid. Kategooria \"Brand / "
"Logo\" ja muud kaubamärke näitavad ikoonid on välja jäetud."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Size]] 0 fills the label height, otherwise the symbol has this height."
msgstr "[[ui:Size]] 0 täidab sildi kõrguse, muidu on sümbolil see kõrgus."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid "[[ui:Rotation]]: a quarter turn at a time, clockwise."
msgstr "[[ui:Rotation]]: veerandpööre korraga, päripäeva."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"The colour is printed on colour and office printers. Black-and-white label "
"printers print symbols in black, or in white if the colour is light, with "
"sharp edges."
msgstr ""
"Värv prinditakse värvi- ja kontoriprinteritel. Mustvalged sildiprinterid "
"prindivad sümbolid mustana või valgena, kui värv on hele, teravate servadega."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"The label file keeps the outline of each symbol, so a label looks the same "
"in later versions. Older versions of Tavletta cannot open labels with "
"symbols and say that the label needs a newer version."
msgstr ""
"Sildifail säilitab iga sümboli kontuuri, nii et silt näeb hilisemates "
"versioonides sama välja. Tavletta vanemad versioonid ei saa sümbolitega "
"silte avada ja ütlevad, et silt vajab uuemat versiooni."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Texts and codes can contain [variables](#variables), e.g. a date or a "
"running number."
msgstr ""
"Tekstid ja koodid võivad sisaldada [muutujaid](#variables), nt kuupäeva või "
"jooksvat numbrit."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Label"
msgstr "Silt"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid "Endless tape:"
msgstr "Lõpmatu lint:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Automatic length]]: the label is as long as its content. Off: fixed "
"[[ui:Length]], content aligned and scaled down if needed."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Automatic length]]: silt on sisu pikkune. Väljas: kindel [[ui:Length]], "
"sisu joondatud ja vajadusel vähendatud."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid "For every label:"
msgstr "Iga sildi jaoks:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid "[[ui:Spacing]]: space at the ends and between elements."
msgstr "[[ui:Spacing]]: ruum otstes ja elementide vahel."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid "[[ui:Edge spacing]]: extra space along the label edges."
msgstr "[[ui:Edge spacing]]: lisaruum piki sildi servi."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Background colour]], [[ui:Background image]]: printed edge to edge."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Background colour]], [[ui:Background image]]: prinditakse servast "
"servani."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Border]]: width, 0 = none; always inside the safety margin.  "
"[[ui:Border style]]: [[ui:Corner radius]], [[ui:Line style]] (also double) "
"and [[ui:Inset]]."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Border]]: laius, 0 = puudub; alati ohutusvaru sees. [[ui:Border "
"style]]: [[ui:Corner radius]], [[ui:Line style]] (ka kahekordne) ja "
"[[ui:Inset]]."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Units]]: millimetres or inches, by default from the system language."
msgstr "[[ui:Units]]: millimeetrid või tollid, vaikimisi süsteemi keelest."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid "Die-cut labels have a fixed size instead of a length:"
msgstr "Lõigatud siltidel on pikkuse asemel kindel suurus:"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"![Die-cut label](media/die-cut.png#only-light)  ![Die-cut label](media/die-"
"cut-dark.png#only-dark)"
msgstr ""
"![Lõigatud silt](media/die-cut.png#only-light)  ![Lõigatud silt](media/die-"
"cut-dark.png#only-dark)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Label size]]: a common size, or [[ui:Custom size]] with [[ui:Width]] "
"(across the roll) and [[ui:Height]] (along the roll), as on the label box."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Label size]]: tavaline suurus või [[ui:Custom size]] koos [[ui:Width]] "
"(üle rulli) ja [[ui:Height]] (piki rulli), nagu sildikarbil."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Gap]]: space between two labels on the roll, usually 2 to 3 mm.  Before "
"printing Tavletta compares height and gap with the distance the printer "
"measured."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Gap]]: ruum kahe sildi vahel rullil, tavaliselt 2-3 mm. Enne printimist "
"võrdleb Tavletta kõrgust ja vahet printeri mõõdetud kaugusega."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Content direction]]: [[ui:Across the roll]] for labels read with the "
"roll running from top to bottom, [[ui:Along the roll]] like on tape."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Content direction]]: [[ui:Across the roll]] siltidele, mida loetakse "
"rulli jooksmisel ülevalt alla, [[ui:Along the roll]] nagu lindil."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Alignment]]: where the content sits if it is shorter than the label."
msgstr "[[ui:Alignment]]: kus sisu asub, kui see on sildist lühem."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Safety margin]] (printer setting, default 1.5 mm): content and border "
"keep this distance from the label edges. Printers lose a little at the "
"edges, and long labels can run slightly askew. If text is cut off at the "
"edge, increase it."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Safety margin]] (printeri seade, vaikimisi 1,5 mm): sisu ja ääris "
"hoiavad selle kauguse sildi servadest. Printerid kaotavad servades veidi ja "
"pikad sildid võivad minna veidi viltu. Kui tekst on servast ära lõigatud, "
"suurenda seda."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Shipping labels"
msgstr "Saatesildid"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Carriers and marketplaces send shipping labels as a PDF or an image, often "
"an A4 page with the label in one half or quarter and a receipt or "
"instructions next to it. [[ui:Shipping label…]] in the main menu (or a PDF "
"dropped onto the window) opens such a file and makes a new label of it."
msgstr ""
"Vedajad ja turuplatsid saadavad saatesildid PDF-i või pildina, sageli A4 "
"lehena, kus silt on poolel või veerandil ja kviitung või juhised kõrval. "
"[[ui:Shipping label…]] peamenüüs (või aknasse lohistatud PDF) avab sellise "
"faili ja teeb sellest uue sildi."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Tavletta looks for the label on the page: a large area with the shape of a "
"label, best with a printed frame and a barcode; a page with one label "
"filling it is taken whole. Check the selection: drag it, drag its edges, or "
"draw a new one. [[ui:Next suggestion]] shows other areas that could be the "
"label, [[ui:Whole page]] selects all of it."
msgstr ""
"Tavletta otsib lehelt silti: suur sildi kujuga ala, kõige parem prinditud "
"raami ja vöötkoodiga; leht, mille täidab üks silt, võetakse tervikuna. "
"Kontrolli valikut: lohista seda, lohista selle servi või joonista uus. "
"[[ui:Next suggestion]] näitab teisi alasid, mis võiksid olla silt, "
"[[ui:Whole page]] valib kogu lehe."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid "[[ui:Page]]: the page of a PDF with several pages."
msgstr "[[ui:Page]]: mitmeleheküljelise PDF-i leht."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Label size]]: 4 × 6 in (101.6 × 152.4 mm), 100 × 150 mm, 100 × 200 mm, "
"a 62 mm roll that is as long as the label needs, or A6 and A4 paper on the "
"system printer. Only sizes the printer can print are offered; on endless "
"tape the label runs along the tape."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Label size]]: 4 × 6 tolli (101,6 × 152,4 mm), 100 × 150 mm, 100 × 200 "
"mm, 62 mm rull, mis on sama pikk kui silt vajab, või A6 ja A4 paber "
"süsteemiprinteril. Pakutakse ainult suurusi, mida printer saab printida; "
"lõpmatul lindil jookseb silt piki linti."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"A label printed sideways on the page is turned upright for the size; "
"[[ui:Rotate left]] and [[ui:Rotate right]] turn it by hand."
msgstr ""
"Küljele prinditud silt pööratakse suuruse jaoks püstiseks; [[ui:Rotate "
"left]] ja [[ui:Rotate right]] pööravad seda käsitsi."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Scale]]: [[ui:Whole area, centred]] keeps all of the area, [[ui:Fill "
"the label, edges cut off]] fills the label completely."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Scale]]: [[ui:Whole area, centred]] säilitab kogu ala, [[ui:Fill the "
"label, edges cut off]] täidab sildi täielikult."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"[[ui:Create label]] replaces the open label. The area stays an element of "
"the label: [[ui:Area]] in its row opens the selection again."
msgstr ""
"[[ui:Create label]] asendab avatud sildi. Ala jääb sildi elemendiks: "
"[[ui:Area]] selle real avab valiku uuesti."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"A PDF page is drawn right at the resolution it is printed at, without "
"smoothing: bars and text come out as whole dots, so barcodes stay readable. "
"Lines thinner than a dot are printed at least one dot wide (sometimes two), "
"and in black even if they are light grey or coloured; white lines thinner "
"than a dot on black may vanish. Label printers get the label at their own "
"resolution. The system printer gets it without loss: as PWG Raster drawn at "
"the printer's resolution, or as a PDF drawn at 300 dpi, which a printer of "
"another resolution scales itself (on a 203 dpi printer the edges of bars may "
"then soften: check that the barcode scans).  Only printers that take nothing "
"but JPEG get a compressed copy."
msgstr ""
"PDF-i leht joonistatakse õigesti printimise eraldusvõimega, silumata: "
"triibud ja tekst tulevad täispunktidena, nii et vöötkoodid jäävad loetavaks. "
"Punktist õhemad jooned prinditakse vähemalt ühe punkti laiuselt (mõnikord "
"kahe) ja mustana, isegi kui need on heledad hallid või värvilised; mustal "
"punktist õhemad valged jooned võivad kaduda. Sildiprinterid saavad sildi oma "
"eraldusvõimega. Süsteemiprinter saab selle kadudeta: PWG Rasterina printeri "
"eraldusvõimega joonistatult või PDF-ina, mis on joonistatud 300 dpi-ga ja "
"mida teise eraldusvõimega printer ise skaleerib (203 dpi printeril võivad "
"triipude servad siis pehmeneda: kontrolli, et vöötkood skaneerub). Ainult "
"printerid, mis võtavad vastu vaid JPEG-i, saavad tihendatud koopia."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Images are enlarged by repeating pixels, evenly only by whole multiples "
"(otherwise some pixels come out one dot wider than others); reduced, the "
"pixels that fall together are averaged into grey."
msgstr ""
"Pilte suurendatakse pikslite kordamisega, ühtlaselt ainult täisarvuliste "
"kordadega (muidu tulevad mõned pikslid ühe punkti võrra laiemad kui teised); "
"vähendamisel keskmistatakse kokku langevad pikslid halliks."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"On black-and-white printers the area is looked at piece by piece. Where it "
"is black and white but for grey edges (barcodes and text, also from a scan "
"with grey ink on grey paper), it is cut at the middle between its own black "
"and white, so bars keep clean edges; images are enlarged smoothly for this, "
"so the edges fall between the pixels of the scan.  Where it has grey of its "
"own (a grey logo, grey text down to light grey, a shaded band), the grey is "
"printed as a dot pattern; black text on it gets a narrow edge of paper so "
"that it stays readable. A scan or photo of a label should have at least 150 "
"dpi; at 100 dpi only a clean one keeps all its bars."
msgstr ""
"Mustvalgetel printeritel vaadeldakse ala tükkhaaval. Kus see on mustvalge "
"peale hallide servade (vöötkoodid ja tekst, ka halli tindiga halli paberi "
"skannist), lõigatakse see oma musta ja valge keskel, nii et triibud "
"säilitavad puhtad servad; pilte suurendatakse selleks sujuvalt, nii et "
"servad jäävad skanni pikslite vahele. Kus sellel on oma halli (hall logo, "
"hall tekst kuni heleda hallini, varjutatud riba), prinditakse hall "
"punktimustrina; sellel olev must tekst saab kitsa paberiääre, et see jääks "
"loetavaks. Sildi skannil või fotol peaks olema vähemalt 150 dpi; 100 dpi "
"juures säilitab kõik triibud ainult puhas."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"The label file keeps the whole page the area was taken from, also outside "
"the area (addresses, tracking numbers). Of a PDF with several pages only the "
"chosen page is kept if it can be copied unchanged, otherwise the whole "
"document (the dialog then says so). Unchanged is strict: a copy that differs "
"by more than rounding anywhere, even by a few dots, is not used; pages with "
"embedded fonts that are drawn slightly differently when copied (TeX, for "
"example) keep the whole document. Of a TIFF with several pages only the "
"chosen page is kept."
msgstr ""
"Sildifail säilitab kogu lehe, millest ala võeti, ka ala väliselt (aadressid, "
"jälgimisnumbrid). Mitmeleheküljelisest PDF-ist säilitatakse ainult valitud "
"leht, kui seda saab muutmata kopeerida, muidu kogu dokument (dialoog ütleb "
"seda siis). Muutmata on range: koopiat, mis erineb kuskil rohkem kui "
"ümardusega, isegi mõne punkti võrra, ei kasutata; lehed manustatud "
"fontidega, mis kopeerimisel joonistuvad veidi teisiti (näiteks TeX), "
"säilitavad kogu dokumendi. Mitmeleheküljelisest TIFF-ist säilitatakse ainult "
"valitud leht."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Opening PDF files needs Poppler (poppler-glib); the Flatpak brings it along, "
"otherwise install it from your distribution (package names: [docs/install.md]"
"(https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/branch/main/docs/"
"install.md)).  Older versions of Tavletta refuse to open labels with a "
"shipping label and say that the label needs a newer version."
msgstr ""
"PDF-failide avamine vajab Popplerit (poppler-glib); Flatpak toob selle "
"kaasa, muidu paigalda see oma distributsioonist (pakettide nimed: [docs/"
"install.md](https://git.joshuahirsig.xyz/joshii/tavletta/src/branch/main/"
"docs/install.md)). Tavletta vanemad versioonid keelduvad saatesildiga "
"siltide avamisest ja ütlevad, et silt vajab uuemat versiooni."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Most shipping label rolls are direct thermal labels: they need no ribbon, "
"but the print fades in heat and sunlight within months. That is fine for a "
"parcel on its way; for labels that must last, use thermal transfer labels "
"with a ribbon."
msgstr ""
"Enamik saatesildirulle on otsetermosildid: need ei vaja värvilinti, kuid "
"print tuhmub kuumuses ja päikesevalguses kuude jooksul. See sobib teel "
"olevale pakile; kauasäilivate siltide jaoks kasuta termosiire silte "
"värvilindiga."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"![Print dialog](media/print.png#only-light)  ![Print dialog](media/print-"
"dark.png#only-dark)"
msgstr ""
"![Printimisdialoog](media/print.png#only-light)  ![Printimisdialoog](media/"
"print-dark.png#only-dark)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid "[[ui:Copies]]: number of labels."
msgstr "[[ui:Copies]]: siltide arv."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"The print dialog only shows what the printer can do; the options of each "
"printer are listed under [Printers](printer.md). Printers without such "
"options print with the settings made on the printer itself."
msgstr ""
"Printimisdialoog näitab ainult seda, mida printer oskab; iga printeri "
"valikud on loetletud jaotises [Printerid](printer.md). Ilma selliste "
"valikuteta printerid prindivad printeril endal tehtud seadetega."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid "[[ui:Export PNG…]] saves the label as image."
msgstr "[[ui:Export PNG…]] salvestab sildi pildina."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Variables { #variables }"
msgstr "Muutujad { #variables }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Variables are filled in when printing, in texts and in the content of codes. "
"[[ui:Insert variable]] next to the text or the content offers the common "
"ones; type the others."
msgstr ""
"Muutujad täidetakse printimisel, tekstides ja koodide sisus. [[ui:Insert "
"variable]] teksti või sisu kõrval pakub tavalisi; tipi teised."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Variable | Result |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `{=date}` | today, as the system language writes dates |\n"
"| `{=date:%d.%m.%Y}` | today in a format of your own, e.g. 31.12.2026 |\n"
"| `{=date+30d}` | in 30 days, e.g. \"best before\"; also `w` (weeks), `m` (months), `y` (years), `h` (hours), combined like `{=date+1m-1d}` |\n"
"| `{=time}`, `{=time:%H:%M}` | the time |\n"
"| `{=counter}` | a running number |\n"
"| `{=counter:0001}` | with leading zeros, as many digits as the pattern |\n"
"| `{=copy}`, `{=copies}` | number of this copy and of all copies |\n"
"| `{=id}`, `{=id:12}` | a short random ID, 8 characters by default |\n"
"| `{=uuid}` | a random UUID |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Muutuja | Tulemus |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `{=date}` | täna, nagu süsteemi keel kuupäevi kirjutab |\n"
"| `{=date:%d.%m.%Y}` | täna oma vormingus, nt 31.12.2026 |\n"
"| `{=date+30d}` | 30 päeva pärast, nt \"parim enne\"; ka `w` (nädalad), `m` (kuud), `y` (aastad), `h` (tunnid), kombineeritult nagu `{=date+1m-1d}` |\n"
"| `{=time}`, `{=time:%H:%M}` | kellaaeg |\n"
"| `{=counter}` | jooksev number |\n"
"| `{=counter:0001}` | eesnullidega, nii palju numbreid kui mustris |\n"
"| `{=copy}`, `{=copies}` | selle koopia ja kõigi koopiate number |\n"
"| `{=id}`, `{=id:12}` | lühike juhuslik ID, vaikimisi 8 märki |\n"
"| `{=uuid}` | juhuslik UUID |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Formats use the letters of [strftime](https://docs.python.org/3/library/"
"datetime.html#format-codes): `%d` day, `%m` month, `%Y` year, `%H:%M` hours "
"and minutes, `%B` the name of the month."
msgstr ""
"Vormingud kasutavad [strftime'i](https://docs.python.org/3/library/"
"datetime.html#format-codes) tähti: `%d` päev, `%m` kuu, `%Y` aasta, `%H:%M` "
"tunnid ja minutid, `%B` kuu nimi."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"The counter goes up with every printed label, also from copy to copy: 5 "
"copies get 5 numbers. Set the [[ui:Next number]] and the [[ui:Step]] in the "
"[[ui:Counter]] group below the content; it appears once a text uses the "
"counter. After printing the label remembers the next number: save it to keep "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Loendur kasvab iga prinditud sildiga, ka koopiast koopiasse: 5 koopiat "
"saavad 5 numbrit. Sea [[ui:Next number]] ja [[ui:Step]] rühmas "
"[[ui:Counter]] sisu all; see ilmub, kui tekst kasutab loendurit. Pärast "
"printimist jätab silt järgmise numbri meelde: salvesta see, et see säiliks."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"On one label every variable has one value: a counter or an ID used in the "
"text and in the QR code is the same number. The preview shows the values the "
"next print uses."
msgstr ""
"Ühel sildil on igal muutujal üks väärtus: tekstis ja QR-koodis kasutatud "
"loendur või ID on sama number. Eelvaade näitab väärtusi, mida järgmine "
"printimine kasutab."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"To print a brace, double it: `{{=date}}` prints `{=date}`. Texts without "
"variables print exactly as typed, unless the label has a data file for "
"[serial labels](serial.md): then `{{` and `}}` always print one brace."
msgstr ""
"Looksulu printimiseks kahekordista see: `{{=date}}` prindib `{=date}`. "
"Muutujateta tekstid prinditakse täpselt nii, nagu tipitud, kui sildil pole "
"[seeriasiltide](serial.md) andmefaili: siis prindivad `{{` ja `}}` alati ühe "
"looksulu."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Dates and times are in the computer's time zone. `+1d` keeps the time of "
"day, also when summer time starts or ends; `+2h` counts real hours. `%z` and "
"`%Z` give the offset and the name of the time zone."
msgstr ""
"Kuupäevad ja kellaajad on arvuti ajavööndis. `+1d` säilitab kellaaja, ka "
"suveaja algamisel või lõppemisel; `+2h` loeb tegelikke tunde. `%z` ja `%Z` "
"annavad nihke ja ajavööndi nime."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"A label with variables or a counter needs this version of Tavletta or a "
"newer one: older versions refuse to open it instead of printing `{=date}` as "
"it is."
msgstr ""
"Silt muutujate või loendurita vajab Tavletta seda või uuemat versiooni: "
"vanemad versioonid keelduvad selle avamisest, selle asemel et printida "
"`{=date}` sellisena, nagu see on."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Command line { #command-line }"
msgstr "Käsurida { #command-line }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"`tavletta print` prints a saved label without opening a window, also on a "
"computer without a screen:"
msgstr ""
"`tavletta print` prindib salvestatud sildi ilma akent avamata, ka arvutis "
"ilma ekraanita:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"tavletta print label.tavletta\n"
"tavletta print label.tavletta --copies 5 --counter-start 100\n"
"tavletta print label.tavletta --set title=\"Batch 7\" --set lot=A12\n"
"tavletta print label.tavletta --printer system --host ipp://printer.local/ipp/print\n"
"tavletta print label.tavletta --copies 3 --dry-run --output preview.png\n"
"tavletta print shelf.tavletta --data items.csv --rows 3-10\n"
"tavletta list-printers\n"
"tavletta --version\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Without `--host` Tavletta uses the printer set in the app, or the only one "
"it finds on the network. `tavletta list-printers` shows model, address and "
"name of each printer found."
msgstr ""
"Ilma `--host` kasutab Tavletta rakenduses seatud printerit või ainsat, mille "
"see võrgust leiab. `tavletta list-printers` näitab iga leitud printeri "
"mudelit, aadressi ja nime."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"`--set NAME=VALUE` replaces the text of the element with that [[ui:Name for "
"the command line]] (in the element's settings), or fills in a variable of "
"your own: `{=lot}` in the label, `--set lot=A12` when printing; a name may "
"use letters of any language. Variables in a new text are filled in; `--set-"
"literal NAME=VALUE` takes the value as it is. `--set date=2026-12-31` prints "
"with another date."
msgstr ""
"`--set NAME=VALUE` asendab selle elemendi teksti, millel on see [[ui:Name "
"for the command line]] (elemendi seadetes), või täidab oma muutuja: `{=lot}` "
"sildil, `--set lot=A12` printimisel; nimes võib kasutada mis tahes keele "
"tähti. Uue teksti muutujad täidetakse; `--set-literal NAME=VALUE` võtab "
"väärtuse sellisena, nagu see on. `--set date=2026-12-31` prindib teise "
"kuupäevaga."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"With a counter the next number is saved in the label file after printing, "
"also when the printer fails half-way or the print is stopped with Ctrl+C. If "
"the file cannot be written, nothing is printed; `--no-save-counter` prints "
"anyway and saves nothing, so the next print repeats the numbers. The label "
"file is locked while printing: a second `tavletta print` of the same file "
"waits. The window reads the saved number again before printing and saving."
msgstr ""
"Loenduriga salvestatakse järgmine number pärast printimist sildifaili, ka "
"kui printer ebaõnnestub poole peal või printimine peatatakse klahviga "
"Ctrl+C. Kui faili ei saa kirjutada, ei prindita midagi; `--no-save-counter` "
"prindib siiski ja ei salvesta midagi, nii et järgmine printimine kordab "
"numbreid. Sildifail on printimise ajal lukustatud: sama faili teine "
"`tavletta print` ootab. Aken loeb salvestatud numbri enne printimist ja "
"salvestamist uuesti."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"It prints with the choices last made in the app for that printer model: cut, "
"colours, quality, chain printing, high resolution, tape feed, the printer "
"settings and [[ui:Print outlines]] on a label sheet.  `--printer-defaults` "
"takes the model's defaults for these instead (no outlines); the printer's "
"address and the [[ui:Safety margin]] stay as set in the app."
msgstr ""
"See prindib valikutega, mis tehti rakenduses viimati selle printerimudeli "
"jaoks: lõikamine, värvid, kvaliteet, ketiprintimine, kõrge eraldusvõime, "
"lindi söötmine, printeriseaded ja [[ui:Print outlines]] sildilehel. `--"
"printer-defaults` võtab nende asemel mudeli vaikeväärtused (ilma "
"kontuurideta); printeri aadress ja [[ui:Safety margin]] jäävad rakenduses "
"seatuks."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"`--print-method printer|transfer|direct` sets the [[ui:Print method]] of a "
"thermal printer that has it for this print (as set on the printer, with a "
"ribbon, thermal direct), also with `--printer-defaults`."
msgstr ""
"`--print-method printer|transfer|direct` seab termoprinteri [[ui:Print "
"method]], millel see on, selle printimise jaoks (nagu printerisse seatud, "
"värvilindiga, otsetermo), ka koos `--printer-defaults`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"A roll whose label distance, as the printer measured it, is not the label's "
"height plus [[ui:Gap]], or whose label size is not the label's (Brother QL "
"with DK labels), gets a hint, as in the window; the label is printed anyway."
msgstr ""
"Rull, mille siltide vahekaugus printeri mõõdetuna ei ole sildi kõrgus pluss "
"[[ui:Gap]] või mille sildi suurus ei ole sildi oma (Brother QL DK-"
"siltidega), saab vihje nagu aknas; silt prinditakse siiski."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Some printers are asked before the label is drawn, because it depends on "
"what they report (the tape, the resolution), a Brother QL with DK labels for "
"the hint above (the labels loaded); a printer that does not answer within 5 "
"s (2 s for `--dry-run`) gets the label drawn without.  A question still on "
"its way then gets up to 10 s more to end before the label is sent (Tavletta "
"says so); an answer in that time is used.  `--no-query` skips the question."
msgstr ""
"Mõnelt printerilt küsitakse enne sildi joonistamist, sest see sõltub "
"sellest, mida nad teatavad (lint, eraldusvõime), Brother QL-ilt DK-siltidega "
"ülaltoodud vihje jaoks (laaditud sildid); printer, mis ei vasta 5 sekundi "
"jooksul (2 sekundit valikuga `--dry-run`), saab sildi joonistatud ilma "
"selleta. Veel teel olev küsimus saab siis kuni 10 sekundit lisaaega enne "
"sildi saatmist lõpuni jõudmiseks (Tavletta ütleb seda); selle aja jooksul "
"saadud vastust kasutatakse. `--no-query` jätab küsimuse vahele."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Serial labels: one label for each row of the data file, `--copies` of each; "
"`--data` gives the data file (by default the label's own, if it lies in the "
"label's folder), `--sheet` the sheet, `--rows` the rows (`3-10`, `5`, `7-` "
"to the last). The counter goes on from row to row.  A placeholder without a "
"column or a code a row cannot make stops the print before the first label. "
"See [Serial labels](serial.md)."
msgstr ""
"Seeriasildid: üks silt andmefaili iga rea kohta, `--copies` igaüht; `--data` "
"annab andmefaili (vaikimisi sildi enda, kui see asub sildi kaustas), `--"
"sheet` lehe, `--rows` read (`3-10`, `5`, `7-` viimaseni). Loendur jätkab "
"reast reale. Kohatäide ilma veeruta või kood, mida rida teha ei saa, peatab "
"printimise enne esimest silti. Vaata [Seeriasildid](serial.md)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"`--dry-run` only checks and renders: it lists the texts of each label; `--"
"output file.png` saves each label as [[ui:Export PNG…]] does: as printed, on "
"the whole tape, at most 600 dpi like the preview (a large page coarser), "
"with its resolution (`file-1.png`, `file-2.png` … if they differ; `-` writes "
"the first to standard output). The first label is also drawn as the printer "
"would get it. With `--output` every label is drawn, and a code that does not "
"fit stops the dry run (exit code 4); without it the labels after the first "
"are not drawn: their columns and codes are checked, not whether a code fits."
msgstr ""
"`--dry-run` ainult kontrollib ja renderdab: see loetleb iga sildi tekstid; "
"`--output file.png` salvestab iga sildi nagu [[ui:Export PNG…]]: nii nagu "
"prinditud, kogu lindil, kuni 600 dpi nagu eelvaade (suur leht jämedamalt), "
"oma eraldusvõimega (`file-1.png`, `file-2.png` … kui need erinevad; `-` "
"kirjutab esimese standardväljundisse). Esimene silt joonistatakse ka nii, "
"nagu printer selle saaks. Valikuga `--output` joonistatakse iga silt ja "
"kood, mis ei mahu, peatab kuivkäivituse (väljumiskood 4); ilma selleta "
"pärast esimest olevaid silte ei joonistata: nende veerge ja koode "
"kontrollitakse, mitte seda, kas kood mahub."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Exit codes: 0 printed, 1 printer problem or no printer found, 2 wrong "
"arguments, 3 label file cannot be read, still locked by another print or "
"output not written, 4 the label cannot be printed (empty, unknown or "
"unclosed variable, date before the year 1 or after 9999, unknown column, a "
"code a row cannot make), 5 the counter cannot be saved (nothing printed; or "
"printed, but saving failed), 130 interrupted."
msgstr ""
"Väljumiskoodid: 0 prinditud, 1 printeri probleem või printerit ei leitud, 2 "
"valed argumendid, 3 sildifaili ei saa lugeda, see on veel teise printimise "
"lukustatud või väljundit ei kirjutatud, 4 silti ei saa printida (tühi, "
"tundmatu või sulgemata muutuja, kuupäev enne aastat 1 või pärast 9999, "
"tundmatu veerg, kood, mida rida teha ei saa), 5 loendurit ei saa salvestada "
"(midagi ei prinditud; või prinditud, kuid salvestamine ebaõnnestus), 130 "
"katkestatud."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"In the Flatpak the label file has to be handed over with `--file-"
"forwarding`, a data file too (each between `@@`; the label's own data file "
"is only reached when handed over); write images to standard output:"
msgstr ""
"Flatpakis tuleb sildifail üle anda valikuga `--file-forwarding`, ka "
"andmefail (kumbki märkide `@@` vahel; sildi enda andmefailile pääseb ligi "
"ainult üleandmisel); kirjuta pildid standardväljundisse:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/use.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"flatpak run --file-forwarding xyz.joshuahirsig.Tavletta print @@ label.tavletta @@\n"
"flatpak run --file-forwarding xyz.joshuahirsig.Tavletta print @@ label.tavletta @@ --data @@ rows.csv @@\n"
"flatpak run --file-forwarding xyz.joshuahirsig.Tavletta print --dry-run --output - @@ label.tavletta @@ > preview.png\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"A file handed over this way is reached through the document portal. The next "
"counter value is written there like any save, but the portal may not support "
"locking the file: two prints of the same file at the same moment are then "
"not kept apart. If the portal refuses to write, nothing is printed (exit "
"code 5)."
msgstr ""
"Nii üle antud failile pääseb ligi dokumendiportaali kaudu. Järgmine loenduri "
"väärtus kirjutatakse sinna nagu iga salvestus, kuid portaal ei pruugi "
"toetada faili lukustamist: sama faili kaks samaaegset printimist ei hoita "
"siis lahus. Kui portaal keeldub kirjutamast, ei prindita midagi "
"(väljumiskood 5)."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/use.md
msgid ""
"Writing the counter back through the document portal has not been tried yet. "
"After the first print from the Flatpak, open the label and check that "
"[[ui:Next number]] went on; if not, give the start with `--counter-start` on "
"every print."
msgstr ""
"Loenduri tagasikirjutamist dokumendiportaali kaudu pole veel proovitud. "
"Pärast esimest printimist Flatpakist ava silt ja kontrolli, et [[ui:Next "
"number]] jätkus; kui mitte, anna algus valikuga `--counter-start` igal "
"printimisel."
